{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-0e557fc7", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2401.07090 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2401.07090 defines 16 object selection requirements. Here are the details:\n\n- At least one of the two electrons must be a PF electron; both electrons required to have |η| < 2.4\n- B+ candidate invariant mass in range 5.0-5.6 GeV (muon channel) / 4.7-5.7 GeV (electron channel)\n- B+ candidate transverse momentum > 3 GeV (muon channel) / > 1.75 GeV (electron channel)\n- Common vertex fit of the two electron candidates, used to compute |d3D(K+, e+e-)| \n- HLT muon pT > 9 GeV and impact parameter significance IPsig > 6 (single HLT path used for muon channel analysis)\n- High-purity track quality criteria with pT > 1 GeV and |η| < 2.4\n- Implicit minimum electron pT of 2 GeV from PF reconstruction\n- L1 muon with |η| < 1.5 and a variable minimum pT threshold\n- LP electrons reconstructed down to pT of 1 GeV\n- Loose requirements on SV fit probability, Lxy/σ_xy, and cos(α_2D(B+))\n- Muon triggering the event readout must pass the medium muon identification criteria\n- Opposite sign with respect to the triggering muon, medium muon identification, pT > 2 GeV, |η| < 2.4\n- PV chosen as the collision vertex with z position closest to the point of closest approach of the trigger muon to the beam line; electron candidates must be consistent with originating from this PV\n- Positively charged track (kaon mass assigned) combined with an OS same-flavor lepton pair with invariant mass below 5 GeV to form the B+ candidate\n- Single-muon L1 trigger with pT > 22 GeV over |η| < 2.4\n\nThese requirements are documented in the paper with the arXiv ID 2401.07090.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2401.07090 defines 16 object selection requirements. These include criteria for electron and muon identification, invariant mass ranges, transverse momentum thresholds, and other selection criteria.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.07090"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0112ef394e5df4ac643f2b1e", "hepkg:evidence:09b14e3812368a08723736ea", "hepkg:evidence:21b8be8f1ace47fe5f80b923", "hepkg:evidence:392d3382ad025b23d8c1d075", "hepkg:evidence:3b7c9acb2eea64c7cd9de4c0", "hepkg:evidence:4d168fa3dde06987d2af11a9", "hepkg:evidence:7da5a98a46ca36b865f7e8cb", "hepkg:evidence:e049882fea07ce5c4f83c703", "hepkg:evidence:ee645e0e143abcd1d8b1cbf0", "hepkg:evidence:ef089e84ac0967eb608dcc61", "hepkg:evidence:f7980e5f47ac0e2618c7237d"], "seen_values": ["1", "1.5", "1.75", "2", "2.4", "22", "2401.0709", "2401.07090", "3", "4.7", "5", "5.0", "5.6", "5.7", "6", "9", "alpha_2d", "analysis", "and", "approach", "assigned", "beam", "below", "both", "candidate", "candidates", "channel", "charged", "chosen", "closest", "collision", "combined", "common", "compute", "consistent", "cos", "criteria", "d3d", "down", "electron", "electrons", "eta", "event", "fit", "for", "form", "from", "gev", "have", "high-purity", "hlt", "identification", "impact", "implicit", "invariant", "ipsig", "kaon", "least", "lepton", "line", "loose", "lxy", "mass", "medium", "minimum", "momentum", "muon", "must", "none", "object_has_selection", "one", "opposite", "originating", "over", "pair", "parameter", "pass", "path", "point", "position", "positively", "probability", "quality", "range", "readout", "reconstructed", "reconstruction", "required", "requirements", "respect", "same-flavor", "sigma_xy", "sign", "significance", "single", "single-muon", "the", "this", "threshold", "track", "transverse", "trigger", "triggering", "two", "used", "variable", "vertex", "with"], "verification_score": 0.9, "unsupported_claims": ["16"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7857, "completion_tokens": 571, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 26.689860488753766, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 26.689860488753766, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8428.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 0.9, "unsupported_claims": 1.0, "count_correct": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 0.0, "evidence_quotes": 11.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-0e84d553", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2509.22535 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2509.22535 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}$+>=2b background\n- $t\\bar{t}$+>=2c background\n- $t\\bar{t}$+b background\n- $t\\bar{t}$+c background\n- $t\\bar{t}$+light-flavor jets background\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ (minor background)\n- Single top quark production (minor background)\n- tWZ (minor background)\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated as part of the analysis reported in the paper 2509.22535.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2509.22535"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2509.22535"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:singletop_quark_production", "hepkg:process:tWZ_background", "hepkg:process:ttW_background", "hepkg:process:ttbar_plus_b", "hepkg:process:ttbar_plus_c", "hepkg:process:ttbar_plus_geq2b", "hepkg:process:ttbar_plus_geq2c", "hepkg:process:ttbar_plus_light"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:448c4f4ce3eb4a4adeb371d3", "hepkg:evidence:9ece0f43f6c75458af788fa7"], "seen_values": ["2", "2509.22535", "background", "bar", "hepkg:process:singletop_quark_production", "hepkg:process:ttbar_plus_b", "hepkg:process:ttbar_plus_c", "hepkg:process:ttbar_plus_geq2b", "hepkg:process:ttbar_plus_geq2c", "hepkg:process:ttbar_plus_light", "hepkg:process:ttw_background", "hepkg:process:twz_background", "jets", "light-flavor", "minor", "physics_process", "production", "quark", "result_estimates_background", "single", "top", "twz"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7366, "completion_tokens": 182, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 8.29291578195989