{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-101be7a1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2312.04450 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2312.04450 measures the following observables:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}Z$ spin-correlation strength parameter $f_{\\mathrm{SM}}$\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $H_{\\text{T}}^{\\ell}$ (3$\\ell$ channel)\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $H_{\\text{T}}^{\\ell}$ (4$\\ell$ channel)\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$ (3$\\ell$ channel)\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$ (4$\\ell$ channel)\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $\\cos\\theta^{*}_{Z}$\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $m^{t\\bar{t}Z}$\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $m^{t\\bar{t}}$\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $p_{\\text{T}}^{Z}$\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $p_{\\text{T}}^{\\ell,\\text{non-}Z}$ (3$\\ell$ channel)\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $p_{\\text{T}}^{t\\bar{t}}$\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $p_{\\text{T}}^{t}$\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $|\\Delta y(Z,t_{\\mathrm{lep}})|$ (3$\\ell$ channel)\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $|\\Delta\\Phi(Z,t_{\\mathrm{lep}})|/\\pi$ (3$\\ell$ channel)\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $|\\Delta\\Phi(\\ell^{+}_{t},\\ell^{-}_{\\bar{t}})|/\\pi$ (4$\\ell$ channel)\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $|\\Delta\\Phi(t\\bar{t},Z)|/\\pi$\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $|y^{Z}|$\n- Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $|y^{t\\bar{t}Z}|$\n- Inclusive $t\\bar{t}Z$ fiducial cross section (70<m_{f\\bar{f}}<110 GeV)\n\nThis list is based on the information recorded in the graph for this analysis.", "answere