{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-11fcd9f4", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2202.08676 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2202.08676 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- 2L1T MisID control region\n- 3L MisID e/mu control region\n- 3L OnZ control region\n- 3L WZ control region\n- 3L Zγ control region\n- 3L ttZ control region\n- 4-lepton ZZ control region\n- Advanced S_T table (model-independent SR scheme)\n- Combined BDT score distribution for four-lepton channels (4L, 3L1T, 2L2T, 1L3T)\n- Combined BDT score distribution for three-lepton channels (3L, 2L1T, 1L2T)\n- Fundamental L_T+pT^miss table (model-independent SR scheme)\n- Fundamental S_T table (model-independent SR scheme)\n\nThese regions are used to define the control and signal regions for the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2202.08676", "2401.05299", "2503.19420"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2202.08676"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:2l1t-misid-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-misid-emu-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-onz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-zgamma-cr", "hepkg:region:4l-zz-cr", "hepkg:region:advanced-st-table", "hepkg:region:bdt-3lepton-combined", "hepkg:region:bdt-4lepton-combined", "hepkg:region:fundamental-ltmet-table", "hepkg:region:fundamental-st-table"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:338c3e0938647fa57c918dd7", "hepkg:evidence:3615c7eb0b7dc87958b1f532", "hepkg:evidence:59a5549be911227f2aab3bf1", "hepkg:evidence:71cfba7582d348d24459c3f8", "hepkg:evidence:842e8fc5451409fca76f52d4", "hepkg:evidence:9cb1dab595215af5c770eb02", "hepkg:evidence:a30540a6081e93c6acce3630", "h