{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-13c5964c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which statistical methods does analysis 2511.11853 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2511.11853 uses the following statistical methods:\n\n- **ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation** using control regions in data with parametric fits.\n- **Asymptotic 95% CL limit setting (CLs method)**.\n- **CMS Combine statistical analysis tool (RooFit/RooStats-based)**.\n- **Chi-squared goodness-of-fit test** between ABCD prediction and observed data.\n- **Gaussian probability density function** for shape-affecting nuisance parameters.\n- **Log-normal functional fit** for background dilepton-mass shape/normalization.\n- **Log-normal probability density function** for rate-affecting nuisance parameters.\n- **Look-elsewhere effect correction** via MC pseudo-experiments (global significance).\n- **Simultaneous maximum likelihood fit** across data-taking years.\n\nThese methods are documented in the analysis as follows:\n\n- **ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation**: \"ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits.\"\n- **Asymptotic 95% CL limit setting (CLs method)**: \"Asymptotic 95% CL limit setting (CLs method).\"\n- **CMS Combine statistical analysis tool (RooFit/RooStats-based)**: \"CMS Combine statistical analysis tool (RooFit/RooStats-based).\"\n- **Chi-squared goodness-of-fit test**: \"Chi-squared goodness-of-fit test between ABCD prediction and observed data.\"\n- **Gaussian probability density function**: \"Gaussian probability density function for shape-affecting nuisance parameters.\"\n- **Log-normal functional fit**: \"Log-normal functional fit for background dilepton-mass shape/normalization.\"\n- **Log-normal probability density function**: \"Log-normal probability density function for rate-affecting nuisance parameters.\"\n- **Look-elsewhere effect correction**: \"Look-elsewhere effect correction via MC pseudo-experiments (global significance).\"\n- **Simultaneous maximum likelihood fit**: \"Simultaneous maximum likelihood fit across data-taking years.\"\n\nThis information is supported by the graph and the verbatim quotes from the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2511.11853"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs", "hepkg:stat:asymptotic_cls_95cl", "hepkg:stat:chi2_goodness_of_fit", "hepkg:stat:gaussian_nuisance_pdf", "hepkg:stat:lognormal_fit_function_background_shape", "hepkg:stat:lognormal_nuisance_pdf", "hepkg:stat:look_elsewhere_effect", "hepkg:stat:maximum_likelihood_fit", "hepkg:tool:combine_roofit_roostats"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:02f5b42dfcbc8506d2dab3e6", "hepkg:evidence:22b0da53f734349edf699574", "hepkg:evidence:6380a9baf663bbb34be8c86c", "hepkg:evidence:687c06bbbbad76134336e1e3", "hepkg:evidence:76250cc859d54e045e5650b5", "hepkg:evidence:7bbcf3b588b31ae30840a275", "hepkg:evidence:8a1de5b0eb2b8f908605c944", "hepkg:evidence:99e6b29fcbb76b4946cf0321"], "seen_values": ["2511.11853", "95", "abcd", "across", "analysis", "and", "asymptotic", "background", "background_method", "between", "chi-squared", "cls", "cms", "combine", "control", "correction", "data", "data-driven", "data-taking", "density", "dilepton-mass", "effect", "estimation", "fit", "fits", "for", "function", "functional", "gaussian", "global", "goodness-of-fit", "hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs", "hepkg:stat:asymptotic_cls_95cl", "hepkg:stat:chi2_goodness_of_fit", "hepkg:stat:gaussian_nuisance_pdf", "hepkg:stat:lognormal_fit_function_background_shape", "hepkg:stat:lognormal_nuisance_pdf", "hep