{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-13ce1116", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which background-estimation methods does analysis 2106.01676 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2106.01676 uses the following background-estimation methods:\n\n- Background-only fit (CRs only, no signal, floating WZ normalisation)\n- CLs prescription for 95% CL exclusion limits\n- Discovery fit for model-independent upper limits on new-physics cross section\n- Exclusion fit to set 95% CL exclusion limits on target SUSY models\n- Maximum-likelihood (profile likelihood) fit with Poisson/Gaussian terms and Beeston-Barlow-lite MC-stat nuisances\n- Profile likelihood method for computing local significance / p0\n- pyhf-based statistical combination of orthogonal signal regions (validated against HistFitter)\n\nThese methods are recorded in the graph as being used in this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2106.01676", "2211.08028", "2401.05299", "2407.10549"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2106.01676"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:background-only-fit", "hepkg:method:cls-prescription", "hepkg:method:discovery-fit", "hepkg:method:exclusion-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-significance", "hepkg:method:pyhf-combination"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:020c82de89c97a1c035062db", "hepkg:evidence:2df5dad6b27840ca7a77631c", "hepkg:evidence:4dad6ec409e4c0c319d558a0", "hepkg:evidence:5860955910567c8bb0f62bfc", "hepkg:evidence:5d9ffe33aa2a086cb7e57f32", "hepkg:evidence:655b13344ab651eae2a3beaa", "hepkg:evidence:6bc167218519e59b4b8d55e6", "hepkg:evidence:a98260b42da3c27d57ee9a75"], "seen_val