{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-147e8564", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2605.14245 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2605.14245 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- 10% nonresonant background normalization uncertainty in ggH+2jets categorization discriminants\n- Background analytic function choice uncertainty (discrete profiling)\n- Drell-Yan NLO vs LO simulation comparison shape uncertainty\n- ECAL upstream material modeling uncertainty\n- Integrated luminosity and jet energy correction correlation uncertainty across data-taking years\n- Jet energy scale and resolution uncertainty\n- NLO reweighting systematic uncertainty for VBF/VH JHUGen samples\n- Nonresonant background fit-to-data uncertainty in VH leptonic BDT distributions\n- PDF modelling uncertainty (CT14, MMHT2014 vs NNPDF3.0 replicas)\n- Per-photon energy resolution estimate uncertainty\n- Photon energy scale and resolution shape uncertainty\n- Photon identification uncertainty\n- Shower shape correction uncertainty\n- Trigger, preselection, lepton identification, MET, and pileup jet identification uncertainties", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873", "2012.01581", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2112.00895", "2208.12095", "2303.15340", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2605.14245"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:background_function_choice", "hepkg:systematic:drell_yan_nlo_lo_comparison", "hepkg:systematic:ecal_material_modeling", "hepkg:systematic:jet_energy_scale_resolution", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity_jec_correlation", "hepkg:systematic:nlo_reweighting_vbf_