{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-168dd4d8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2401.05299 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2401.05299 measures the following observables:\n\n- $R(t\\bar{t}W)=\\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{+})/\\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{-})$ charge ratio\n- $\\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{+})$ inclusive cross-section\n- $\\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{-})$ inclusive cross-section\n- Absolute differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{jet}}$\n- Absolute differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{lep}}$\n- Absolute differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$\n- Absolute differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $\\Delta R_{\\ell b,\\,\\textrm{lead}}$\n- Absolute differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $|\\Delta\\eta_{\\ell\\ell,\\,\\textrm{SS}}|$\n- Absolute differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $|\\Delta\\phi_{\\ell\\ell,\\,\\textrm{SS}}|$\n- Fiducial $t\\bar{t}W$ production cross-section\n- Inclusive $t\\bar{t}W$ production cross-section\n- Inclusive relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$\n- Normalised differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{jet}}$\n- Normalised differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{lep}}$\n- Normalised differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$\n- Normalised differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $\\Delta R_{\\ell b,\\,\\textrm{lead}}$\n- Normalised differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $|\\Delta\\eta_{\\ell\\ell,\\,\\textrm{SS}}|$\n- Normalised differential $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section vs $|\\Delta\\phi_{\\ell\\ell,\\,\\textrm{SS}}|$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{jet}}$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{lep}}$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $\\Delta R_{\\ell b,\\,\\textrm{lead}}$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $|\\Delta\\eta_{\\ell\\ell,\\,\\textrm{SS}}|$\n- Relative charge asymmetry $A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $|\\Delta\\phi_{\\ell\\ell,\\,\\textrm{SS}}|$\n\nThese observables cover a range of measurements related to the production and properties of $t\\bar{t}W$ events.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2401.05299 measures the following observables:\\n\\n-", "answered": true, "papers": ["2401.05299"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.05299"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:acrel-detall", "hepkg:observable:acrel-dphill", "hepkg:observable:acrel-drlb", "hepkg:observable:acrel-htjet", "hepkg:observable:acrel-htlep", "hepkg:observable:acrel-inclusive", "hepkg:observable:acrel-njets", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-detall-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-detall-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-dphill-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-dphill-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-drlb-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-drlb-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htjet-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htjet-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htlep-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htlep-norm", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-njets-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-njets-norm", "hepkg:observable:r-ttw", "hepkg:observable:ttw-fiducial-xsec", "hepkg:observable:ttw-inclusive-xsec", "hepkg:observable:ttw-minus-xsec", "hepkg:observable:ttw-plus-xsec"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:09e91a0dc2493a9be372dacd", "hepkg:evidence:0b91937542e85d4699cc6a91", "hepkg:evidence:28b617ec758d6187f7