{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-16e8373c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2004.14060 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2004.14060 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- $V$+jets ($W$/$Z$+jets) background MC sample\n- $tWZ$, $tZ$ background MC sample\n- $t\\bar{t}$ background MC sample\n- $t\\bar{t}+V$ background MC sample\n- $t\\bar{t}H$ background MC sample\n- Diboson (VV) background sample (WW, ZZ, WZ, WH, ZH incl. Higgs to diboson)\n- Leptoquark signal MC samples\n- SUSY (top squark) signal MC samples\n- Single top background MC sample\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various backgrounds and signals in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2106.01676", "2112.03161", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2402.08486", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.14060"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson", "hepkg:sample:leptoquark_signal", "hepkg:sample:singletop", "hepkg:sample:susy_signal", "hepkg:sample:tWZ_tZ", "hepkg:sample:ttH", "hepkg:sample:ttbarV", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_bkg", "hepkg:sample:vjets"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:4958322319b5b73c48614801", "hepkg:evidence:4eb22dad79174397130399f4"], "seen_values": ["2004.1406", "2004.14060", "background", "bar", "diboson", "hepkg:sample:diboson", "hepkg:sample:leptoquark_signal", "hepkg:sample:singletop", "hepkg:sample:susy_signal", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_bkg", "hepkg:sample:ttbarv", "hepkg:sample:tth", "hepkg:sample:twz_tz", "hepkg:sample:vjets", "higgs", "incl", "jets", "leptoquark", "result_uses_sample", "sample", "samples", "signal", "single", "squark", "susy", "top", "twz"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims