{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-170f0602", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many quantities does analysis 2207.12246 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2207.12246 reports 18 distinct quantities. These include various model parameters and measured values such as total cross-sections, elastic cross-sections, and integrated luminosity. \n\nHere are some examples of the reported quantities:\n- **Total cross-section (σ_tot)**: 104.68 mb\n- **Elastic cross-section (σ_el_obs)**: 27.8 mb\n- **Inelastic cross-section (σ_inel)**: 77.41 mb\n- **Integrated luminosity (L_int)**: 339.9 μb^-1\n\nEach quantity is supported by verbatim quotes from the paper. For instance, the total cross-section is reported as:\n```\n{\"central_value\":104.68,\"quantity\":\"sigma_tot\",\"uncertainties\":[{\"type\":\"experimental\",\"value\":1.08},{\"type\":\"theoretical\",\"value\":0.12}],\"unit\":\"mb\"}\n```\n\nThe full list of quantities can be found in the detailed results.\n\nAnswer: Analysis 2207.12246 reports 18 distinct quantities.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2207.12246 reports 18 distinct quantities. These include various model parameters and measured values such as total cross-sections, elastic cross-sections, and integrated luminosity. Each quantity is supported by verbatim quotes from the paper.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.12246"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.12246"], "predicate": "result_reports_quantity"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:model:bcbm", "hepkg:model:bjas", "hepkg:model:compete_hpr1r2", "hepkg:model:fmo", "hepkg:model:hegs", "hepkg:model:kmr"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:ev