{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-18e174a8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2408.03744 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2408.03744 measures the following observables:\n\n- Double ratio: fiducial (W+/W-) ratio at 13 TeV over 5.02 TeV\n- Double ratio: fiducial (W/Z) ratio at 13 TeV over 5.02 TeV\n- Double ratio: total (W+/W-) ratio at 13 TeV over 5.02 TeV\n- Double ratio: total (W/Z) ratio at 13 TeV over 5.02 TeV\n- Fiducial cross section ratio W+/W-\n- Fiducial cross section ratio W/Z\n- Fiducial inclusive cross section times branching fraction, W+ -> l+ nu\n- Fiducial inclusive cross section times branching fraction, W- -> l- nubar\n- Fiducial inclusive cross section times branching fraction, Z -> l+l- (60-120 GeV)\n- Fiducial inclusive cross section times branching fraction, inclusive W -> l nu\n- Ratio of fiducial W+ cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n- Ratio of fiducial W- cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n- Ratio of fiducial Z cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n- Ratio of fiducial inclusive W cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n- Ratio of total W+ cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n- Ratio of total W- cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n- Ratio of total Z cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n- Ratio of total inclusive W cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n- Total cross section ratio W+/W-\n- Total cross section ratio W/Z\n- Total inclusive cross section times branching fraction, W+ -> l+ nu\n- Total inclusive cross section times branching fraction, W- -> l- nubar\n- Total inclusive cross section times branching fraction, Z -> l+l- (60-120 GeV)\n- Total inclusive cross section times branching fraction, inclusive W -> l nu\n\nThis list is based on the information recorded in the graph for this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": [