{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-19e24f20", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2011.07812 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2011.07812 estimates 3 backgrounds:\n\n- Cosmic-ray muon background in SR-mumu\n- Fake and heavy-flavor-decay lepton background\n- Heavy-flavor lepton background in SR-mumu", "answered": true, "papers": ["2011.07812"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2011.07812"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:cosmic-ray-muons-mumu", "hepkg:background:fake-hf-leptons", "hepkg:background:heavy-flavor-mumu"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1c12d0f9236de3ede364a559", "hepkg:evidence:8e82060b6eb5e5a91a6dec56", "hepkg:evidence:91e1fc3564f57cac636478e8"], "seen_values": ["2011.07812", "and", "background", "cosmic-ray", "fake", "heavy-flavor", "heavy-flavor-decay", "hepkg:background:cosmic-ray-muons-mumu", "hepkg:background:fake-hf-leptons", "hepkg:background:heavy-flavor-mumu", "lepton", "muon", "result_estimates_background", "sr-mumu"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7055, "completion_tokens": 242, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 10.899864316917956, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 10.899864316917956, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7297.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 3.0, "evidence_quotes": 3.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-1a31d310", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2006.05880 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2006.05880 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- Control region CR^Z_VV for multi-boson background normalisation (3ℓ selection)\n- Control region CR^Z_ttZ for ttZ background normalisation (3ℓ selection)\n- Control region CR^h_ttbar for ttbar background normalisation (1ℓ selection)\n- Shape-fit signal region SR^h_1AB overlapping SR^h_1A and SR^h_1B\n- Signal region SR^Z_1A (3ℓ selection, t̃1→tχ̃2⁰ with χ̃2⁰→h/Zχ̃1⁰, large mass splitting)\n- Signal region SR^Z_1B (3ℓ selection, small χ̃2⁰-χ̃1⁰ mass splitting)\n- Signal region SR^Z_2A (3ℓ selection, t̃2→Zt̃1, small mass splitting)\n- Signal region SR^Z_2B (3ℓ selection, t̃2→Zt̃1, large mass splitting)\n- Signal region SR^h_1A (1ℓ selection, small χ̃2⁰-χ̃1⁰ mass splitting)\n- Signal region SR^h_1B (1ℓ selection, large χ̃2⁰-χ̃1⁰ mass splitting)\n- Validation region VR^Z_1F for fake/non-prompt lepton background\n- Validation region VR^Z_2F for fake/non-prompt lepton background (soft lepton regime)\n- Validation region VR^Z_ttZ for ttZ background estimate\n- Validation region VR^{Z,b-tag}_VV for multi-boson background (b-tag veto released)\n- Validation region VR^{Z,n-jet}_VV for multi-boson background (jet multiplicity extrapolation)\n\nThese regions are used to define the control, signal, and validation regions for various background and signal processes in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2006.05880"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:CR-Z-VV", "hepkg:object:CR