{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-1baad991", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2508.13900 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2508.13900 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $Z/\\gamma^{*}$ (Z+jets) simulated sample\n- Diboson (VV) background sample (WW, ZZ, WZ, WH, ZH including Higgs to diboson)\n- QCD multijet background sample\n- Single top quark (ST) background sample (s-channel, t-channel, tW-associated)\n- Triboson (VVV) background sample\n- W+jets background MC sample\n- ttbar+X+jets background sample (ttbar+jets, dilepton/single-lepton, and ttbar+boson)\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated as part of the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2106.01676", "2112.03161", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2402.08486", "2503.19420", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2508.13900"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson", "hepkg:sample:qcd-multijet", "hepkg:sample:single-top", "hepkg:sample:triboson", "hepkg:sample:ttx-jets", "hepkg:sample:wjets", "hepkg:sample:zjets"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1354cf5421d40542253d8aa7", "hepkg:evidence:1fdcb48859d9f2093b8cf534", "hepkg:evidence:335efc8ab40eecc8f2df7ef3", "hepkg:evidence:3cedf34d6169e21209e08886", "hepkg:evidence:437a1ebb2ff16d43ab4dc079", "hepkg:evidence:4b1f52976a10f53837a4527a", "hepkg:evidence:a9011db3744b57c7e2931846"], "seen_values": ["2508.139", "2508.13900", "and", "background", "boson", "diboson", "dilepton", "gamma", "hepkg:sample:diboson", "hepkg:sample:qcd-multijet", "hepkg:sample:single-top", "hepkg:sample:triboson", "hepkg:sample:ttx-jets", "hepkg:sample:wjets", "hepkg:sample:zjets", "higgs", "incl", "jets", "mul