{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-1c09b668", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2001.06899 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2001.06899 uses 5 simulated samples:\n\n- Alternative Z+jets sample with Herwig++ parton shower/hadronization model (systematic variation)\n- Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background MC sample (Pythia8)\n- Nominal \\( t\\bar{t} \\) signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.230)\n- Single top quark background MC sample (s-channel, t-channel, tW; POWHEG/MG5_aMC+Pythia8)\n- Z+jets signal MC sample (5FS, MG5_aMC@NLO+Pythia8, FxFx)\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"Alternative Z+jets sample with Herwig++ parton shower/hadronization model (systematic variation)\"\n- \"Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background MC sample (Pythia8)\"\n- \"Nominal \\( t\\bar{t} \\) signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.230)\"\n- \"Single top quark background MC sample (s-channel, t-channel, tW; POWHEG/MG5_aMC+Pythia8)\"\n- \"Z+jets signal MC sample (5FS, MG5_aMC@NLO+Pythia8, FxFx)\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2001.06899 uses 5 simulated samples.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2001.06899 uses 5 simulated samples: Alternative Z+jets sample with Herwig++ parton shower/hadronization model (systematic variation), Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background MC sample (Pythia8), Nominal \\( t\\\\bar{t} \\\\) signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.230), Single top quark background MC sample (s-channel, t-channel, tW; POWHEG/MG5_aMC+Pythia8), and Z+jets signal MC sample (5FS, MG5_aMC@NLO+Pythia8, FxFx).\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2208.12095"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "arg