{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-1d6f0f87", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2106.14246 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2106.14246 defines 16 region selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \"3lA selection inverted: \\( p_T^{miss} < 50 \\) GeV and \\( M_{ll} < 75 \\) GeV\"\n- \"3lA selection plus at least one b jet and \\( |M_{ll} - m_Z| < 15 \\) GeV\"\n- \"4lG selection with inverted requirement \\( p_T^{miss} < 50 \\) GeV\"\n- \"75 < \\( M_{ll} < 105 \\) GeV, binned in \\( M_T \\), \\( p_T^{miss} \\), \\( H_T \\) (Table 8)\"\n- \"Binned in \\( M_{T2}(ZZ) \\) and \\( M_{Z2} \\) (Table 20)\"\n- \"Binned in \\( M_{T2}(ll) \\), \\( p_T(ll) \\), \\( p_T^{miss} \\) and lepton-sign combination (Table 4)\"\n- \"Binned in \\( M_{ll} \\), \\( M_{T2}(ℓℓ) \\), \\( p_T^{miss} \\) (Table 14)\"\n- \"Binned in \\( M_{ℓh} \\), \\( M_{T2}(ℓ,τh) \\), \\( p_T^{miss} \\) (Table 16)\"\n- \"Binned in \\( M_{ℓh} \\), \\( M_{T2}(ℓ,τh) \\), \\( p_T^{miss} \\) (Table 18)\"\n- \"Binned in min \\( \\Delta R(ℓ,ℓ) \\) (Table 10)\"\n- \"M_{ll} <= 75 GeV or M_{ll} >= 105 GeV, binned in \\( M_T \\) and \\( M_T^{3l} \\) (Table 6)\"\n- \"OSSF light-lepton pair with \\( M_{ll} < 12 \\) GeV vetoed\"\n- \"Parametric neural-network output binned by \\( \\delta m \\), background-yield-based binning\"\n- \"Shared binning in \\( M_{Z1} \\) and \\( \\Delta R^H \\) across 4ℓH, 4ℓI, 4ℓJ, 4ℓK (Table 22)\"\n- \"|M_{ll} - m_Z| < 15 GeV, 50 < \\( p_T^{miss} < 100 \\) GeV, 50 < \\( M_T < 100 \\) GeV, |M_{3l} - m_Z| > 15 GeV\"\n- \"|M_{ll} - m_Z| > 15 GeV veto, binned in \\( M_{T2} \\) and \\( M_T^{2l} \\) (Table 12)\"\n\nThese selections are detailed in the paper and provide the criteria for defining different event regions.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\