{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-1e58506c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2504.13081 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2504.13081 measures the following observables:\n\n- Absolute pseudorapidity difference between the two leading jets (|Δη_jj|)\n- Absolute value of the Higgs boson rapidity (|y_H|)\n- Higgs boson transverse momentum (p_T^H)\n- Invariant mass of the dijet system of the two leading-p_T jets (m_jj)\n- Jet multiplicity (N_jets)\n- Jet p_T weighted by a function of its rapidity (tau^j_C)\n- Total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot)\n- Transverse momentum of the leading hadronic jet (p_T^{j1})\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- For |Δη_jj|: \"The absolute pseudorapidity difference between the two leading jets (|Δη_jj|) is measured.\"\n- For |y_H|: \"The absolute value of the Higgs boson rapidity (|y_H|) is measured.\"\n- For p_T^H: \"The Higgs boson transverse momentum (p_T^H) is measured.\"\n- For m_jj: \"The invariant mass of the dijet system of the two leading-p_T jets (m_jj) is measured.\"\n- For N_jets: \"The jet multiplicity (N_jets) is measured.\"\n- For tau^j_C: \"The jet p_T weighted by a function of its rapidity (tau^j_C) is measured.\"\n- For sigma_tot: \"The total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot) is measured.\"\n- For p_T^{j1}: \"The transverse momentum of the leading hadronic jet (p_T^{j1}) is measured.\"\n\nAnswered based on the content of the paper 2504.13081.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2504.13081 measures the following observables:\\n\\n- Absolute pseudorapidity difference between the two leading jets (|Δη_jj|)\\n- Absolute value of the Higgs boson rapidity (|y_H|)\\n- Higgs boson transverse momentum (p_T^H)\\n- Invariant mass of the dijet system of the two leading-p_T jets (m_jj)\\n- Jet multiplicity (N_jets)\\n- Jet p_T weighted by a function of its rapidity (tau^j_C)\\n- Total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot)\\n- Transverse momentum of the leading hadronic jet (p_T^{j1})\\n\\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\\n\\n- For |Δη_jj|: \\\"The absolute pseudorapidity difference between the two leading jets (|Δη_jj|) is measured.\\\"\\n- For |y_H|: \\\"The absolute value of the Higgs boson rapidity (|y_H|) is measured.\\\"\\n- For p_T^H: \\\"The Higgs boson transverse momentum (p_T^H) is measured.\\\"\\n- For m_jj: \\\"The invariant mass of the dijet system of the two leading-p_T jets (m_jj) is measured.\\\"\\n- For N_jets: \\\"The jet multiplicity (N_jets) is measured.\\\"\\n- For tau^j_C: \\\"The jet p_T weighted by a function of its rapidity (tau^j_C) is measured.\\\"\\n- For sigma_tot: \\\"The total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot) is measured.\\\"\\n- For p_T^{j1}: \\\"The transverse momentum", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.12246", "2309.14442", "2504.13081"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2504.13081"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:abs_deta_jj", "hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "hepkg:observable:m_jj", "hepkg:observable:n_jets", "hepkg:observable:pt_h", "hepkg:observable:pt_j1", "hepkg:observable:sigma_tot", "hepkg:observable:tau_c_j"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:35045352c9853d34862581c2", "hepkg:evidence:38dfc3024a0aa7e1380458f5", "hepkg:evidence:4f11d65eeeb98ee95fe84b25", "hepkg:evidence:662a7dc2d53de9cca2058ae4", "hepkg:evidence:66f20aa05cbc2a125ecbdbdf", "hepkg:evidence:839476f3c1dee0c73b6ead4d", "hepkg:evidence:970659fd7358d281dda8f4a4", "hepkg:evidence:be8d9780dc1fc1756b69485c", "hepkg:evidence:c486c4c83c88007c514d3331"