{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-1ef1ff17", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2408.03744 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2408.03744 uses 4 simulated samples: Diboson (WW, ZZ, WZ) MC samples, W and Z boson signal MC samples (W→lν, Z→l+l−) at 5.02 and 13 TeV, W→τν and Z→τ+τ− background MC samples, and tt̄ MC samples.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2408.03744"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2408.03744"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson_mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_mc", "hepkg:sample:w_tau_z_tautau_bkg_mc", "hepkg:sample:w_z_signal_mc"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3c2a6577de1def53a428c972", "hepkg:evidence:4a08fb9011c0870bd89f670f", "hepkg:evidence:8c9cece77f4a12464b45315a"], "seen_values": ["13", "2408.03744", "5.02", "and", "background", "boson", "diboson", "hepkg:sample:diboson_mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_mc", "hepkg:sample:w_tau_z_tautau_bkg_mc", "hepkg:sample:w_z_signal_mc", "result_uses_sample", "sample", "samples", "signal", "tau", "tau-", "tev", "ttbar"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7136, "completion_tokens": 260, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 11.733427518047392, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 11.733427518047392, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7396.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 4.0, "evidence_quotes": 3.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-1f6ba015", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2008.05928 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2008.05928 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- Center-of-mass (c.m.) subjet\n- Ghost-associated track\n- Large-R jet (H→bḇ candidate, J)\n- Photon\n- Resonance candidate (Jγ system)\n\nThese objects are used in the context of the analysis as defined in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.08600", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2201.11585", "2207.00348", "2307.01094", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2008.05928"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:cm-subjet", "hepkg:object:largeR-jet", "hepkg:object:photon", "hepkg:object:resonance-candidate", "hepkg:object:track"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0f71a427bff85a7428808ff8", "hepkg:evidence:4528c331be216ec776ede336", "hepkg:evidence:aab9b930efbe7fbc1cc898f2", "hepkg:evidence:de4971710790ded448ce6435", "hepkg:evidence:f7cc4697bc73c1125e849ad4"], "seen_values": ["2008.05928", "candidate", "center-of-mass", "detector_object", "ghost-associated", "hepkg:object:cm-subjet", "hepkg:object:larger-jet", "hepkg:object:photon", "hepkg:object:resonance-candidate", "hepkg:object:track", "jet", "large-r", "photon", "resonance", "result_defines_object", "subjet", "system", "track"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7154, "completion_tokens": 118, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 5.892460888251662, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 5.892460888251662, 