{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-20801f04", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which statistical methods does analysis 2012.03799 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2012.03799 uses the following statistical methods:\n\n1. **Asimov Z significance formula** for signal-region optimisation and observed excess quantification.\n2. **Background-only simultaneous likelihood fit** to control regions (CRs) and signal regions (SRs) with normalisation factors.\n3. **CLs prescription** for exclusion limit setting.\n4. **Profile-likelihood-ratio test** for the background-only hypothesis (p0, Z significance).\n\nThese methods are documented in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.03799"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.03799"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:statmethod:background-only-likelihood-fit", "hepkg:statmethod:cls-prescription", "hepkg:statmethod:profile-likelihood-ratio-test", "hepkg:statmethod:z-significance"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:2e6cd8abc148c4d23d5d0009", "hepkg:evidence:4670a83ce1edbb2a7f4ab411", "hepkg:evidence:735214fde14f5231f872cdc8", "hepkg:evidence:77fabef1b139adf90524feee", "hepkg:evidence:cdf2073ab3a73cc2c72caab8"], "seen_values": ["0", "2012.03799", "and", "asimov", "background-only", "cls", "crs", "excess", "exclusion", "factors", "fit", "for", "formula", "hepkg:statmethod:background-only-likelihood-fit", "hepkg:statmethod:cls-prescription", "hepkg:statmethod:profile-likelihood-ratio-test", "hepkg:statmethod:z-significance", "hypothesis", "likelihood", "limit", "normalisation", "observed", "optimisation", "prescription", "profile-likelihood-ratio", "quantification", "result_uses_statistical_method", "setting", "signal-region", "significance", "simultaneous", "srs", "statistical_method", "test", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7150, "completion_tokens": 152, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 7.924318511970341, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 7.924318511970341, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7302.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 4.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 0.5, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.5, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 4.0, "evidence_quotes": 5.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-20cd1634", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many datasets does analysis 2604.21670 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2604.21670 uses 2 datasets: 1. **ATLAS Run 2 pp collision dataset (2015–2018, √s=13 TeV, up to 140 fb⁻¹)** 2. **LEP, SLD and ATLAS electroweak precision observables dataset**. This information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper: - For the ATLAS Run 2 pp collision dataset: \"The ATLAS Run 2 pp collision dataset (2015–2018, √s=13 TeV, up to 140 fb⁻¹) is used.\" - For the LEP, SLD and ATLAS electroweak precision observables dataset: \"The LEP, SLD and ATLAS electroweak precision observables dataset is used.\" Therefore, the analysis 2604.21670 uses 2 datasets.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.21670"], "predicate": "result_uses_dataset"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.016}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:dataset:atlas_run2_pp_13tev", "hepkg:dataset:lep_sld_atlas_ewpo"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:6cab492a76ec0b1d39a7cdab", "hepkg:evidence:91a9849183ea8a1ea90dfe05", "hepkg:evidence:b015c1aedc380b525b109d52"], "seen_values": ["13", "14", "140", "2", "2015", "2018", "2604.2167", "2604.21670", "and", "atlas", "collision", "dataset", "electroweak", "hepkg:dataset:atlas_run2_pp_13tev", "hepkg:dataset:lep_sld_atlas_ewpo", "lep", "observables", "precision", "result_uses_dataset", "run", "sld", "tev"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7028, "completion_tokens": 490, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 21.028157538734376, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 21.028157538734376, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7518.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.