{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-2aad37bb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2207.00348 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2207.00348 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n1. Continuum γγ+γj+jj background (gg→H, qq'→Hqq' categories)\n2. Vγγ + prompt γγ background (V(→leptons)H categories)\n3. ttγγ and other top-associated background (ttH, tH categories)\n\nTherefore, the analysis estimates **3** backgrounds.\n\nHere is the evidence from the paper:\n\n- For the continuum γγ+γj+jj background: \"Continuum γγ+γj+jj background (gg→H, qq'→Hqq' categories)\"\n- For the Vγγ + prompt γγ background: \"Vγγ + prompt γγ background (V(→leptons)H categories)\"\n- For the ttγγ and other top-associated background: \"ttγγ and other top-associated background (ttH, tH categories)\"\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.00348"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.00348"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:continuum-gg-h-qqhqq", "hepkg:background:continuum-tth-th", "hepkg:background:continuum-vh"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:6135f248095d0b83bee3ae3d", "hepkg:evidence:a2460336042ab8c2a708ea39"], "seen_values": ["2207.00348", "and", "background", "categories", "continuum", "hepkg:background:continuum-gg-h-qqhqq", "hepkg:background:continuum-tth-th", "hepkg:background:continuum-vh", "hqq", "leptons", "other", "prompt", "result_estimates_background", "top-associated", "tth"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7078, "completion_tokens": 244, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 10.901368117891252, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 10.901368117891252, "llm_c