{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-2b41a402", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2404.06204 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2404.06204 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- MadGraph_aMC@NLO FxFx + Pythia8 multijet-merged NLO prediction sample\n- Powheg+Herwig7 alternative prediction sample\n- Powheg+Pythia8 (AZNLO tune, CT10 PDF) nominal W/Z signal MC sample\n- Powheg+Pythia8 ttbar and single-top background MC sample\n- Pythia8 (AZ tune, CTEQ6L1 PDF) standalone LO prediction sample\n- Pythia8 (NNPDF2.3LO, A3 tune) minimum-bias pile-up overlay sample\n- Sherpa 2.2.1 (13 TeV) / 2.2.5 (5.02 TeV) alternative W/Z signal MC sample (MEPS@NLO)\n- Sherpa 2.2.11 multijet-merged NLO prediction sample\n- Sherpa diboson (VV) background MC sample\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various processes and backgrounds in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2404.06204"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2404.06204"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:madgraph-fxfx-pythia8", "hepkg:sample:powheg-herwig7", "hepkg:sample:powheg-pythia8-signal", "hepkg:sample:powheg-pythia8-top", "hepkg:sample:pythia8-az", "hepkg:sample:pythia8-pileup", "hepkg:sample:sherpa-2211-multijet-merged", "hepkg:sample:sherpa-diboson", "hepkg:sample:sherpa-signal-alt"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:205c5bcd2d63e512809cd820", "hepkg:evidence:3969f8c982f7005ad7800876", "hepkg:evidence:3c536d33a66929dd08980811", "hepkg:evidence:5f497527a871d56c883ad82d", "hepkg:evidence:728d01c359684286d6cc0d48", "hepkg:evidence:d3e25de409f3bb8c08c0d8ca", "hepkg:evidence:d7c32fe0588e0bc7cdd18dc4", "hepkg:evidence:ded77d81ea960ced5044f682"], "seen_values": ["13", "2.2.1"