{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-3089d42f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2312.04450 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2312.04450 require the following detector objects:\n\n- Reconstructed b-tagged jet\n- Reconstructed electron\n- Reconstructed lepton (electron or muon, signal-level)\n- Reconstructed muon\n- Reconstructed small-R jet\n- Z boson candidate (OSSF lepton pair, detector level)\n\nAdditionally, the regions also require the following particle-level and parton-level objects:\n\n- Particle-level b-jet\n- Particle-level jet\n- Particle-level lepton\n- Parton-level Z boson\n- Parton-level top/antitop quark\n\nThese requirements are based on the content of the paper 2312.04450.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2312.04450"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2312.04450"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:bjet-particle", "hepkg:object:bjet-reco", "hepkg:object:electron-reco", "hepkg:object:jet-particle", "hepkg:object:jet-reco", "hepkg:object:lepton-particle", "hepkg:object:lepton-reco", "hepkg:object:muon-reco", "hepkg:object:top-quark-parton", "hepkg:object:z-boson-parton", "hepkg:object:z-candidate-reco"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:054607c3c8319e46aab34246", "hepkg:evidence:05475fdf51f41a362d0f9422", "hepkg:evidence:1981414f4f7c6c8a52f95e88", "hepkg:evidence:268a1036be8534dc006a2ce2", "hepkg:evidence:29013e8d5b47d03f8302565c", "hepkg:evidence:334cf96b28a6d2189bd6c615", "hepkg:evidence:4599b3a9a9a05f06340d5a29", "hepkg:evidence:564f4c290232a66ec6e8b3e3", "hepkg:evidence:5915b0fd997ac4f57486a5a1", "hepkg:evidence:6e0da146732bcf58210fc06b", "hepkg:evidence:79c4d0c96127113e8f3d4a