{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-31b77d7d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2503.19420 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2503.19420 measures the following observables:\n\n- Compatibility of \\(\\mu_{WH}\\) and \\(\\mu_{ZH}\\) signal strengths (combined 2-POI fit)\n- Differential \\(\\sigma_{VH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) vs \\(p_{\\text{T}}^{V}\\) (\\(p_{\\text{T}}^{V}\\) scheme, 4 merged bins)\n- STXS Stage 1.2 fiducial cross-sections \\(\\sigma \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) (\\(\\ell\\nu H\\), \\(\\ell\\ell H\\), EW \\(qqH\\) categories)\n- Total \\(\\sigma_{VH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) cross-section\n- Total \\(\\sigma_{WH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) cross-section\n- Total \\(\\sigma_{ZH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) cross-section\n- VH signal strength in opposite-sign 2ℓ channel (single-channel fit)\n- VH signal strength, \\(\\mu_{VH}\\) (combined 1-POI fit)\n- WH signal strength in 3ℓ channel (single-channel fit)\n- WH signal strength in same-sign 2ℓ channel (single-channel fit)\n- WH signal strength, \\(\\mu_{WH}\\) (combined 2-POI fit)\n- ZH signal strength in 4ℓ channel (single-channel fit)\n- ZH signal strength, \\(\\mu_{ZH}\\) (combined 2-POI fit)\n\nThese observables are recorded in the paper with the arXiv ID 2503.19420.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2503.19420"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2503.19420"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:diff-sigma-stxs", "hepkg:observable:diff-sigma-vh-ptv", "hepkg:observable:mu-vh-1poi", "hepkg:observable:mu-vh-os2l-channel", "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-2poi", "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-3l-channel", "hepk