{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-33daa382", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which statistical methods does analysis 2006.05880 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2006.05880 uses the following statistical methods:\n\n- **Background-only fit (CRs only, no signal, floating WZ normalisation)**\n- **CLs prescription for 95% CL exclusion limits**\n- **HistFitter package with Gaussian nuisance parameters for systematic uncertainties**\n- **Maximum-likelihood (profile likelihood) fit with Poisson/Gaussian terms and Beeston-Barlow-lite MC-stat nuisances**\n- **Poisson statistical modelling with Gaussian-constrained nuisance parameters**\n- **Pseudo-experiment-based calculation of limits and discovery p-values**\n- **Shape-fit approach using mutually exclusive kinematic bins**\n\nThese methods are documented in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2106.01676", "2211.08028", "2401.05299", "2407.10549"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2006.05880"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:background-only-fit", "hepkg:method:cls-prescription", "hepkg:method:histfitter", "hepkg:method:poisson-gaussian-nuisance", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit", "hepkg:method:pseudo-experiments", "hepkg:method:shape-fit"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:34f9a8f3d8b9d64349ce610e", "hepkg:evidence:5abfd5e857cf4ab63949c952", "hepkg:evidence:92a4ca52338374290eea4777", "hepkg:evidence:b4f0c786e8c1788508870785", "hepkg:evidence:c7fbeb5ebbf06df627c110c9", "hepkg:evidence:ef3a5bfb861cb5f0e5949861"], "seen_values": ["2006.0588", "2006.05880", "95", "and", "approach", "background-only", "beeston-barlow-lite", "bins", "calculation", "cls",