nificance for WH production: 3.61 - **Cross Section**: - Observed cross section for \\\\(ggH; pT^H > 300 \\, \\\\text{GeV}\\\\): 0.04 pb - **Ratio to SM**: - Ratio to SM for \\\\(ZH(Z \\\\\\\\to \\\\\\\\text{leptons}); pT^V < 150 \\, \\\\text{GeV}\\\\): 3.3 - **Parameters**: - \\\\(\\\\kappa_V\\\\): 0.99 ± 0.05 - \\\\(\\\\kappa_f\\\\): 0.86 \\\\(_{-0.11}^{+0.14}\\\\) - \\\\(\\\\mu\\\\): 0.95 \\\\(_{-0.09}^{+0.10}\\\\) These quantities are reported with detailed uncertainties and additional context.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2206.09466"], "predicate": "result_reports_quantity"}, "rows": 23, "error": null, "seconds": 0.056}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:07952856d017aca3c485bd61", "hepkg:evidence:0a55b8b8a85449d651bff84b", "hepkg:evidence:0cdf4979d2793d5328e05b88", "hepkg:evidence:10d3d58f951954b8d5a9379d", "hepkg:evidence:11506ca3faf0b55746965eae", "hepkg:evidence:13b97962f05816f86578d682", "hepkg:evidence:15129cf2bebc52a2c5bf58e6", "hepkg:evidence:18e699383ae20e0b986f0e7a", "hepkg:evidence:1d1de2ce5fe2df86027db698", "hepkg:evidence:1f0c5037ea78cc63b4f8deac", "hepkg:evidence:2c8621555dcc92663f50112a", "hepkg:evidence:3587e74358bcc597023e3594", "hepkg:evidence:3b010a963a5861a5555a1ae3", "hepkg:evidence:3de2e9b0fb8e44313b8a72b4", "hepkg:evidence:3fd99385e4dcede7f79e3b75", "hepkg:evidence:578a46c150b962bc6ba8b789", "hepkg:evidence:58994335af562fdbc57a5459", "hepkg:evidence:5c24ed770bbd8434bdfe999e", "hepkg:evidence:6017d21c235a935474898d60", "hepkg:evidence:60d9eca90239f201920ddbbe", "hepkg:evidence:626bbc3190f9c23b248a9b28", "hepkg:evidence:6714b7c9e5a35522b9a16146", "hepkg:evidence:6d8959dfad72e1d11e94a791", "hepkg:evidence:70fd241871aeacaed97cb75e", "hepkg:evidence:713d28830e22649503dbff07", "hepkg:evidence:73556c85af6913ab6046e42c", "hepkg:evidence:7601754b04edb43925f2baaf", "hepkg:evidenc