{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-393ca9f7", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2211.08028 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2211.08028 defines 22 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \\( z0 \\cdot \\sin(\\theta) < 0.5 \\) mm\n- \\( \\eta < 2.0 \\)\n- \\( \\eta < 2.47 \\)\n- \\( \\eta < 2.5 \\)\n- \\( \\eta < 2.8 \\)\n- \\( d0 \\text{ significance} < 3 \\)\n- \\( d0 \\text{ significance} < 5 \\)\n- \\( b\\)-tagging working point == 77% efficiency (MV2c10)\n- Isolation working point == Fix (track- and calorimeter-based)\n- Isolation working point == FixedCutTightTrackOnly\n- Identification == Loose likelihood-based\n- JVT working point == Medium\n- Quality == Medium\n- Identification == Tight likelihood-based\n- Vertex designation == largest summed \\( pT^2 \\) of associated tracks\n- Jet quality == loose jet-quality requirements\n- Cosmic muon == removed if \\( |d0| > 0.2 \\) mm and \\( |z0| > 1 \\) mm\n- \\( pT > 100 \\) GeV\n- \\( pT > 20 \\) GeV\n- \\( E_T^{\\text{miss}} > 200 \\) GeV\n- \\( pT > 30 \\) GeV\n- Track \\( pT > 500 \\) MeV\n- \\( \\sigma(q/p) / |q/p| > 0.2 \\)\n- \\( n_{\\text{tracks}} \\geq 2 \\)\n\nThese selections are crucial for defining the objects used in the analysis. \n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2211.08028"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:06900003771e710cef6361ca", "hepkg:evidence:1489c3e18cdf8833eb1e0e2a", "hepkg:evidence:17aa92a4567f79d11b826cc8", "hepkg:evidence:4d645d230a4d364c47790ff2", "hepkg:evidence:6fa2df3367135ce1a3ffaf21", "hepkg:evidence:7db0c059e5aa37edfc