{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-3a1ddd57", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2405.18661 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2405.18661 defines 14 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \"3 < |eta| < 5\"\n- \"anti-kT R=0.7; pT > 133 GeV; |y| < 2.0\"\n- \"anti-kT distance parameter DeltaR=0.4 (default Run 2), DeltaR=0.5 (Run 1); DeltaR=0.8 used for merged/boosted-jet identification\"\n- \"calculated from calorimeter tower information alone\"\n- \"computed as the negative vector sum of the transverse momenta of all particle-flow candidates in the event\"\n- \"identified using a deep neural network (DeepJet) based on charged and neutral particle-flow jet constituents plus 12 secondary-vertex properties\"\n- \"pT > 20 GeV\"\n- \"pT > 25 GeV\"\n- \"pT > 30 GeV\"\n- \"reconstructed from one or three tracks combined with calorimeter energy deposits via the hadrons-plus-strips algorithm\"\n- \"second lepton pT > 10 GeV; additional leptons pT > 5 GeV\"\n- \"|eta| < 2.4\"\n- \"|eta| < 2.5\"\n\nThese selections are applied to various detector objects in the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2405.18661 defines 14 object selection requirements.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2405.18661"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3ee54191f7fd20159ed6df5b", "hepkg:evidence:504d451ebb318e01874529d2", "hepkg:evidence:53307fa188e35e09af3b2879", "hepkg:evidence:59071ee2bb16b57f7770c059", "hepkg:evidence:75620c019a75ec28661737d7", "hepkg:evidence:84688ce