{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-3a5f2119", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2401.05299 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2401.05299 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- **3-lepton final state (WH, all bosons leptonic):**\n  - 3L OnZ control region\n  - 3L Zγ control region\n  - 3L MisID e/mu control region (subregion of 3L OnZ CR)\n  - 3L WZ control region (subregion of 3L OnZ CR)\n  - 3L ttZ control region (subregion of 3L OnZ CR)\n  - Fundamental L_T+pT^miss table (model-independent SR scheme)\n  - Fundamental S_T table (model-independent SR scheme)\n  - Advanced S_T table (model-independent SR scheme)\n  - Combined BDT score distribution for three-lepton channels (3L, 2L1T, 1L2T)\n  - 3ℓ Signal Region\n  - 3ℓ Fiducial Region\n  - 3ℓ VV Control Region\n  - 3ℓ IntC Control Region (internal conversion)\n  - 3ℓ MatC Control Region (material conversion)\n  - 3-lepton Z-dominated signal region\n  - 3-lepton Z-depleted signal region\n  - 3-lepton WZ control region, 0 jets\n\n- **Same-sign 2-lepton + jets final state (WH, leptonic W, H->WW*->lv+jj):**\n  - 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n  - 2ℓ SS Fiducial Region\n  - 2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions\n  - 2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions\n  - Same-sign 2-muon signal region\n  - Same-sign 2-electron signal region\n  - Same-sign different-flavour signal region\n\nIn total, there are 22 distinct event regions across the two channels.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2401.05299 contains 22 distinct event regions across its two channels: the 3-lepton final state and the same-sign 2-lepton + jets final state.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2202.08676",