{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-3f2efe4d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2009.14537 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2009.14537 uses 2 simulated samples:\n\n1. Exclusive photon-fusion signal MC sample, \\( pp \\rightarrow p(\\gamma\\gamma \\rightarrow \\ell^+\\ell^-)p \\)\n2. Single-dissociative photon-fusion signal MC sample, \\( pp \\rightarrow p(\\gamma\\gamma \\rightarrow \\ell^+\\ell^-)p^* \\)\n\nThese details are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- For the exclusive sample: \"Exclusive photon-fusion signal MC sample, \\( pp \\rightarrow p(\\gamma\\gamma \\rightarrow \\ell^+\\ell^-)p \\)\"\n- For the single-dissociative sample: \"Single-dissociative photon-fusion signal MC sample, \\( pp \\rightarrow p(\\gamma\\gamma \\rightarrow \\ell^+\\ell^-)p^* \\)\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis uses 2 simulated samples. \n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2009.14537 uses 2 simulated samples:\\n\\n1. Exclusive photon-fusion signal MC sample, \\( pp \\\\rightarrow p(\\\\gamma\\\\gamma \\\\rightarrow \\\\ell^+\\\\ell^-)p \\)\\n2. Single-dissociative photon-fusion signal MC sample, \\( pp \\\\rightarrow p(\\\\gamma\\\\gamma \\\\rightarrow \\\\ell^+\\\\ell^-)p^* \\)\\n\\nThese details are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\\n\\n- For the exclusive sample: \\\"Exclusive photon-fusion signal MC sample, \\( pp \\\\rightarrow p(\\\\gamma\\\\gamma \\\\rightarrow \\\\ell^+\\\\ell^-)p \\\\)\\\"\\n- For the single-dissociative sample: \\\"Single-dissociative photon-fusion signal MC sample, \\( pp \\\\rightarrow p(\\\\gamma\\\\gamma \\\\rightarrow \\\\ell^+\\\\ell^-)p^* \\\\)\\\"\\n\\nTherefore, the analysis uses 2 simulated samples.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.14537"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2009.14537"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:mc-exclusive-signal", "hepkg:sample:mc-single-dissociative-signal"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:14c059828b26fbb5e478e15d", "hepkg:evidence:d6cfdb4588f21cfc00e1438a"], "seen_values": ["2009.14537", "exclusive", "hepkg:sample:mc-exclusive-signal", "hepkg:sample:mc-single-dissociative-signal", "photon-fusion", "pp-", "result_uses_sample", "sample", "signal", "single-dissociative"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7015, "completion_tokens": 475, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 20.919762232806534, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 20.919762232806534, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7490.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
