{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-3fbae318", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many quantities does analysis 2312.04450 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2312.04450 reports 4 quantities:\n\n1. Reduction in total uncertainty of inclusive \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) cross section vs previous ATLAS measurement\n2. Relative precision of the combined inclusive \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) cross-section measurement\n3. Significance of departure from no-spin-correlation hypothesis in \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\)\n4. p-value for compatibility of combined and per-channel inclusive \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) cross sections\n\nThese quantities are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n1. \"The reduction in total uncertainty compared to the previous ATLAS measurement is...\"\n2. \"The relative precision of the combined inclusive \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) cross-section measurement is...\"\n3. \"The significance of the departure from the no-spin-correlation hypothesis in \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production is...\"\n4. \"The p-value for the compatibility of the combined and per-channel inclusive \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) cross sections is...\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2312.04450 reports 4 distinct quantities.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2312.04450 reports 4 quantities: Reduction in total uncertainty of inclusive \\( t\\\\bar{t}Z \\\\) cross section vs previous ATLAS measurement, Relative precision of the combined inclusive \\( t\\\\bar{t}Z \\\\) cross-section measurement, Significance of departure from no-spin-correlation hypothesis in \\( t\\\\bar{t}Z \\\\), and p-value for compatibility of combined and per-channel inclusive \\( t\\\\bar{t}Z \\\\) cross sections.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2312.04450"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2312.04450"], "predicate": "result_reports_quantity"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:quantity:channel-compatibility-pvalue", "hepkg:quantity:inclusive-xsec-relative-precision", "hepkg:quantity:spin-correlation-significance", "hepkg:quantity:total-uncertainty-reduction-vs-previous"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:2c947f838ba49c68b7b2807a", "hepkg:evidence:6a0ba7ee5c29c103114aacf0", "hepkg:evidence:79972dedf69b0b8d02b47a02", "hepkg:evidence:c16e15d2396fdf63ab6992da"], "seen_values": ["2312.0445", "2312.04450", "and", "atlas", "bar", "combined", "compatibility", "cross", "cross-section", "departure", "for", "from", "hepkg:quantity:channel-compatibility-pvalue", "hepkg:quantity:inclusive-xsec-relative-precision", "hepkg:quantity:spin-correlation-significance", "hepkg:quantity:total-uncertainty-reduction-vs-previous", "hypothesis", "inclusive", "measurement", "no-spin-correlation", "p-value", "per-channel", "precision", "previous", "reduction", "relative", "result_quantity", "result_reports_quantity", "section", "sections", "significance", "the", "total", "uncertainty"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7157, "completion_tokens": 424, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 18.706078780349344, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 18.706078780349344, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7581.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 4.0, "evidence_quotes": 4.0}}
