{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-407de045", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2408.03744 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2408.03744 defines 16 object selection requirements. These include criteria for jet algorithms, lepton \\( p_T \\) thresholds, isolation requirements, and other specific selections for the analysis.\n\nHere are some examples of the selection requirements:\n\n- **Jet algorithm**: anti-\\( k_T \\) with distance parameter 0.4, input: particle-flow candidates.\n- **Lepton \\( p_T \\) thresholds**:\n  - \\( p_T > 25 \\) GeV for \\( W \\) boson fiducial region signal leptons.\n  - \\( p_T > 25 \\) GeV for \\( Z \\) boson fiducial region leptons.\n  - \\( p_T > 17 \\) GeV for trigger leptons.\n  - \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV for trigger leptons.\n- **Additional lepton veto**: \\( p_T > 10 \\) GeV.\n- **Isolation requirements**:\n  - Isolation cone radius \\( \\Delta R = 0.3 \\).\n  - Isolation cone radius \\( \\Delta R = 0.4 \\).\n- **Dilepton invariant mass window**: \\( 60 \\) GeV to \\( 120 \\) GeV.\n- **ECAL barrel-endcap transition exclusion**: outside the range \\( 1.44 \\) to \\( 1.57 \\) in \\( \\eta \\).\n- **W boson transverse mass requirement**: \\( m_T > 40 \\) GeV.\n- **Quality requirements**:\n  - No conversion origin; shower-shape based quality requirements.\n  - Quality requirements on the number of spatial measurements in the silicon tracker and muon system, and combined-track fit quality.\n\nThese selections ensure that the analysis is robust and well-defined for the specific physics processes being studied.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2408.03744 defines 16 object selection requirements. These include criteria for jet algorithms, lepton \\( p_T \\) thresholds, isolation requirements, and other specific selections for the analysis.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2408.03744"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:038d4e87a1ef72318965575b", "hepkg:evidence:10301b89ff017a7d476a1861", "hepkg:evidence:1cf38a87896b982d7dfe8e23", "hepkg:evidence:1e79353df92a271bed62af7a", "hepkg:evidence:1edee6273e353dd6e5f30dee", "hepkg:evidence:367b182335c17cc9b453eec4", "hepkg:evidence:43c61ba24ff7e738cd0b2461", "hepkg:evidence:5eec47d3809121476e8a5fd2", "hepkg:evidence:7c0af19528c2e71ced54bf09", "hepkg:evidence:a94bb0e170d8642fa6c8f811", "hepkg:evidence:abc77b204ec066184e663b8f", "hepkg:evidence:f94f0b8c8216c41e33892e81"], "seen_values": ["0.3", "0.4", "1", "1.44,1.57", "1.441.57", "10", "17", "2", "2.4", "2.5", "20", "2408.03744", "25", "4", "40", "60,120", "6012", "60120", "additional-lepton", "algorithm", "all", "and", "anti-kt", "barrel-endcap", "based", "before", "born", "boson", "candidates", "combined-track", "comparator", "cone", "conversion", "decays", "defined", "delta_r", "description", "dilepton", "distance_parameter", "ecal", "eta", "eta_max", "event", "excludes", "exclusion", "fiducial", "fit", "from", "fsr", "generator-level", "gev", "input", "invariant", "isolation", "lepton", "leptons", "level", "m_ll", "m_t", "mass", "measurements", "momenta", "muon", "negative", "none", "number", "object_has_selection", "origin", "outside_range", "particle-flow", "qed", "quality", "radius", "range", "region", "requirement", "requirements", "role", "shower-shape", "signal", "silicon", "spatial", "sum", "system", "tau", "the", "threshold", "tracker", "transition", "transverse", "trigger", "unit", "variable", "vector", "veto", "window"], "verification_score": 0.5833333333333333, "unsupported_clai