{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-4455b19d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2112.00895 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2112.00895 defines 16 object selection requirements. Here are the details:\n\n- 3D displacement significance > 3.5\n- IPS (impact parameter significance) > 1\n- SV charge != 0 required for OS/SS classification (event rejected if non-zero charge cannot be assigned)\n- Constituent track pT > 1 GeV\n- Corrected SV mass m_SV^corr > 0.55 GeV\n- Dimuon mass > 12 GeV\n- Dimuon mass veto: exclude 70 < m_mumu < 110 GeV\n- Fiducial parton-level: pT^l > 30 GeV; |eta^l| < 2.1\n- pT > 30 GeV; |eta| < 2.1; isolated (see electron/muon specific isolation cuts)\n- pT^c > 25 GeV; |eta^c| < 2.5; ΔR(c, lepton) > 0.5\n- pT^jet > 25 GeV; |eta^jet| < 2.5; ΔR(jet, lepton) > 0.5; anti-kT R=0.5\n- Transverse mass m_T > 55 GeV (m_T = sqrt(2 pT^l pT^miss [1-cos(phi_l-phi_miss)]))\n- Trigger pT > 24 GeV; combined isolation I_comb/pT < 0.12 (cone dR<0.4)\n- Trigger pT > 27 GeV; combined isolation I_comb/pT < 0.15 (cone dR<0.3)\n- Veto if second isolated lepton pT > 20 GeV, |eta| < 2.1, opposite charge to W lepton\n- |eta| < 2.1; pT < 25 GeV; pT/pT^jet < 0.6; non-isolated I_comb/pT > 0.2\n\nThese selections are directly quoted from the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2112.00895 defines 16 object selection requirements. These include criteria such as 3D displacement significance > 3.5, IPS (impact parameter significance) > 1, and various other kinematic and isolation cuts.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2112.00895"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:196ce3591edb5a9f4442c43c", "hepkg:evidence:3543afed48581ea25984c703", "hepkg:evidence:39f45bfa139db72077fd9db9", "hepkg:evidence:4690243d42e876506f9fa320", "hepkg:evidence:5c62aed417b8fdf994605fe0", "hepkg:evidence:6799a45e18b6e70cd3fa8430", "hepkg:evidence:6abec37d174feac9d52eb611", "hepkg:evidence:72bd1be4875fb6d1362cfc34", "hepkg:evidence:77c9cd0e3c5e429dd1340536", "hepkg:evidence:7a6ce871bb8c7ce770d6ab9b", "hepkg:evidence:bb6774f19921281de765f185", "hepkg:evidence:c0cac484b2bbd6dae0374696", "hepkg:evidence:c1818d9d37b5258abae8b093", "hepkg:evidence:c190369078fcd5c9b9fe6301", "hepkg:evidence:e6f3a9a13a8edd0addf4b271", "hepkg:evidence:e7f09977603e023bd842405a", "hepkg:evidence:ed373df935b8ee4550210428", "hepkg:evidence:ff621d5e63697020413326bb"], "seen_values": ["-cos", "0", "0.12", "0.15", "0.2", "0.3", "0.4", "0.5", "0.55", "0.6", "1", "11", "110", "12", "2", "2.1", "2.5", "20", "2112.00895", "24", "25", "27", "3", "3.5", "30", "55", "7", "70", "anti-kt", "assigned", "cannot", "charge", "classification", "combined", "cone", "constituent", "corr", "corrected", "cuts", "dimuon", "displacement", "electron", "eta", "event", "exclude", "fiducial", "for", "gev", "i_comb", "impact", "ips", "isolated", "isolation", "jet", "lepton", "m_mumu", "m_sv", "m_t", "mass", "miss", "muon", "non-isolated", "non-zero", "none", "object_has_selection", "opposite", "parameter", "parton-level", "phi_l-phi_miss", "rejected", "required", "second", "see", "significance", "specific", "sqrt", "track", "transverse", "trigger", "veto"], "verification_score": 0.9545454545454546, "unsupported_claims": ["16"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7925, "completion_tokens": 591, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 26.50391705101356, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 26.50391705101356, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8516.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text":