{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-44711e73", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2604.21670 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2604.21670 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- Diboson cross-section theoretical uncertainty\n- Electron and muon reconstruction, identification, trigger efficiency and energy scale/resolution uncertainties\n- Flavour tagging uncertainty\n- Higgs boson branching ratio uncertainty\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale and resolution uncertainty\n- Pile-up modelling uncertainty\n- Single top theoretical modelling uncertainty\n- Tau-lepton reconstruction/identification uncertainty\n- WW modelling uncertainty\n- Z+jets modelling uncertainty\n- \\( t\\bar{t} \\) modelling (theory) uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis as part of the systematic evaluation.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.21670"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:diboson_cross_section_theory", "hepkg:systematic:flavour_tagging", "hepkg:systematic:higgs_br", "hepkg:systematic:jet_energy_scale_resolution", "hepkg:systematic:lepton_reco_id_trigger", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity", "hepkg:systematic:pileup_modelling", "hepkg:systematic:single_t