{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-44ab923f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which collision systems does analysis 2604.21670 study?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2604.21670 studies two collision systems:\n\n1. \\( e^+e^- \\) collisions at the Z pole (LEP/SLD)\n2. Proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV\n\nThese details are supported by the following entries in the graph:\n- For \\( e^+e^- \\) collisions at the Z pole: \"e+e- collisions at the Z pole (LEP/SLD)\"\n- For proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV: \"proton-proton collisions at sqrt(s) = 13 TeV\"\n\nWould you like to see the verbatim quotes from the paper for these findings?\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2604.21670 studies two collision systems:\\n\\n1. \\( e^+e^- \\\\) collisions at the Z pole (LEP/SLD)\\n2. Proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s} = 13 \\\\) TeV\\n\\nThese details are supported by the following entries in the graph:\\n- For \\( e^+e^- \\\\) collisions at the Z pole: \\\"e+e- collisions at the Z pole (LEP/SLD)\\\"\\n- For proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s} = 13 \\\\) TeV: \\\"proton-proton collisions at sqrt(s) = 13 TeV\\\"\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2012.08600", "2103.04956", "2106.14246", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2401.07090", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.21670"], "predicate": "result_has_collision_system"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.017}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:collision_system:ee_zpole", "hepkg:collision_system:pp_13tev"