{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-44f82990", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many collision systems does analysis 2201.11585 study?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2201.11585 studies two collision systems: proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s} = 8\\,\\text{TeV}\\) and proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s} = 13\\,\\text{TeV}\\).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2012.08600", "2103.04956", "2106.14246", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2401.07090", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2201.11585"], "predicate": "result_has_collision_system"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.017}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:collision_system:pp_13tev", "hepkg:collision_system:pp_8tev"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1b1c288821d1ae8461376ada", "hepkg:evidence:b1f04f7af78cf42bbfda0359"], "seen_values": ["13", "2201.11585", "8", "collision_system", "collisions", "hepkg:collision_system:pp_13tev", "hepkg:collision_system:pp_8tev", "proton-proton", "result_has_collision_system", "sqrt", "tev", "text"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7008, "completion_tokens": 308, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 14.010832047089934, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 14.010832047089934, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7316.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-4521240f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2209.07327 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2209.07327 targets 2 physics processes:\n\n1. \\( pp \\rightarrow B \\overline{B} \\) (vector-like B quark pair production)\n2. \\( pp \\rightarrow T \\overline{T} \\) (vector-like T quark pair production)\n\nThese processes are recorded in the graph as targeting by the analysis. \n\nHere is the evidence from the paper:\n- For \\( pp \\rightarrow B \\overline{B} \\): \"pp -> B Bbar (vector-like B quark pair production)\"\n- For \\( pp \\rightarrow T \\overline{T} \\): \"pp -> T Tbar (vector-like T quark pair production)\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2209.07327 targets 2 physics processes.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2209.07327 targets 2 physics processes: 1. \\( pp \\\\rightarrow B \\\\overline{B} \\\\) (vector-like B quark pair production) 2. \\( pp \\\\rightarrow T \\\\overline{T} \\\\) (vector-like T quark pair production). These processes are recorded in the graph as targeting by the analysis. Here is the evidence from the paper: - For \\( pp \\\\rightarrow B \\\\overline{B} \\\\): \\\"pp -> B Bbar (vector-like B quark pair production)\\\" - For \\( pp \\\\rightarrow T \\\\overline{T} \\\\): \\\"pp -> T Tbar (vector-like T quark pair production)\\\"\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2209.07327"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2209.07327"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.02}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:pp-to-bbbar-vlq", "hepkg:process:pp-to-ttbar-vlq"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:82483f23e0c9cfe7fdb69baf"], "seen_values": ["2209.07327", "bbar", "hepkg:process:pp-to-bbbar-vlq", "hepkg:process:pp-to-ttbar-vlq", "pair", "physics_process", "production", "quark", "result_targets_process", "tbar", "vector-like"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 6999, "completion_tokens": 385, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 18.523936251644045, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 18.523936251644045, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7384.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 1.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-4523da67", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2111.08340 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2111.08340 measures 14 observables, including the differential and fiducial Higgs boson production cross sections, various signal strengths for Higgs, V+jets, and ttbar processes, and a p-value for the compatibility of the differential Higgs signal strengths. \n\nHere are the observables:\n\n- Differential Higgs boson production cross section in four \\( p_T^H \\) bins (300-450, 450-650, 650-1000, >1000 GeV)\n- Higgs boson fiducial production cross section, \\( p_T^H > 450 \\) GeV, \\( |y_H| < 2 \\)\n- Higgs boson signal strength in four \\( p_T^H \\) STXS volumes (300-450, 450-650, 650-1000, >1000 GeV)\n- Higgs boson signal strength within fiducial volume (\\( p_T^H > 450 \\) GeV, \\( |y_H| < 2 \\))\n- Higgs boson signal strength, inclusive region (candidate jet \\( p_T > 250 \\) GeV)\n- V+jets (W→qq', Z→qq) signal strength validation, \\( p_T^V > 450 \\) GeV (VRL)\n- Z+jets (Z→bb) signal strength, inclusive region (validation measurement)\n- Z+jets signal strength in four jet-\\( p_T \\) bins (validation of differential procedure)\n- Z+jets signal strength, jet \\( p_T > 450 \\) GeV (Table 10 fiducial fit)\n- Z→bb signal strength validation in SR, \\( p_T^Z > 450 \\) GeV (test with Higgs fixed to SM)\n- p-value for compatibility of the four differential Higgs boson signal strengths\n- ttbar normalization signal strength in four jet-\\( p_T \\) bins\n- ttbar normalization signal strength, inclusive region\n- ttbar normalization signal strength, jet \\( p_T > 450 \\) GeV (Table 10 fiducial fit)\n\nThis information is based on the content of the paper 2111.08340.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2111.08340 measures 14 observables, including the differential and fiducial Higgs boson production cross sections, various signal strengths for Higgs, V+jets, and ttbar processes, and a p-value for the compatibility of the differential Higgs signal strengths. Here are the observables:\\n\\n- Differential Higgs boson production cross section in four \\( p_T^H \\) bins (300-450, 450-650, 650-1000, >1000 GeV)\\n- Higgs boson fiducial production cross section, \\( p_T^H > 450 \\) GeV, \\( |y_H| < 2 \\)\\n- Higgs boson signal strength in four \\( p_T^H \\) STXS volumes (300-450, 450-650, 650-1000, >1000 GeV)\\n- Higgs boson signal strength within fiducial volume (\\( p_T^H > 450 \\) GeV, \\( |y_H| < 2 \\))\\n- Higgs boson signal", "answered": true, "papers": ["2111.08340"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["2111.08340"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 0, "error": "unknown_entity_id", "seconds": 0.0}, {"round": 2, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "2111.08340", "kind": "paper"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "seconds": 0.265}, {"round": 3, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2111.08340"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {"set_1": []}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:mu-h-differential", "hepkg:observable:mu-h-fiducial", "hepkg:observable:mu-h-inclusive", "hepkg:observable:mu-ttbar-differential", "hepkg:observable:mu-ttbar-inclusive", "hepkg:observable:mu-ttbar-table10-fiducial", "hepkg:observable:mu-v-fiducial-validation", "hepkg:observable:mu-z-differential", "hepkg:observable:mu-z-fiducial-validation", "hepkg:observable:mu-z-inclusive", "hepkg:observable:mu-z-table10-fiducial", "hepkg:observable:p-value-mu-h-compatibility", "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-differential", "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-fiducial"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:034b22262abbdabecea85464", "hepkg:evidence:06943bce250e49f8e2d1c733", "hepkg:evidence:1a213708626f7