{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-45ce27e1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2403.01556 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2403.01556 defines 19 region selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- **\">=10% of associated tracks with |d_z| from PV < 0.01 cm\"**\n- **\"Additional jet fails DeepJet b tagging at loose working point\"**\n- **\"Additional jet passes DeepJet b tagging at medium working point\"**\n- **\"GNN (aGNN) EJ tagging score in [0,1] with track-jet association radius R_max=0.8\"**\n- **\"GNN (uGNN) EJ tagging score in [0,1] with track-jet association radius R_max=0.8\"**\n- **\"GNN score in a region disjoint from SR\"**\n- **\"H_T and EJ tagging thresholds optimized per signal model\"**\n- **\"H_T and jet pT requirements relaxed relative to SR\"**\n- **\"H_T requirement inverted relative to SR to ensure orthogonality\"**\n- **\"High H_T and >=4 jets, >=2 of which tagged as EJs\"**\n- **\"High-pT photon trigger, isolated photon pT>200 GeV in ECAL barrel, 1 or 2 jets\"**\n- **\"Identical event/jet kinematic requirements to SR but exactly one EJ-tagged jet\"**\n- **\"PV within 15 cm of detector center in z\"**\n- **\"Signal contamination <1%\"**\n- **\"Track-jet association radius R_max=0.4 for unflavored model-agnostic EJ tagging\"**\n- **\"Track-jet association radius R_max=0.8 for flavor-aligned model-agnostic EJ tagging\"**\n- **\"Validation EJ tagger based on a-tag 1 with one requirement relaxed\"**\n- **\"Validation EJ tagger based on u-tag 1 with one requirement relaxed\"**\n\nThese requirements are crucial for defining the regions used in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2403.01556"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.065}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:23873c95f0b76b46fc9d3f5f", "hepkg:evidence:26b17c7efef6be062434d2eb", "hepkg:evidence:2af49c462a0f44ab7f2c33ed", "hepkg:evidence:375e9487e8b96ad99c8bdb65", "hepkg:evidence:5913e29c91aa84b925508287", "hepkg:evidence:7b478dd81c42e57aabf384ce", "hepkg:evidence:8500b31c0df9a920e96148ac", "hepkg:evidence:8e55a3d34e3481a63389e7b9", "hepkg:evidence:998c27794ebdda738b2f874c", "hepkg:evidence:b1e35887737a0684ff4e1b9f", "hepkg:evidence:b35c93a73f97ee3f13f76ee8", "hepkg:evidence:c00605401efb86b63b320d85", "hepkg:evidence:c914c334b989873a144a85ed", "hepkg:evidence:cba16d79989ed091aeec7484", "hepkg:evidence:e09c5ab57478afeb0ed027d2", "hepkg:evidence:ecbd996b211c995b17de2e29", "hepkg:evidence:fa4c669bdcf292731f72d8b8"], "seen_values": ["0,1", "0.01", "0.4", "0.8", "01", "1", "10", "15", "2", "200", "2403.01556", "4", "a-tag", "additional", "agnn", "and", "associated", "association", "barrel", "based", "but", "center", "contamination", "d_z", "deepjet", "detector", "disjoint", "ecal", "ej-tagged", "ejs", "ensure", "event", "exactly", "fails", "flavor-aligned", "for", "from", "gev", "gnn", "h_t", "high", "high-pt", "identical", "inverted", "isolated", "jet", "jets", "kinematic", "loose", "medium", "model", "model-agnostic", "none", "one", "optimized", "orthogonality", "passes", "per", "photon", "point", "r_max", "radius", "region", "region_has_selection", "relative", "relaxed", "requirement", "requirements", "score", "signal", "tagged", "tagger", "tagging", "thresholds", "track-jet", "tracks", "trigger", "u-tag", "ugnn", "unflavored", "validation", "which", "with", "within", "working"], "verification_score": 0.875, "unsupported_claims": ["19"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7894, "completion_tokens": 459, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 21.607527803629637, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 21.607527803629637, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8353.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0