{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-492ed306", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2408.03744 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2408.03744 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- 20 < m_T < 40 GeV background-dominated validation region\n- Lepton antiisolated region (QCD multijet background estimation)\n- Lepton isolated region (QCD multijet background estimation)\n- W boson fiducial region (particle level)\n- W+ boson signal region (reconstructed level)\n- W- boson signal region (reconstructed level)\n- Z boson fiducial region (particle/generator level)\n- Z boson signal region (reconstructed level)\n- m_T < 20 GeV region used to measure QCD misidentification factors\n\nThese regions are used for various purposes, including background estimation, signal region definition, and validation.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2408.03744"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2408.03744"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:qcd_isolated", "hepkg:region:qcd_mf_measurement", "hepkg:region:qcd_mf_validation", "hepkg:region:qcd_nonisolated", "hepkg:region:w_fiducial", "hepkg:region:w_minus_signal_region", "hepkg:region:w_plus_signal_region", "hepkg:region:z_fiducial", "hepkg:region:z_signal_region"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0002f6574f61b53dc1b8d7b3", "hepkg:evidence:18e165ec071b5e7105657557", "hepkg:evidence:367b182335c17cc9b453eec4", "hepkg:evidence:37a06fb45b5b2367db35899a", "hepkg:evidence:3d42d604cc2089829b451756", "hepkg:evidence:aecba35171d303063d3a4f7a", "hepkg:evidence:b35e77da9da9cc2c8dfd3a0b", "hepkg:evidence:dadc2a2aabe05ca7518ef1a2", "hepkg:evidence:dca5182b3ef820495ecdddd8"], "seen_values"