{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-4b90b116", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2509.22535 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2509.22535 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- Electron reconstruction and identification efficiency uncertainty\n- Factorization scale (muF) uncertainty\n- Higgs boson branching fraction uncertainty\n- Inclusive signal/background cross section normalization uncertainty (scale, PDF+alphaS)\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy resolution uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty (7 independent sources)\n- Jet flavor tagging calibration uncertainty\n- L1 ECAL/muon prefiring correction uncertainty\n- Limited size of simulated (MC) samples uncertainty\n- ME-PS matching (hdamp) uncertainty\n- Minor background normalization uncertainties (single top, tWZ, ttW, gg splitting)\n- Muon reconstruction and identification uncertainty\n- PDF shape (NNPDF3.1) uncertainty\n- Parton shower ISR/FSR scale uncertainty\n- Pileup reweighting uncertainty\n- Renormalization scale (muR) uncertainty\n- Theoretical modeling uncertainty of ttbar+c and ttbar+light processes\n- Trigger efficiency uncertainty\n- Unclustered missing transverse momentum uncertainty\n- ttH signal simulation theoretical uncertainty\n- ttbar+>=1b modeling difference (4FS vs 5FS ME description) uncertainty\n- ttbar+jets background normalization factors (floated in CR fit)\n- ttbb double parton scattering (DPS) normalization uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis 2509.22535.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2208.12095", "2309.14442", "2402.08486", "2408.03744", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "co