{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-4bcdbc7d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2405.18661 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2405.18661 contains 10 channels, and these channels collectively define 28 event regions. Here are some of the regions:\n\n- **H -> gamma gamma**:\n  - Fiducial phase space\n  - ggH production region\n  - VBF production region\n  - VH hadronic region\n  - WH leptonic region\n  - ZH leptonic region\n  - ttH region\n  - tH region\n\n- **H -> ZZ -> 4 leptons**:\n  - Fiducial phase space\n  - ggH production region\n  - VBF production region\n  - VH hadronic region\n  - VH leptonic region\n  - ttH region\n  - On-shell signal region (105 < m4l < 140 GeV)\n\n- **H -> tau tau**:\n  - Fiducial phase space\n  - ggH production region\n  - VBF production region\n\n- **Inclusive jet production**:\n  - Fiducial phase space (pT > 133 GeV, |y| < 2.0)\n\n- **Opposite-sign WW diboson production**:\n  - Phase space with jet veto\n\n- **Single top quark t-channel production**:\n  - Signal region (two jets, one b jet)\n\n- **W -> lepton neutrino**:\n  - Leptonic selection region\n\n- **Z -> lepton lepton**:\n  - Leptonic selection region\n\n- **ttbar dileptonic e-mu**:\n  - Selection region\n\n- **H -> WW**:\n  - Fiducial phase space (e-mu channel)\n\nThese regions are defined to isolate specific physics processes and to control backgrounds in the analysis.\n\nAnswer: The analysis 2405.18661 contains 28 event regions across its 10 channels.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2405.18661", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2405.18661"], "predicate": "result_has_channel"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}, {"round": 1, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": [], "entity