{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-4ce80041", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2402.08486 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2402.08486 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- Jet, particle level (anti-kT R=0.4, excluding neutrinos)\n- Lepton (reconstructed, electron or muon)\n- Particle-level additional jet\n- Particle-level b jet\n- Particle-level dressed lepton (electron or muon)\n- Particle-level prompt neutrino\n- Particle-level top quark/antiquark candidate\n- Particle-level ttbar system\n- Parton-level top quark/antiquark\n- Parton-level ttbar system\n- Reconstructed additional (extra) jet not from top decay\n- Reconstructed b-tagged jet\n- Reconstructed electron\n- Reconstructed jet\n- Reconstructed missing transverse momentum (MET)\n- Reconstructed muon\n\nThese objects are defined in the context of the analysis reported in the paper 2402.08486.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956", "2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2402.08486"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2402.08486"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:b_jet_particle", "hepkg:object:b_jet_reco", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:extra_jet_particle", "hepkg:object:extra_jet_reco", "hepkg:object:jet_particle", "hepkg:object:jet_reco", "hepkg:object:lepton_particle", "hepkg:object:lepton_reco", "hepkg:object:met_reco", "hepkg:object:muon_reco", "hepkg:object:neutrino_particle", "hepkg:object:top_quark_particle", "hepkg:object:top_quark_parton", "hepkg:object:ttbar_system_particle", "hepkg:object:ttbar_system_parton"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:008bcf0e400fc9cb53409266", "hepkg:evidence:03fef4f41be75b6eef644a75", "hepkg:evidence:04c3