{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-4e866796", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many background-estimation methods does analysis 2407.10549 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2407.10549 uses three background-estimation methods:\n\n1. **Background-only fit (CRs only, no signal, floating WZ normalisation)**\n2. **Modified frequentist CL$_s$ approach with profile-likelihood test statistic in the asymptotic approximation**\n3. **Simultaneous binned maximum-likelihood fit to SR $m_{bb}$ distributions and CR event yields with free-floating background normalizations and Gaussian-constrained nuisance parameters**\n\nThese methods are recorded in the graph as statistical methods used by the analysis. \n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2106.01676", "2407.10549"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2407.10549"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:background-only-fit", "hepkg:method:binned-ml-fit-simultaneous", "hepkg:method:cls-profile-likelihood-asymptotic"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:11aef175783c533f2b117f47", "hepkg:evidence:6e129b7c02850bfa009a490b", "hepkg:evidence:7609dffe1181e5bef124b319", "hepkg:evidence:80f1039d8b6600c1e36df7fb", "hepkg:evidence:da561d241963e7a6ded9d521"], "seen_values": ["2407.10549", "and", "approach", "approximation", "asymptotic", "background", "background-only", "binned", "crs", "distributions", "event", "fit", "floating", "free-floating", "frequentist", "gaussian-constrained", "hepkg:method:background-only-fit", "hepkg:method:binned-ml-fit-simultaneous", "hepkg:method:cls-profile-likelihood-asymptotic", "maximum-likelihood", "modified", "normalisation", "normalizations"