{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-52c2e07c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2004.01678 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2004.01678 defines 11 region selection requirements.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.01678"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.065}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:7fec6b532419de48cc866f63", "hepkg:evidence:ab2ca04068c8b6874969b5eb", "hepkg:evidence:b96a18638ba5999673480cca", "hepkg:evidence:d9e71988434560d046ae5a2c", "hepkg:evidence:dddddf87b144c3503e138a13", "hepkg:evidence:ea6e2f35558d02837ceb98d6"], "seen_values": ["0.0341", "0.0524", "12", "120", "135", "155", "175", "2004.01678", "25", "250", "abcd", "estimate", "gev", "identified", "m_llj", "modified", "none", "region", "region_has_selection", "requirement", "signal", "the", "with"], "verification_score": 0.5, "unsupported_claims": ["11"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7448, "completion_tokens": 234, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 11.367859687190503, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 11.367859687190503, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7682.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 0.5, "unsupported_claims": 1.0, "count_correct": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 0.0, "evidence_quotes": 6.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-536b1387", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2208.12095 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2208.12095 defines 18 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \"E_T > 28 GeV\"\n- \"JVT requirement applied for pT<60 GeV and |eta|<2.4, to reject pile-up jets\"\n- \"MV2c10 operating point with 77% b-tagging efficiency in simulated ttbar events\"\n- \"at least two associated ID tracks\"\n- \"excluded if 1.37 < |eta_cluster| < 1.52 (barrel-endcap transition region)\"\n- \"medium identification quality criteria\"\n- \"pT > 25 GeV and |eta| < 2.5\"\n- \"pT- and eta-dependent track/calorimeter isolation requirement\"\n- \"p_T of associated ID tracks > 0.5 GeV\"\n- \"reduced phase-space requirement |Delta|eta_ll|| < 2.5\"\n- \"tight likelihood-based identification\"\n- \"track isolation defined similarly to electrons\"\n- \"trimmed with R_sub=0.2 and f_cut=5%\"\n- \"vectorial sum includes calibrated electrons, muons, photons, hadronic taus, and small-R jets, plus soft track term\"\n- \"|d0|/sigma(d0) < 5 and |z0 sin(theta)| < 0.5 mm\"\n- \"|eta_cluster| < 2.47\"\n- \"|eta| < 2.5, pT > 28 GeV, |d0|/sigma(d0) < 3, |z0 sin(theta)| < 0.5 mm\"\n\nThese requirements are detailed in the paper and are used to define the selection criteria for the objects in the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2208.12095 defines 18 object selection requirements. These include criteria such as 'E_T > 28 GeV', 'JVT requirement applied for pT<60 GeV and |eta|<2.4, to reject pile-up jets', and 'MV2c10 operating point with 77% b-tagging efficiency in simulated ttbar events'.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2208.12095"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0aa845d78caf26756c027485", "hepkg:evidence:1d74ee9b589366bd162e872d", "hepkg:evidence:3efc84653d3a779f644c734b", "hepkg:evidence:436509c33922af8677bd9aa1", "hepkg:evidence:4952eb9ae292e7b306c55d56", "hepkg:evidence:562175e7a87d71098c2f1648", "hepkg:evidence:71b196a627333e871b9bb98c", "hepkg:evidence:ab2f8c1bbdbefc0d1c47ab53", "hepkg:evidence:b1e2bf3ada064d8dbb077c91", "hepkg:evidence:b937da2d29e7a3aa27032e8d", "hepkg:evidence:bd5e484309a8c6c84bb073fe", "hepkg:evidence:cf27e753ac346f8a4ca882b9", "hepkg:evidence:d91c30c967cfd94583a127a1", "hepkg:evidence:e7d269d460eff81aa7aca677", "hepkg:evidence:f5c6d4e98b7e832c3396cc55", "hepkg:evidence:f76343c9deac80f0b9cf11f5"], "seen_values": ["0", "0.2", "0.5", "1.37", "1.52", "2.4", "2.47", "2.5", "2208.12095", "25", "28", "3", "5", "6", "60", "77", "and", "applied", "associated", "b-tagging", "barrel-endcap", "calibrated", "calorimeter", "criteria", "defined", "delta", "e_t", "efficiency", "electrons", "eta", "eta-dependent", "eta_cluster", "eta_ll", "events", "excluded", "f_cut", "for", "gev", "hadronic", "identification", "includes", "isolation", "jets", "jvt", "least", "likelihood-based", "medium", "muons", "mv2c10", "none", "object_has_selection", "operating", "p_t", "phase-space", "photons", "pile-up", "plus", "point", "pt-", "quality", "r_sub", "reduced", "region", "reject", "requirement", "sigma", "similarly", "simulated", "sin", "small-r", "soft", "sum", "taus", "term", "theta", "tight", "track", "tracks", "transition", "trimmed", "ttbar", "two", "vectorial", "with"], "verification_score": 0.9230769230769231, "unsupported_claims": ["18"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7838, "completion_tokens": 527, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 23.552856548689306, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 23.552856