{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-536c39b5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2001.06899 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2001.06899 measures the following observables:\n\n- Cross section ratio \\( R(b/j) = \\sigma(Z+b\\ \\text{jets})/\\sigma(Z+\\ \\text{jets}) \\)\n- Cross section ratio \\( R(c/b) = \\sigma(Z+c\\ \\text{jets})/\\sigma(Z+b\\ \\text{jets}) \\)\n- Cross section ratio \\( R(c/j) = \\sigma(Z+c\\ \\text{jets})/\\sigma(Z+\\ \\text{jets}) \\)\n- Scale factor \\( SF_b \\): MC-to-data scale factor for \\( Z+b \\) jets yield from \\( M_{SV} \\) template fit\n- Scale factor \\( SF_c \\): MC-to-data scale factor for \\( Z+c \\) jets yield from \\( M_{SV} \\) template fit\n- \\( Z+b \\) jets event HF tagging efficiency (\\( \\epsilon^{b\\_\\text{tag}} \\))\n- \\( Z+c \\) jets event HF tagging efficiency (\\( \\epsilon^{c\\_\\text{tag}} \\))\n- \\( Z+ \\) light jets HF mistagging rate\n\nThese observables are recorded in the paper with the arXiv ID 2001.06899.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2001.06899"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:R_b_over_j", "hepkg:observable:R_c_over_b", "hepkg:observable:R_c_over_j", "hepkg:observable:b_jet_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:c_jet_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:light_jet_mistag_rate", "hepkg:observable:scale_factor_b", "hepkg:observable:scale_factor_c"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:08f1e8d2abe9563bb8e2c78c", "hepkg:evidence:0966f04bd72c7c0cfee7677b", "hepkg:evidence:254498640c811103860acbd2", "hepkg:evidence:37cf05d621b2f47bfb9e1c29", "hepkg:evidence:53f3268dc84fcdc72a2667c7", "hepkg:evidence:5e73c4af5e3d