{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-54269d7a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2604.27044 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2604.27044 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- **HH->4b signal samples for combinations of kappa_V, kappa_2V, kappa_lambda coupling modifiers**\n- **Single Higgs production background MC sample (VH NLO POWHEG; ttH and gg->ZH LO)**\n- **Single top quark background MC sample (NLO, POWHEG)**\n- **VBF HH->4b signal MC sample (LO, MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6.5)**\n- **VV (diboson) background MC sample (NLO, POWHEG)**\n- **W/Z + jets background MC sample (LO, MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, up to 4 partons)**\n- **ggF HH->4b signal MC sample (NLO, POWHEG 2.0, mHH-reweighted)**\n- **ttbar background MC sample (NLO, POWHEG v2.0, NNLO-normalized via Top++)**\n\nThese samples cover various signal and background processes relevant to the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.27044"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:hh-anomalous-coupling-signals", "hepkg:sample:hh-ggf-nlo-powheg", "hepkg:sample:hh-vbf-lo-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:singleh-mc", "hepkg:sample:singletop-nlo-powheg", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-nlo-powheg", "hepkg:sample:vjets-lo-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:vv-nlo-powheg"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:2a855f0b49964ea21a9af69f", "hepkg:evidence:8b8f5221f78696673f6bd6ea", "hepkg:evidence:ab7e100bfed455faaaea533e", "hepkg:evidence:b9b4eb525ae5d18e3c3403e3", "hepkg:evidence:f3d7a37ef52ae9147fb04163", "hepkg:evidence:f3d7f9b246eea803e103658f"], "seen_values": ["2", "2.0", "2.6.5", "2604.27044", "4", "and", "background", "combinations", "coupling", "diboson", "for", "gg