{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-59f9207a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2107.12553 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2107.12553 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- **Signal Regions**: 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in \\(N_H\\), \\(N_{\\text{jets}}\\), \\(p_T^{\\text{miss}}\\) (Table 8)\n- **Preselection Region**: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6)\n- **W+jets Control Region**: MB/BDT-CRW (W+jets control region)\n- **Top Quark Validation Region**: Top quark background validation region (\\(m_{bb} > 150 \\, \\text{GeV}\\) sideband)\n- **Top Quark Control Region**: Top quark control region (inverted low-\\(m_{CT}\\) sideband)\n\nThese regions are used to define the different parts of the phase space where the analysis is performed.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2107.12553", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2107.12553"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:cr-top", "hepkg:region:cr-w", "hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:signal-regions", "hepkg:region:vr-top"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0ee2cb2526842a9fa9a8f78f", "hepkg:evidence:2395712ef9a876304feb0b28", "hepkg:evidence:547c6a6f78ae8ea54e39f0dc", "hepkg:evidence:7ccfa8375acc9d910c7f808a"], "seen_values": ["12", "15", "150", "2107.12553", "6", "8", "all", "background", "baseline", "bdt-crw", "categorized", "channel_has_region", "common", "control", "event_region", "gev", "hepkg:region:cr-top", "hepkg:region:cr-w", "hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:signal-regions", "hepkg:region:vr-top", "inverted", "jet