{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-5e39323d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2111.08340 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2111.08340 measures the following observables:\n\n- Differential Higgs boson production cross section in four \\( p_T^H \\) bins (300-450, 450-650, 650-1000, >1000 GeV)\n- Higgs boson fiducial production cross section, \\( p_T^H > 450 \\) GeV, \\( |y_H| < 2 \\)\n- Higgs boson signal strength in four \\( p_T^H \\) STXS volumes (300-450, 450-650, 650-1000, >1000 GeV)\n- Higgs boson signal strength within fiducial volume (\\( p_T^H > 450 \\) GeV, \\( |y_H| < 2 \\))\n- Higgs boson signal strength, inclusive region (candidate jet \\( p_T > 250 \\) GeV)\n- V+jets (W→qq', Z→qq) signal strength validation, \\( p_T^V > 450 \\) GeV (VRL)\n- Z+jets (Z→bb) signal strength, inclusive region (validation measurement)\n- Z+jets signal strength in four jet-\\( p_T \\) bins (validation of differential procedure)\n- Z+jets signal strength, jet \\( p_T > 450 \\) GeV (Table 10 fiducial fit)\n- Z→bb signal strength validation in SR, \\( p_T^Z > 450 \\) GeV (test with Higgs fixed to SM)\n- p-value for compatibility of the four differential Higgs boson signal strengths\n- ttbar normalization signal strength in four jet-\\( p_T \\) bins\n- ttbar normalization signal strength, inclusive region\n- ttbar normalization signal strength, jet \\( p_T > 450 \\) GeV (Table 10 fiducial fit)\n\nThese observables cover a range of measurements related to Higgs boson production, signal strengths, and validation of various processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2111.08340"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2111.08340"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "ent