{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-5f8aacb2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2401.07090 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2401.07090 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- Inclusive b hadron simulated sample(s)\n- Inclusive soft QCD Pythia sample with b hadron production filter\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\overline{D}^0(\\rightarrow K^+\\pi^-)\\pi^+ \\) sample without charm veto\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi K^*(892)^+ \\) sample\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi K^+ \\) resonant sample\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow K^*(892)^+ l^+l^- \\) sample\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ l^+l^- \\) signal sample (nonresonant)\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\psi(2S) K^*(892)^+ \\) sample\n- Simulated \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\psi(2S) K^+ \\) resonant sample\n- Simulated \\( B^0 \\rightarrow J/\\psi K^*(892)^0 \\) sample\n- Simulated \\( B^0 \\rightarrow K^*(892)^0 l^+l^- \\) sample\n- Simulated \\( B^0 \\rightarrow \\psi(2S) K^*(892)^0 \\) sample\n- Simulated Cabibbo-suppressed \\( B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi \\pi^+ \\) sample\n- Simulated Cabibbo-suppressed \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\pi^+ l^+l^- \\) sample\n- Simulated Cabibbo-suppressed \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\psi(2S) \\pi^+ \\) sample\n- Simulated charmless \\( B^+ \\rightarrow K^+\\pi^-\\pi^+ \\) sample\n- Simulated minimum bias pileup sample\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various decay processes and backgrounds relevant to the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2401.07090"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.07090"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:mc_b0_jpsi_kstar0", "hepkg:sample:mc_b0_kstar0_ll", "hepkg:sample:mc_b0_psi2s_