{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-62e93d5d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2510.07527 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2510.07527 measures the following observables:\n\n- Inclusive HH production signal strength (μ = σ_HH / σ_HH^SM)\n- VBF HH production signal strength (μ_VBF = σ_VBF HH / σ_VBF HH^SM)\n- VHH production signal strength (μ_VHH = σ_VHH / σ_VHH^SM)\n- c2 (two-top two-Higgs contact coupling)\n- cos(α), singlet-Higgs mixing angle\n- κ_2V (two-Higgs two-vector-boson coupling modifier)\n- κ_λ (Higgs trilinear self-coupling modifier)\n- ξ = (v/f)^2, MCHM compactness parameter\n\nThese observables are recorded in the paper with the arXiv ID 2510.07527.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2510.07527"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:hh_incl_signal_strength", "hepkg:observable:hh_vbf_signal_strength", "hepkg:observable:vhh_signal_strength", "hepkg:parameter:c2", "hepkg:parameter:cos_alpha", "hepkg:parameter:kappa_2v", "hepkg:parameter:kappa_lambda", "hepkg:parameter:xi"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:022994efa27360a76cbd6be7", "hepkg:evidence:04d0f8ab38ae7e36cd407c5b", "hepkg:evidence:0aa45d03875ac61d1192e57a", "hepkg:evidence:0cf51d6f0b752c9e737407ac", "hepkg:evidence:11eae09f4c85d27bad686a46", "hepkg:evidence:1809bf2400545a9284b252fe", "hepkg:evidence:2d970b90c6988d7e9b5bbba5", "hepkg:evidence:3f49deb52f0df04c991f17c2", "hepkg:evidence:416190a56e94f81b0b090f72", "hepkg:evidence:4715b44dd122d1b577f11591", "hepkg:evidence:50d29737af045cb9cb04e93a", "hepkg:evidence:52ccb4990dbd6ad66a5a2567", "hepkg:evidence:550d4cb14ccd94c37f5eb7c4", "hepkg:evidence:5c221d460a4