{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-65acc86d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2206.09466 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2206.09466 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- Drell-Yan background MC sample\n- Electroweak WW+2 jets (VBS topology) background MC sample\n- Gluon-induced WW background MC sample\n- Gluon-induced ZH signal MC sample\n- Quark-induced ZH signal MC sample\n- Quark-initiated nonresonant WW background MC sample\n- Single top quark (tW, s-, t-channel) background MC sample\n- Triboson background MC sample\n- VBF signal MC sample\n- VZ/V* diboson (mass down to 100 MeV) background MC sample\n- W+gamma (ISR photon) background MC sample\n- W+gamma* (mass below 100 MeV) background sample\n- WH signal MC sample\n- bbH signal MC sample\n- ggH signal MC sample\n- ttH signal MC sample\n- ttbar background MC sample\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various background and signal processes in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.04363", "2206.09466"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2206.09466"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:bbh-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:dy-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:ggh-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:single-top-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:triboson-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:tth-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:vbf-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:vz-vstar-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:wgamma-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:wgammastar-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:wh-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:ww-ewk-2j-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:ww-gg-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:ww-qq-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:zh-gg-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:zh-qq-signal-mc