{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-65b5ed9a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many statistical methods does analysis 2112.03161 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2112.03161 uses four statistical methods:\n\n- 2D binned maximum likelihood fit of \\( m_{bb} \\) and \\( m_{HH} \\) distributions\n- Asymptotic approximation of the CLs method for 95% CL upper limits\n- Likelihood ratio goodness-of-fit test using the saturated model\n- Pseudo-experiments used to validate asymptotic limit calculation and test signal-fit bias\n\nThese methods are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"A 2D binned maximum likelihood fit of the \\( m_{bb} \\) and \\( m_{HH} \\) distributions is performed.\"\n- \"The asymptotic approximation of the CLs method is used to set 95% CL upper limits.\"\n- \"A likelihood ratio goodness-of-fit test using the saturated model is performed.\"\n- \"Pseudo-experiments are used to validate the asymptotic limit calculation and to test for any potential signal-fit bias.\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2112.03161 uses **4** statistical methods.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2112.03161 uses 4 statistical methods: 2D binned maximum likelihood fit of \\( m_{bb} \\) and \\( m_{HH} \\) distributions, asymptotic approximation of the CLs method for 95% CL upper limits, likelihood ratio goodness-of-fit test using the saturated model, and pseudo-experiments used to validate asymptotic limit calculation and test signal-fit bias.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2112.03161", "2201.11585"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2112.03161"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:cls_asymptotic", "hepkg:method:goodness_of_fit_saturated", "hepkg:method:ml_fit_2d", "hepkg:method:pseudoexperiments_crosscheck"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:05c964f0b33167be71d5b7a8", "hepkg:evidence:7dd38e4b699ab3ee943162be", "hepkg:evidence:8b6262f4d7c09fcccd20764c", "hepkg:evidence:bfb3c17c2721c5db0f15c18c", "hepkg:evidence:e1682016e18285e291d29717"], "seen_values": ["2", "2112.03161", "95", "and", "approximation", "asymptotic", "bias", "binned", "calculation", "cls", "distributions", "fit", "for", "goodness-of-fit", "hepkg:method:cls_asymptotic", "hepkg:method:goodness_of_fit_saturated", "hepkg:method:ml_fit_2d", "hepkg:method:pseudoexperiments_crosscheck", "likelihood", "limit", "limits", "m_bb", "m_hh", "maximum", "method", "model", "pseudo-experiments", "ratio", "result_uses_statistical_method", "saturated", "signal-fit", "statistical_method", "test", "the", "upper", "used", "using", "validate"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7156, "completion_tokens": 386, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 17.124905282165855, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 17.124905282165855, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7542.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 4.0, "evidence_quotes": 5.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-65c23552", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2001.06899 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2001.06899 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- High-purity ttbar control region for b jet M_SV template (lepton+≥2 jets, ≥1 b-tagged jet)\n- Particle-level fiducial phase space\n- Semileptonic ttbar validation sample for c jet M_SV template (muon+≥4 jets)\n- W+jets validation sample for light-jet M_SV template (muon+≥1 jet)\n- Z+HF jets sample (HF-tagged region)\n- Z+jets baseline selection region\n\nThese regions are used to define the different parts of the phase space where the analysis is performed.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2001.06899"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:fiducial_particle_level", "hepkg:region:ttbar_bjet_template_cr", "hepkg:region:ttbar_semileptonic_c_template_cr", "hepkg:region:wjets_light_template_cr", "hepkg:region:z_plus_hf_jets", "hepkg:region:z_plus_jets_baseline"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:135db9c378c3b70e5621c664", "hepkg:evidence:404113ab2f55838c508ca55f", "hepkg:evidence:617e67299b127a74f7fa1184", "hepkg:evidence:ba227061b216f9422a20602b", "hepkg:evidence:ba6af461b8444b547387f75c", "hepkg:evidence:f2bb50f78e0e04fdc10e19eb"], "seen_values": ["1", "2", "2001.06899", "4", "b-tagged", "baseline", "channel_has_region", "control", "event_region", "fiducial", "for", "hepkg:region:fiducial_particle_level", "hepkg:region:ttbar_bjet_template_cr", "hepkg:region:ttbar_semileptonic_c_template_cr", "hepkg:region:wjets_light_template_cr", "hepkg:region:z_plus_hf_jets", "hepkg:region:z_plu