{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-65e731ed", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2401.07090 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2401.07090 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- Electron channel baseline preselection (B+ mass 4.7-5.7 GeV, prior to q² binning)\n- High-mass sideband (5.49 < m(Kℓℓ) < 5.65 GeV)\n- High-q² region above ψ(2S), electron channel (studied but excluded from final analysis)\n- J/ψ control region (8.41 < q² < 10.24 GeV²)\n- Low-mass sideband, electron channel (4.91 < m(Kee) < 5.07 GeV)\n- Low-mass sideband, muon channel (4.90 < m(Kμμ) < 5.07 GeV)\n- Low-q² signal region (1.1 < q² < 6.0 GeV², K+ℓℓ mass 5.07-5.49 GeV)\n- Muon channel baseline preselection (B+ mass 5.0-5.6 GeV, prior to q² binning)\n- Same-sign lepton control region (SR selection with inverted OS requirement, used for BDT background)\n- ψ(2S) control region (12.6 < q² < 14.44 GeV²)\n\nThese regions are used to define different parts of the phase space for the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2401.07090"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.07090"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:high_mass_sb", "hepkg:region:high_q2_electron_excluded", "hepkg:region:jpsi_cr", "hepkg:region:low_mass_sb_electron", "hepkg:region:low_mass_sb_muon", "hepkg:region:low_q2_sr", "hepkg:region:preselection_electron", "hepkg:region:preselection_muon", "hepkg:region:psi2s_cr", "hepkg:region:same_sign_cr"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:279ab5bcbfee63a1d30e3a39", "hepkg:evidence:3127880a58346a60ffa5d0ac", "hepkg:evidence:362c6696efaec4ccbd58c4db", "hepkg:evidence:67e1a4159954b1102bb396f2", "hepkg:evidence:7da5a98a46ca36b