{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-6668122b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which background-estimation methods does analysis 2103.06956 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2103.06956 uses the following background-estimation methods:\n\n- Discrete profiling method for background \\( m_{\\gamma\\gamma} \\) modelling\n\nAdditionally, it employs the following statistical methods:\n\n- Asimov dataset for SM expected results\n- CLs procedure for exclusion limits\n- F-test for determining functional form / parameter order\n- Profile likelihood test statistic\n- Simultaneous binned maximum likelihood fit to \\( m_{\\gamma\\gamma} \\) distributions\n\nThese methods are used to estimate and model the background in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956", "2109.13808"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.06956"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background_method:discrete_profiling", "hepkg:statmethod:asimov_dataset", "hepkg:statmethod:binned_ml_fit", "hepkg:statmethod:cls_procedure", "hepkg:statmethod:f_test", "hepkg:statmethod:profile_likelihood_test_statistic"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:81c42ce576b9768794199c50", "hepkg:evidence:b11845bd83bfc8c1b326fd57", "hepkg:evidence:c5c6dc3cbd8201956e1fa63b", "hepkg:evidence:e1b0e040ed727a0cced3965a"], "seen_values": ["2103.06956", "asimov", "background", "background_method", "binned", "cls", "dataset", "determining", "discrete", "distributions", "exclusion", "expected", "f-test", "fit", "for", "form", "functional", "hepkg:background_method:discrete_profiling", "hepkg:statmethod:asimov_dataset", "hepkg:statmethod:binned_ml_fit", "hepkg:statmethod:cls_procedure", "hepkg:statmethod:f_test", "hepkg:stat