{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-68a63983", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2012.01581 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2012.01581 measures the following observables:\n\n- 95% CL exclusion limit on gluino/top-squark mass as a function of mean proper decay length\n- 95% CL upper limit on LLP pair production cross section\n- 95% CL upper limit on branching fraction of SM-like Higgs boson to two long-lived scalar particles\n\nThese measurements are supported by the following evidence from the paper:\n\n- \"95% CL exclusion limit on gluino/top-squark mass as a function of mean proper decay length\"\n- \"95% CL upper limit on LLP pair production cross section\"\n- \"95% CL upper limit on branching fraction of SM-like Higgs boson to two long-lived scalar particles\"\n\nWould you like to see the exact quotes from the paper?\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2012.01581 measures the following observables:\\n\\n- 95% CL exclusion limit on gluino/top-squark mass as a function of mean proper decay length\\n- 95% CL upper limit on LLP pair production cross section\\n- 95% CL upper limit on branching fraction of SM-like Higgs boson to two long-lived scalar particles\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.01581"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.01581"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:higgs_br_ul", "hepkg:observable:llp_mass_exclusion_limit", "hepkg:observable:pair_production_cross_section_ul"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:104565d247f69631012d1150", "hepkg:evidence:4b689d2927aa533f3d8befb9", "hepkg:evidenc