{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-68b9930c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2202.08676 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2202.08676 defines 18 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \"3D impact parameter significance < 10 (2016), 12 (2017), 9 (2018)\"\n- \"DeepCSV medium working point b-tagging\"\n- \"DeepTau discriminant against jets, electrons, muons\"\n- \"barrel: |dz|<0.1 cm, |dxy|<0.05 cm; endcap: |dz|<0.2 cm, |dxy|<0.1 cm\"\n- \"electron discarded if a b-tagged jet (pT>10 GeV, |eta|<2.5) found within DeltaR<0.4\"\n- \"electrons within DeltaR<0.05 of a selected muon are discarded\"\n- \"h candidates within DeltaR<0.5 of a selected electron or muon are discarded\"\n- \"identification efficiency 60-75% for b quark jets, ~10% mistag c, ~1% mistag light/gluon\"\n- \"jets outside DeltaR=0.4 cone around a selected muon, electron, or tau_h candidate\"\n- \"medium cut-based ID (shower shape and track quality requirements)\"\n- \"muon discarded if a b-tagged jet (pT>10 GeV, |eta|<2.5) found within DeltaR<0.4\"\n- \"pT > 10 GeV, |eta| < 2.4\"\n- \"pT > 20 GeV, |eta| < 2.3\"\n- \"pT > 30 GeV, |eta| < 2.4\"\n- \"relative isolation < 0.0478+0.506 GeV/pT (barrel, |eta|<1.479) or < 0.0658+0.963 GeV/pT (endcap, |eta|>1.479), DeltaR=0.3\"\n- \"relative isolation < 0.15, DeltaR=0.4\"\n- \"|dz| < 0.2 cm\"\n- \"|dz|<0.1 cm, |dxy|<0.05 cm\"\n\nThese requirements are detailed in the paper and are used to select and identify various detector objects.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2202.08676 defines 18 object selection requirements. These include criteria for impact parameter significance, b-tagging, tau identification, electron and muon isolation, and jet selection, among others.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2202.08676"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1101c5f63db0c69846f6813a", "hepkg:evidence:19fe1e4f6024613937888f4b", "hepkg:evidence:328ebfc5c98d587bc0408b40", "hepkg:evidence:4fd957de8247876ca0dc74e2", "hepkg:evidence:51e80b507720dde459a4465d", "hepkg:evidence:60195361945be8a27e54280f", "hepkg:evidence:626b2af95afb14455645ed65", "hepkg:evidence:77dd3e96cc344a624e5fd959", "hepkg:evidence:9a90de78e9a01292b5c92e1c", "hepkg:evidence:a68555ccf819cea40bad3eae", "hepkg:evidence:aee6b321dea107ff9fd44fc0", "hepkg:evidence:b1fbbd982f23b4d6346029b5", "hepkg:evidence:bc189301ad4f33f9805119f9", "hepkg:evidence:bc783e0710460481f781c527", "hepkg:evidence:d178bc679ae27787decd0a45", "hepkg:evidence:f8c552683d93b6157d2c322b", "hepkg:evidence:fb7e8fce408fd5ff1ae89c1b", "hepkg:evidence:fb7f325f0c7833553c12af2a"], "seen_values": ["-75", "0.0478", "0.05", "0.0658", "0.1", "0.15", "0.2", "0.3", "0.4", "0.5", "0.506", "0.963", "1", "1.479", "10", "12", "2", "2.3", "2.4", "2.5", "20", "2016", "2017", "2018", "2202.08676", "3", "30", "6", "60", "9", "against", "and", "are", "around", "b-tagged", "b-tagging", "barrel", "candidate", "candidates", "cone", "cut-based", "deepcsv", "deeptau", "deltar", "discarded", "discriminant", "dxy", "efficiency", "electron", "electrons", "endcap", "eta", "for", "found", "gev", "gluon", "identification", "impact", "isolation", "jet", "jets", "light", "medium", "mistag", "muon", "muons", "none", "object_has_selection", "outside", "parameter", "point", "quality", "quark", "relative", "requirements", "selected", "shape", "shower", "significance", "tau_h", "track", "within", "working"], "verification_score": 0.92, "unsupported_claims": ["18", "75"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8031, "completio