{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-6b7a73d7", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2404.06204 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2404.06204 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Diboson background\n- QCD multijet background in the W→l ν selection\n- QCD multijet background in the Z→l l selection\n- Top quark (tt̄ + single top) background\n- W→l ν background (W→τ ν decays and electron charge misidentification)\n- Z→l l background contribution in the W→l ν selection\n- Z→τ τ background in the Z→l l selection\n\nThis information is directly from the paper 2404.06204.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2107.12553", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2404.06204", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2404.06204"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:multijet-w", "hepkg:background:multijet-z", "hepkg:background:top-quark", "hepkg:background:w-lnu-bg-tau-chargemisid", "hepkg:background:z-ll-in-w-selection", "hepkg:background:z-tautau-in-z-selection"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:23180f16d85b60b3d57a15b9", "hepkg:evidence:4344e9b9b10ee16d32adf61a", "hepkg:evidence:814fedd54fb2d7c9473da389", "hepkg:evidence:af874422e95d36874910e520", "hepkg:evidence:b3df3e51aa2a837a8b5eec48", "hepkg:evidence:c5e0418de394ad68dfb25a8d"], "seen_values": ["2404.06204", "and", "background", "charge", "contribution", "decays", "diboson", "electron", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:multijet-w", "hepkg:background:multijet-z", "hepkg:background:top-quark", "hepkg:background:w-lnu-bg-tau-chargemisid", "hepkg:background:z-ll-in-w-selection