{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-6c0e9340", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2112.03161 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2112.03161 uses 12 simulated samples:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}$ simulated sample\n- $t\\bar{t}H$ background MC sample\n- QCD multijet background MC sample\n- Signal MC sample: pp -> X -> HH -> bb VV* (V=W,Z), spin-0 radion and spin-2 bulk graviton\n- Single top background MC sample\n- W+jets background MC sample\n- WW diboson production MC sample\n- WZ diboson production MC sample\n- Z/gamma* -> ll + jets background MC sample\n- ZZ diboson production MC sample\n- ttbar + W/Z associated production (ttW, ttZ) MC sample\n\nThis list is based on the information recorded in the graph for this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2503.19420", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2112.03161"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.06}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:qcd_multijet", "hepkg:sample:signal_bbVV", "hepkg:sample:singletop", "hepkg:sample:ttH", "hepkg:sample:ttV", "hepkg:sample:ttbar", "hepkg:sample:wjets", "hepkg:sample:ww", "hepkg:sample:wz_diboson", "hepkg:sample:zllgamma_jets", "hepkg:sample:zz"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:07cb901083af522d49ed6b16", "hepkg:evidence:122cfdfd472a1a56c510a5c0", "hepkg:evidence:5aeb135c2c98dd0e66219557", "hepkg:evidence:5d5237dbe9128b5c82004a23", "hepkg:evidence:6f2a06c6c31df3673eac8abd", "hepkg:evidence:92d1c4fa9e4ebcdaa2b49d0a", "hepkg:evidence:92db5257a4b0766389fbf98e"], "seen_values": ["2112.03161", "and", "associated", "background", "bar", "bulk", "diboson", "gamma", "graviton", "hepkg:sample:qcd_multije