{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-6c5c572f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2506.13565 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2506.13565 targets the following physics processes:\n\n1. **b → s ℓ+ℓ− flavor-changing neutral current transition**\n2. **qq̄ → ℓ+ℓ− via bbℓℓ four-fermion contact interaction**\n\nThese processes are explicitly mentioned in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2506.13565"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.019}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:b-to-s-ll-fcnc", "hepkg:process:qq-to-ll-ci"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:642bba0349759b812338a766", "hepkg:evidence:6ee29db472c10f926dfcd0d7"], "seen_values": ["2506.13565", "contact", "current", "flavor-changing", "four-fermion", "hepkg:process:b-to-s-ll-fcnc", "hepkg:process:qq-to-ll-ci", "interaction", "neutral", "physics_process", "result_targets_process", "transition", "via"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7000, "completion_tokens": 108, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 5.257660332135856, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 5.257660332135856, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7108.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 2.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 1.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-6c84d084", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2206.09466 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2206.09466 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale uncertainty\n- Lepton momentum scale uncertainty\n- Limited MC simulation sample size (statistical) uncertainty\n- Missing higher-order QCD corrections (mu_R, mu_F scale variation)\n- Nonprompt lepton background estimation uncertainty\n- PDF and alpha_S uncertainty\n- Parton shower and underlying event modeling uncertainty\n- Pileup jet identification efficiency uncertainty\n- Pileup modeling uncertainty\n- Single top / ttbar relative fraction uncertainty\n- Trigger and lepton reconstruction/identification efficiency uncertainty\n- Unclustered energy scale (p_T^miss) uncertainty\n- V-gamma* process normalization uncertainty\n- WW gluon-induced component relative fraction uncertainty\n- b tagging efficiency uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis as part of the systematic evaluation.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2106.01676", "2110.11231", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2206.09466"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:b-tagging-efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:integrated-luminosity", "hepkg:systematic:jet-energy-resolution", "hepkg:systematic:jet-energy-scale", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-momentum-scale", "hepkg:systematic:mc-statistical-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:met-unclus