{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-6d75d7fb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2302.05225 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2302.05225 targets 2 physics processes:\n\n1. \\( H \\rightarrow e \\tau \\) (lepton-flavour-violating Higgs decay)\n2. \\( H \\rightarrow \\mu \\tau \\) (lepton-flavour-violating Higgs decay)\n\nThese processes are recorded in the graph as targeting by the analysis. \n\nHere is the supporting evidence:\n- For \\( H \\rightarrow e \\tau \\): \"H -> e tau (lepton-flavour-violating Higgs decay)\"\n- For \\( H \\rightarrow \\mu \\tau \\): \"H -> mu tau (lepton-flavour-violating Higgs decay)\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2302.05225 targets 2 physics processes.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2302.05225 targets 2 physics processes: 1. \\( H \\\\rightarrow e \\\\tau \\\\) (lepton-flavour-violating Higgs decay) 2. \\( H \\\\rightarrow \\\\mu \\\\tau \\\\) (lepton-flavour-violating Higgs decay). These processes are recorded in the graph as targeting by the analysis.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2302.05225"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2302.05225"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.019}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:h_to_etau", "hepkg:process:h_to_mutau"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:fead9f49345278dd8dadad23"], "seen_values": ["2302.05225", "decay", "hepkg:process:h_to_etau", "hepkg:process:h_to_mutau", "higgs", "lepton-flavour-violating", "physics_process", "result_targets_process", "tau"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 6991, "completion_tokens": 306, "