{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-6e9eb5f8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many quantities does analysis 2403.01556 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2403.01556 reports 16 distinct quantities. Here are some examples:\n\n- Maximum ML-based signal selection efficiency: 60% for \\( c\\tau_{\\pi_{\\text{Dark}}} = 45 \\) mm.\n- Maximum model-agnostic signal selection efficiency: 40% for \\( c\\tau_{\\pi_{\\text{Dark}}} = 45 \\) mm.\n- Average b jet fraction of selected jets in the b-depleted region (DR): 4%.\n- Average b jet fraction of selected jets in the b-enriched region (ER): 15%.\n- Excluded \\( m_{X_{\\text{dark}}} \\) upper bound (flavor-aligned model, combined benchmark grid): 1950 GeV.\n- Increase in excluded mediator mass relative to the previous CMS emerging-jet search: 500 GeV.\n\nThese quantities are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"The maximum ML-based signal selection efficiency is 60% for \\( c\\tau_{\\pi_{\\text{Dark}}} = 45 \\) mm.\"\n- \"The maximum model-agnostic signal selection efficiency is 40% for \\( c\\tau_{\\pi_{\\text{Dark}}} = 45 \\) mm.\"\n- \"The average b jet fraction of selected jets in the b-depleted region (DR) is 4%.\"\n- \"The average b jet fraction of selected jets in the b-enriched region (ER) is 15%.\"\n- \"The excluded \\( m_{X_{\\text{dark}}} \\) upper bound for the flavor-aligned model, using the combined benchmark grid, is 1950 GeV.\"\n- \"The increase in excluded mediator mass relative to the previous CMS emerging-jet search is 500 GeV.\"\n\nThese are just a few of the 16 quantities reported in the analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2403.01556 reports 16 distinct quantities. Examples include the maximum ML-based signal selection efficiency, the average b jet fraction in different regions, and the excluded \\( m_{X_{\\\\text{dark}}} \\\\) upper bound.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2403.01556"], "predicate": "result_reports_quantity"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.052}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0081f16cb4a9f4b08b8c0852", "hepkg:evidence:037b4d1e9606f1661e5e831f", "hepkg:evidence:4c530490afb86726d0954428", "hepkg:evidence:509bdc2c33a2fd338a71181c", "hepkg:evidence:611d05f746799bdd440af351", "hepkg:evidence:7ccdecbaff43b42a9a257de8", "hepkg:evidence:994516915aabc24fa75d53d0", "hepkg:evidence:c9408cfbb5a43253fdb8ce2d"], "seen_values": ["1", "10", "15", "185", "1850", "19", "1900", "195", "1950", "1e-05", "2", "20", "2403.01556", "25", "4", "40", "45", "5", "500", "6", "60", "average", "b-depleted", "b-enriched", "benchmark", "bound", "cms", "combined", "contaminating", "contamination", "control", "ctau_pidark", "ctau_pidark_max", "efficiency", "emerging-jet", "estimated", "event", "excluded", "flavor-aligned", "fraction", "gev", "grid", "increase", "jet", "jets", "m_pidark", "m_xdark", "mass", "maximum", "mediator", "ml-based", "model", "model-agnostic", "none", "percent", "previous", "quantity", "region", "regions", "relative", "result_reports_quantity", "search", "selected", "selection", "signal", "the", "unflavored", "unit", "upper", "validation", "value"], "verification_score": 0.875, "unsupported_claims": ["16"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7948, "completion_tokens": 535, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 23.88816904835403, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 23.88816904835403, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8483.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 0.875, "unsupported_claims": 1.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_error