{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-76222fc9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2201.11585 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2201.11585 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- Higgs boson signal MC sample (ggH, VBF, VH, ttH) generated with POWHEG v2.0 at NLO pQCD\n- QCD multijet MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO)\n- Single top quark background MC sample (POWHEG v1.0, NLO pQCD)\n- V+jets (VBF, EW) MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO)\n- Vγ (vector boson + photon) MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, NLO pQCD)\n- WW diboson MC sample (POWHEG, NLO pQCD)\n- WZ and ZZ diboson MC sample (PYTHIA v8.205, LO)\n- Z/γ*(ll)+jets, Z(νν)+jets, W(lν)+jets strong-production MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO v2.6.5, NLO, FxFx merging, 5-flavor scheme)\n- t̅t background MC sample (POWHEG v2.0, NLO pQCD)\n- γ+jets (VBF, EW) MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO)\n- γ+jets strong-production MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO v2.4.2, LO, up to 4 partons)\n\nThese samples cover a range of processes including Higgs production, QCD multijet, single top, diboson, and various vector boson and photon processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2201.11585"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2201.11585"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:gammajets_strong_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:gammajets_vbf_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:higgs_signal_powheg", "hepkg:sample:qcd_multijet_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:singletop_powheg_v1", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_powheg_v2", "hepkg:sample:vgamma_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:vjets_strong_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:vjets_vbf_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:ww_powheg", "hepkg:sample:wz_zz_pythia"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:125d0d03c261f2982be97b2d", "hepkg:evi