{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-7850d179", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2604.21670 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2604.21670 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- **EW Zjj (VBF Z-boson + 2 jets) fiducial region**\n- **HH→bbγγ signal region**\n- **HH→bbττ hadronic-hadronic signal region**\n- **HH→bbττ lepton(e)-hadron signal region**\n- **HH→bbττ lepton(μ)-hadron signal region**\n- **HMDY charged-current W→ℓν fiducial region**\n- **HMDY neutral-current Z/γ*→τ⁺τ⁻ fiducial region**\n- **WW → eνμν fiducial region**\n- **WZ → ℓνℓℓ fiducial region**\n- **ttbar boosted (leptonic top + hadronic high-pT top) fiducial region**\n- **ttbar dilepton (eμ) fiducial region**\n\nThese regions are part of the various channels analyzed in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.21670"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:ew_zjj_fiducial", "hepkg:region:hh_bbgammagamma_sr", "hepkg:region:hh_bbtautau_hadhad_sr", "hepkg:region:hh_bbtautau_lephad_e_sr", "hepkg:region:hh_bbtautau_lephad_mu_sr", "hepkg:region:hmdy_cc_wlnu_fiducial", "hepkg:region:hmdy_nc_tautau_fiducial", "hepkg:region:ttbar_boosted_fiducial", "hepkg:region:ttbar_dilepton_fiducial", "hepkg:region:ww_fiducial", "hepkg:region:wz_fiducial"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:88b1a48e8908c73647590cd3", "hepkg:evidence:95af52df29740d6bad3fd243", "hepkg:evidence:a66c62b283dc6200cf22716f", "hepkg:evidence:bbf64f08ca7e27266a92ad5b", "hepkg:evidence:c9987c6cb8e4cfa829c86f10", "hepkg:evidence:d3b2dd3481678019c36c87da", "hepkg:evidence:d9112cb909d1d35a0d081a19", "hepkg:evidence:efb315e5a861060ce