{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-7850e320", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2103.06956 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2103.06956 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- **Additional Higgs boson signal MC samples, powheg 2.0 NLO QCD**: Used for multivariate discriminant training.\n- **Drell-Yan MC sample, MadGraph5_aMC@NLO**: Used for corrections and validation.\n- **Higgs boson signal MC sample (all production modes), MadGraph5_aMC@NLO NLO QCD**: With Higgs masses of 120, 125, and 130 GeV.\n- **SM diphoton (Born + box) background MC sample, Sherpa 2.2.4**.\n- **gamma+jet and jet+jet MC background sample, pythia8 LO with EM-enrichment filter**.\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various processes and backgrounds relevant to the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.06956"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diphoton_bkg_sherpa", "hepkg:sample:drellyan_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:gjet_jetjet_pythia8", "hepkg:sample:signal_mc_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:signal_mc_powheg"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:077e4bc379875764dd55b862", "hepkg:evidence:466e08ef31087037c4a45a13", "hepkg:evidence:96153246176b8ba7e9943fad", "hepkg:evidence:d43161f96a23201434a0546f", "hepkg:evidence:eeec8ea3b337e5989cd7ae46"], "seen_values": ["12", "120", "125", "13", "130", "2", "2.0", "2.2.4", "2103.06956", "additional", "all", "and", "background", "born", "boson", "box", "corrections", "diphoton", "discriminant", "drell-yan", "em-enrichment", "filter", "for", "gamma", "gev", "hepkg:sample:diphoton_bkg_sherpa", "hepkg:sample:drellyan_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:gjet_jetjet_pythia8", "hepkg:sampl