{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-792a07ff", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2006.05880 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2006.05880 defines 24 region selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- Leading b-tagged jet \\( p_T > 100 \\) GeV\n- Leading jet \\( p_T > 150 \\) GeV\n- Leading lepton \\( p_T > 40 \\) GeV\n- MET-significance \\( S > 12 \\)\n- MET-significance \\( S > 7 \\)\n- MET-significance \\( S \\geq 14 \\)\n- MET-significance \\( S \\) in 7-10\n- Number of DF-OS lepton pairs \\( \\geq 1 \\)\n- Number of SF-OS lepton pairs \\( == 0 \\)\n- Number of SF-OS lepton pairs \\( \\geq 1 \\)\n- Second leading lepton \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV\n- Second leading lepton \\( p_T > 40 \\) GeV\n- Subleading lepton \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV\n- Third leading lepton \\( p_T < 20 \\) GeV\n- Third leading lepton \\( p_T < 60 \\) GeV\n- Third leading lepton \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV\n- Third leading lepton \\( p_T > 40 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_T > 100 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_T > 150 \\) GeV\n- \\( m_T2^{3l} > 100 \\) GeV\n- \\( pT^{ll} < 50 \\) GeV\n- \\( pT^{ll} > 150 \\) GeV\n- \\( |m_{ll}(SF-OS) - m_Z| < 15 \\) GeV\n\nThese requirements are used to define the event regions in the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2006.05880 defines 24 region selection requirements. Examples include: Leading b-tagged jet \\( p_T > 100 \\) GeV, Leading jet \\( p_T > 150 \\) GeV, Leading lepton \\( p_T > 40 \\) GeV, MET-significance \\( S > 12 \\), and others.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2006.05880"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 23, "error": null, "seconds": 0.068}], "sets": {}, "enti