{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-7a05bc20", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many systematic uncertainties does analysis 2001.06899 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis with the identifier 2001.06899 reports 11 systematic uncertainties. These include background normalization, gluon splitting rate, heavy-flavor tagging efficiency, jet energy scale and resolution, missing transverse momentum selection efficiency, PDF and scale uncertainties, parton shower and hadronization modeling, pileup weighting, statistical uncertainty of MC templates, and b jet M_SV template shape correction.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["2001.06899"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 0, "error": "unknown_entity_id", "seconds": 0.0}, {"round": 2, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "2001.06899", "kind": "paper"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "seconds": 0.258}, {"round": 3, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2001.06899"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049}], "sets": {"set_1": []}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:b_jet_msv_shape_correction", "hepkg:systematic:background_rate_normalization", "hepkg:systematic:gluon_splitting", "hepkg:systematic:hf_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:jes_jer", "hepkg:systematic:met_selection_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:parton_shower_hadronization_model", "hepkg:systematic:pdf_scale_variation", "hepkg:systematic:pileup_weighting", "hepkg:systematic:template_statistics"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:22aacafa72d5703fc1473cb9", "hepkg:evidence:2b37e3d54d1e432523f49a1d", "hepkg:evidence:3168359c1d904c1caa11bb86", "hepkg:evidence:68cc9f43715596f759dca513", "hepkg:evidence:6a720291b1e6fc13a52b39b5", "hepkg:evidence:aeb5