{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-7ba5088b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2404.06204 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2404.06204 defines 20 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \"1.37 < |eta| < 1.52 excluded (barrel-endcap transition/crack region)\"\n- \"E_T^miss > 25 GeV\"\n- \"Medium identification criteria\"\n- \"Medium likelihood identification requirement\"\n- \"PFOs within DeltaR=0.2 around identified electrons and muons excluded from the recoil\"\n- \"additional (veto) electrons with pT > 20 GeV rejected in W selection\"\n- \"additional (veto) muons with pT > 20 GeV rejected in W selection\"\n- \"at least two charged-particle tracks\"\n- \"charged PFOs required to be associated with the same primary vertex as the W lepton candidate\"\n- \"computed from the vector sum of all charged and neutral PFO momenta\"\n- \"hard-scatter vertex chosen as the one with the largest sum of squared track transverse momenta\"\n- \"isolated from nearby activity with the same criterion as electrons (pT^cone20/min(pT,50 GeV) < 0.1)\"\n- \"pT > 25 GeV\"\n- \"pT^cone20 / min(pT,50 GeV) < 0.1 (track isolation, DeltaR<0.2 cone)\"\n- \"required to originate from the primary vertex\"\n- \"|d0/sigma_d0| < 3\"\n- \"|d0/sigma_d0| < 5\"\n- \"|eta| < 2.4\"\n- \"|eta| < 2.47 (ID and EM calorimeter precision region acceptance)\"\n- \"|z0*sin(theta)| < 0.5 mm\"\n\nThese requirements are detailed in the paper and are used to define the selection criteria for the objects in the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2404.06204 defines 20 object selection requirements. These include criteria such as '1.37 < |eta| < 1.52 excluded (barrel-endcap transition/crack region)', 'E_T^miss > 25 GeV', 'Medium identification criteria', and others.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2404.06204"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:090dfcc7d277998874dc125b", "hepkg:evidence:177641d1691733235f27582b", "hepkg:evidence:1adb1d46b1c8ad22898a7c5c", "hepkg:evidence:34273d42e33871d28d497cc1", "hepkg:evidence:4d4f3794c2ae612c06d7d2e4", "hepkg:evidence:5a3987b11c944266a02c5087", "hepkg:evidence:768581c2c95a2e5f3d51103d", "hepkg:evidence:8387ff40741812ad2a74f7da", "hepkg:evidence:8ce1b21b8c1166450bb5b444", "hepkg:evidence:908817d2b0d81107b86af37a", "hepkg:evidence:98d435be8df47a3732e87698", "hepkg:evidence:9ab1b35dc8dacfd99de55663", "hepkg:evidence:b4507fcfed929fd95bb934a0", "hepkg:evidence:ba65b1cdafe151ce7d53593a", "hepkg:evidence:d89a89b3f633b1766c6048e5", "hepkg:evidence:daef7fac15a93213d05e4082", "hepkg:evidence:db205478f31233e1cd9fe38e", "hepkg:evidence:e4d8abee1272080b768baa91", "hepkg:evidence:ec194920a0eb09872b64a6cd", "hepkg:evidence:f9382223fbe3217ab1d290e6", "hepkg:evidence:fc08ca706ab9f3c1871647b9"], "seen_values": ["0", "0.1", "0.2", "0.5", "1.37", "1.52", "2", "2.4", "2.47", "20", "2404.06204", "25", "3", "5", "50", "acceptance", "activity", "additional", "all", "and", "around", "associated", "barrel-endcap", "calorimeter", "candidate", "charged", "charged-particle", "chosen", "computed", "cone", "cone20", "crack", "criteria", "criterion", "deltar", "e_t", "electrons", "eta", "excluded", "from", "gev", "hard-scatter", "identification", "identified", "isolated", "isolation", "largest", "least", "lepton", "likelihood", "medium", "min", "miss", "momenta", "muons", "nearby", "neutral", "none", "object_has_selection", "one", "originate", "pfo", "pfos", "precision", "primary", "recoil", "region", "rejected", "required", "requirement", "