{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-7bd8e08b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2309.14442 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2309.14442 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- Inclusive ttbar 5FS sample (powheg v2 + herwig7)\n- Inclusive ttbar 5FS sample (powheg v2 + pythia8)\n- Nominal ttbb 4FS sample (powheg-box-res+OpenLoops+pythia8)\n- Single top s-channel sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO)\n- Single top t-channel sample (powheg v2 + MadSpin)\n- Single top tW sample (powheg v2)\n- W+jets sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, MLM merging)\n- Z+jets sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, MLM merging)\n- tt+jets FxFx 5FS sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO + pythia8)\n- ttH POWHEG 2.0 NLO signal MC sample\n- ttW sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO FxFx + MadSpin)\n- ttZ sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO + MadSpin)\n- ttbb 4FS sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO + pythia8 + MadSpin)\n- ttbb 4FS sample (sherpa 2.2.4 + OpenLoops)\n\nThese samples are used in various parts of the analysis to simulate different processes and backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.04956", "2309.14442"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2309.14442"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:singletop_schannel_mg5amc", "hepkg:sample:singletop_tchannel_powheg", "hepkg:sample:singletop_tw_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_incl_powheg_h7_5fs", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_incl_powheg_p8_5fs", "hepkg:sample:ttbb_mg5amc_p8_4fs", "hepkg:sample:ttbb_nominal_powheg_ol_p8_4fs", "hepkg:sample:ttbb_sherpa_ol_4fs", "hepkg:sample:tth_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ttjets_fxfx_mg5amc_p8_5fs", "hepkg:sample:ttw_mg5amc_fxfx", "hepkg:sample:ttz_mg5amc", "hepkg:sample:wjets_mg5amc", "hepkg:sample:zjets_mg5amc"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:148