{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-7c0dcf3d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2510.07527 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2510.07527 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Continuum background (WWgamgam)\n- Continuum background (gamgamtautau)\n- Drell-Yan background (bbWW 2l channel)\n- Drell-Yan background (bbtautau)\n- Misidentified lepton/tau_h background (multilepton)\n- Misidentified-lepton background (bbWW lvqq/2l2nu)\n- QCD multijet background (bbWW->4q all-hadronic)\n- QCD multijet background (bbbb boosted)\n- QCD multijet background (bbbb resolved, 4b region)\n- QCD multijet background (bbtautau)\n- Single Higgs boson H->gamgam background (bbgamgam), dominated by ttH(gamgam)\n- Single Higgs boson background (WWgamgam)\n- Top quark and vector boson backgrounds (bbWW->4q all-hadronic)\n- Z+X non-prompt/misidentified lepton background (bbZZ)\n- ZZ and WZ diboson background (multilepton)\n- gamgam+jets/gamma+jets continuum background (bbgamgam)\n- ttbar background (bbbb boosted)\n- ttbar background (bbtautau)\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated in the context of the analysis reported in paper 2510.07527.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2510.07527"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_ttbar", "hepkg:background:bbbb_resolved_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbgamgam_continuum", "hepkg:background:bbgamgam_singleH", "hepkg:background:bbtautau_dy", "hepkg:background:bbtautau_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbtautau_ttbar", "hepkg:background:bbww4q_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbww4q_top_vector_boson", "