{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-7d2fa765", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2405.18661 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2405.18661 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- H → WW fiducial phase space (e-mu channel)\n- H → ZZ → 4l fiducial phase space\n- H → γγ fiducial phase space\n- H → ττ fiducial phase space\n- Inclusive jet fiducial phase space (pT > 133 GeV, |y| < 2.0)\n- W boson leptonic selection region\n- WW production phase space with jet veto\n- Z boson leptonic selection region\n- t-channel single top signal region (two jets, one b jet)\n- ttbar e-mu dileptonic selection region\n\nThese regions define the specific parts of phase space where the analysis focuses on different decay channels and selection criteria.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2405.18661"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2405.18661"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:hgammagamma_fiducial", "hepkg:region:htautau_fiducial", "hepkg:region:hww_fiducial", "hepkg:region:hzz4l_fiducial", "hepkg:region:jet_inclusive_fiducial", "hepkg:region:single_top_tchannel_sr", "hepkg:region:ttbar_emu_region", "hepkg:region:w_lnu_selection", "hepkg:region:ww_jetveto", "hepkg:region:z_ll_selection"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:183fdaf540387fb676f492fa", "hepkg:evidence:26e74065c3b0b0c5c52e7770", "hepkg:evidence:2b1d721c0246ab94dd6597e4", "hepkg:evidence:34be91267a48da1c052728d6", "hepkg:evidence:3e68a1c56864767e21c153ef", "hepkg:evidence:4eaaba13d443aacc0bf08935", "hepkg:evidence:5a20abbf673e809e12dd6c70", "hepkg:evidence:5c23ae6b4f9493d81452d0ce", "hepkg:evidence:6a8f6c2bb8d889d14145dd88", "hepkg:evidence:6b6d524cf771199a