{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-7e1f5873", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2205.05120 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2205.05120 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- 0-jet category (targets ggH production)\n- Baseline H→ττ candidate event selection (pre-categorization)\n- Boosted category (remaining 1-jet / non-VBF multi-jet events)\n- Multijet QCD control region for τ_h channels (same-sign di-tau pair)\n- VBF category (targets VBF and ggH+2jets production)\n- VBF high-m_jj boosted category (Δφ_jj cross-check method)\n- VBF high-m_jj category (Δφ_jj cross-check method)\n- VBF low-m_jj boosted category (Δφ_jj cross-check method)\n- VBF low-m_jj category (Δφ_jj cross-check method)\n- W+jets control region (m_T > 70 GeV)\n- e-μ channel QCD multijet sideband region (same-sign leptons)\n- jet→τ_h misidentification sideband region (relaxed τ_h ID)\n\nThese regions are used to categorize and control various aspects of the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2205.05120"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2205.05120"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:boosted-category", "hepkg:region:ditau-baseline-selection", "hepkg:region:emu-qcd-sideband-region", "hepkg:region:ggh-0jet-category", "hepkg:region:jet-to-tauh-sideband-region", "hepkg:region:qcd-control-region-tauh", "hepkg:region:vbf-category", "hepkg:region:vbf-highmjj-boosted-category", "hepkg:region:vbf-highmjj-category", "hepkg:region:vbf-lowmjj-boosted-category", "hepkg:region:vbf-lowmjj-category", "hepkg:region:wjets-control-region"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:13a8d4987a69548cd081c633", "hepkg:evidence:1d5cfd1da524927fcbd