{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-8040db9f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2207.00348 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2207.00348 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- Prompt diphoton (γγ) background MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.4)\n- VBF alternative MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO + Herwig 7.1.6)\n- VBF signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.2)\n- VH alternative MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, FxFx merged)\n- Vγγ background MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.4)\n- WH signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.2)\n- bbH signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.2)\n- ggF alternative MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO FxFx + Pythia 8.2)\n- ggF signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2, NNLOPS reweighted + Pythia 8.2)\n- gg→ZH alternative MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO LO + Pythia 8.2)\n- gg→ZH signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2, LO + Pythia 8.2)\n- qq/qg→ZH signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.2)\n- tHW signal MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6 + Pythia 8.2, five-flavour scheme)\n- tHqb signal MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6 + Pythia 8.2, four-flavour scheme)\n- ttH alternative MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO NLO + Pythia 8.2)\n- ttH signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.2)\n- ttγγ background MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.3.3 + Pythia 8.2)\n\nThese samples cover various processes and are used to simulate different backgrounds and signals in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.00348"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.00348"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:bbh-powheg", "hepkg:sample:diphoton-sherpa", "hepkg:sample:ggf-alt-mg5", "hepkg:sample:ggf-powheg-nnlops", "hepkg:sample:thqb-mg5", "hepkg:sample:thw-mg5", "hepkg:sample: