{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-80c4eb1b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many distinct generators does analysis 2011.07812 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2011.07812 uses 4 distinct generators: GEANT4, MadGraph5_aMC@NLO v2.6.1, Pythia 8.210, and Pythia 8.230.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2011.07812", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2207.12246", "2401.07090", "2407.10549", "2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2011.07812"], "predicate": "sample_uses_generator"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:generator:geant4", "hepkg:generator:madgraph5-amcatnlo-v2.6.1", "hepkg:generator:pythia8.210", "hepkg:generator:pythia8.230"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3b03026911ff370a50fb7fd0", "hepkg:evidence:3e6675b6f191ad4733f48323", "hepkg:evidence:b6c646064faa872a596e6bca", "hepkg:evidence:fa7f14c5bd32a4df1d212b60"], "seen_values": ["2.6.1", "2011.07812", "21", "210", "23", "230", "6.1", "8.21", "8.210", "8.23", "8.230", "geant4", "generator", "hepkg:generator:geant4", "hepkg:generator:madgraph5-amcatnlo-v2", "hepkg:generator:pythia8", "madgraph5_amc", "nlo", "pythia", "sample_uses_generator"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7122, "completion_tokens": 184, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 8.287444539368153, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 8.287444539368153, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7306.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 4.0, "evidence_quotes": 4.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-80c76731", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2504.13081 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2504.13081 defines 22 region selection requirements. Here they are:\n\n- Any opposite-charge lepton pair mass > 4 GeV\n- At least two lepton pairs required\n- Dilepton mass > 12 GeV, dilepton pT > 30 GeV\n- Each lepton pair separated by dR > 0.02\n- Electron pT > 25 GeV, |eta| < 2.1\n- Electron pT > 7 GeV, muon pT > 5 GeV, |eta| < 2.5 (2.4)\n- Leading (subleading) dressed lepton of Z candidate pT > 20 (10) GeV\n- Leading (subleading) lepton pT > 24 (15) GeV, both |eta| < 2.4; mT of dilepton system and MET below 60 GeV\n- Leading (subleading) photon pT/m_gg > 1/3 (1/4)\n- Leading lepton pT > 25 GeV, subleading lepton pT > 13 GeV\n- Lepton isolation: scalar pT sum in dR=0.3 cone (excluding FSR photons and other leptons) < 0.35 * lepton pT\n- Muon pT > 20 GeV, |eta| < 2.1\n- Opposite-charge e/mu, |eta| < 2.5 (2.4) for electrons (muons)\n- Photon |eta| < 2.5\n- Subleading lepton transverse mass > 30 GeV; Higgs boson transverse mass > 60 GeV\n- Total hadronic energy in cone dR=0.3 around photon < 10 GeV\n- Transverse mass mT(e, MET) < 50 GeV\n- Transverse mass mT(mu, MET) < 50 GeV\n- Visible pT of both tau_h candidates > 40 GeV, visible |eta| < 2.1; at least one jet with pT > 30 GeV\n- Z1 mass window: 40 < m_Z1 < 120 GeV\n- Z2 mass window: 12 < m_Z2 < 120 GeV\n- tau_h candidate visible pT > 30 GeV, visible |eta| < 2.3\n\nThese requirements are recorded in the graph and are supported by the verbatim quotes from the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2504.13081 defines 22 region selection requirements. These requirements are recorded in the graph and are supported by the verbatim quotes from the paper.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2504.13081"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 22, "error": null, "seconds": 0.067}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:04a6970d33103d40161cc69e", "hepkg:evidence:16803611f13388ac03562e9f", "hepkg:evidence:1a8cf1b40667e31d082d3d8f", "hepkg:evidence:2264ad3bdaa96ff8bc4e05d7", "hepkg:evidence:2712f96bf8f546034087a6b7", "hepkg:evidence:288d26d240b7c675da6737d6", "hepkg:evidence:2d44d3a619fd51173ff23a55", "hepkg:evidence:339ab9c3cac5c282b2f68cdc", "hepkg:evidence:3aabc547f7c96f147be610a3", "hepkg:evidence:72cd4164ed07ae941803a6ff", "hepkg:evidence:741b8c1fcefe3e0ea8f5453e", "hepkg:evidence:75b2fc693e623402e99d0d85", "hepkg:evidence:7b13a295608c3cdb2d0654ce", "hepkg:evidence:9db8687bfe8359350bde44be", "hepkg:evidence:ae401e5721fd510354c36b7a", "hepkg:evidence:b09d5088ea7165fe573cd8f3", "hepkg:evidence:cb8ecc274b20cf199a8911f9", "hepkg:evidence:da25b18852aa1997f29f5563", "hepkg:evidence:db45b692774294d03e73c8b2", "hepkg:evidence:f7a54725452931fffc0ce978"], "seen_values": ["0.02", "0.3", "0.35", "1", "10", "12", "120", "13", "15", "2", "2.1", "2.3", "2.4", "2.5", "20", "24", "25", "2504.13081", "3", "30", "4", "40", "5", "50", "6", "60", "7", "and", "any", "around", "below", "boson", "both", "candidate", "candidates", "cone", "dilepton", "dressed", "each", "electron", "electrons", "energy", "eta", "excluding", "for", "fsr", "gev", "hadronic", "higgs", "isolation", "jet", "leading", "least", "lepton", "leptons", "m_gg", "m_z1", "m_z2", "mass", "met", "muon", "muons", "none", "one", "opposite-charge", "other", "pair", "pairs", "photon", "photons", "region_has_selection", "required", "scalar", "separated", "subleading", "sum", "system", "tau_h", "total", "transverse", "two", "visible", "window", "with"], "verification_score": 0.9473684