{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-81591f6c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2302.05225 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2302.05225 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Diboson background\n- Misidentified tau_had (jet misidentified as tau_had) background in the ltau_had channel\n- Misidentified-lepton background component F_FF (Symmetry method; jets/hadronic-decay leptons)\n- Misidentified-lepton background component F_MC (Symmetry method; simulation-based: tau_had, mu->e, photon->e)\n- Misidentified-lepton background in the ltau_lprime channel (MC-template method)\n- SM Higgs boson decay backgrounds (H->tau tau, H->WW)\n- Top-quark (ttbar and single-top) background\n- Z -> ll (Z->ee, Z->mumu) background\n- Z -> tau tau background\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated as part of the analysis reported in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2404.06204", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2302.05225"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:misid_ltau_had", "hepkg:background:misid_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "hepkg:background:misid_symmetry_ff", "hepkg:background:misid_symmetry_mc", "hepkg:background:sm_higgs_decays", "hepkg:background:top_quark", "hepkg:background:z_ll", "hepkg:background:z_tautau"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:16727c289a2b58df153865ab", "hepkg:evidence:32c6b630c8b4c9077bc4134f", "hepkg:evidence:44347d8190bba3218561ea3e", "hepkg:evidence:4d666232d10711b9145d33c0", "hepkg:evidence:574f0ddc0aea62675ee75245", "hepkg:evidence:58d55b33c83ff0fc1fabb206", "hepkg:evidence:63a5f