{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-8160d7e2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2503.19420 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2503.19420 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- $E_{\\text{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ soft-term reconstruction uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}$ generator and matching algorithm choice uncertainty (Powheg vs MadGraph5_aMC@NLO)\n- $t\\bar{t}$ hadronisation/fragmentation modelling uncertainty (Pythia 8 vs Herwig 7)\n- $t\\bar{t}$ initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty\n- CKKW jet-merging scale uncertainty for $VV$ processes\n- CSSKIN parton-shower recoil scheme uncertainty for $VV$ processes\n- Data-driven mis-identified lepton and electron charge mis-identification estimate uncertainties (statistics, prompt-background theory, selection variations, self-consistency)\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale and resolution uncertainty\n- Lepton energy/momentum scale and resolution uncertainty\n- Lepton reconstruction, identification, and isolation efficiency uncertainty\n- ME/PS modelling uncertainty for $VVV$ and $Z\\text{+jets}$ processes (Sherpa vs MadGraph5_aMC@NLO)\n- Missing higher-order QCD corrections (renormalisation/factorisation scale variation)\n- Parton distribution function (PDF) uncertainty\n- Parton-shower modelling uncertainty for Higgs boson processes (Pythia 8 vs Herwig 7)\n- Pile-up jet tagger performance uncertainty\n- Pile-up modelling uncertainty\n- QSF parton-shower resummation scale uncertainty for $VV$ processes\n- RNN shape correction uncertainty for $WZ$ background (same-sign 2-lepton channel)\n- Strong coupling constant ($\\alpha_s$) uncertainty\n- Trigger efficiency uncertainty\n- b-jet identification (flavour tagging) uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis and are crucial for understanding the precision and reliability of the results.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2503.19420"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 22, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:alpha-s", "hepkg:systematic:b-jet-identification", "hepkg:systematic:higgs-ps-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:jet-energy-scale-resolution", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-energy-momentum-scale-res", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-reco-id-iso", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity", "hepkg:systematic:met-soft-term", "hepkg:systematic:mis-id-lepton-electron-chargeflip-estimate", "hepkg:systematic:missing-higher-order-qcd-scale", "hepkg:systematic:pdf", "hepkg:systematic:pileup-jet-tagger", "hepkg:systematic:pileup-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:rnn-shape-correction-wz", "hepkg:systematic:trigger", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-generator-matching", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-hadronization-fragmentation", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-isr-fsr", "hepkg:systematic:vv-ckkw-merging", "hepkg:systematic:vv-csskin-recoil", "hepkg:systematic:vv-qsf-resummation", "hepkg:systematic:vvv-zjets-me-ps-modelling"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0d1f37adc015d609dccfaabb", "hepkg:evidence:28a535d26a8d2f70f79be2ca", "hepkg:evidence:2e6fb8dc23da3272127b8cee", "hepkg:evidence:2ed3d213345b01dbbb1d32a1", "hepkg:evidence:2f7859493b3a37ebc9bcc877", "hepkg:evidence:3386eaeaa022cc36d093fe04", "hepkg:evidence:342753d9c98090870f72960e", "hepkg:evidence:4259a9ec31df4ed32cfb6a9f", "hepkg:e