{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-82438cef", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2209.07327 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2209.07327 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}$ simulated sample\n- $t\\bar{t}H$ background MC sample\n- Alternate ttbar sample for MLP training\n- Diboson production sample (single-lepton channel, Pythia8 generated)\n- Drell-Yan production sample\n- QCD multijet background sample\n- Single top quark production sample (most channels, Powheg)\n- Single top quark s-channel production sample (2016, 2018)\n- Single top quark t-channel production sample (2016)\n- Triboson (VVV) background sample\n- Vector-like B Bbar pair production signal sample\n- Vector-like T Tbar pair production signal sample\n- W+W+ (same-sign WW) production sample\n- W+jets background MC sample\n- WZ production sample (2016 and 2018)\n- WZ production sample (2017)\n- ZZ diboson production MC sample\n- t t̄ t t̄ background MC sample\n- ttW production sample\n- ttZ production sample\n\nThese samples are used in various aspects of the analysis, including background estimation and signal simulation.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2503.19420", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2209.07327"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson-singlelepton", "hepkg:sample:drell-yan", "hepkg:sample:qcd-multijet", "hepkg:sample:single-top-powheg", "hepkg:sample:single-top-schannel", "hepkg:sample:single-top-t-channel-2016", "hepkg:sample:triboson", "hepkg:sample:ttH", "hepkg:sample:ttbar", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-training-alt", "hepkg:sampl