{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-83438c55", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many quantities does analysis 2202.08676 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2202.08676 reports 10 distinct quantities. These include local excess and deficit significances in various bins, as well as global goodness-of-fit p-values. Each quantity is associated with a specific bin or scheme, and some have values provided.\n\nFor example, one of the reported quantities is the largest local excess significance in bin 16 (3L, A4 category, OSSF1 BelowZ, low minimum lepton pT, 300<L_T+pT^miss<500 GeV), with a value of 2.7 standard deviations.\n\nHere is the full list of quantities:\n\n1. Largest local deficit significance in bin 143 (3L1T, E3 category, OSSF1 OnZ, 500<L_T+pT^miss<700 GeV): 1.7 standard deviations.\n2. Largest local excess significance in bin 16 (3L, A4 category, OSSF1 BelowZ, low minimum lepton pT, 300<L_T+pT^miss<500 GeV): 2.7 standard deviations.\n3. Largest local deficit significance in bin 236 (3L1T, E2 category, OSSF1 OnZ, 650<S_T<850 GeV): 1.9 standard deviations.\n4. Largest local deficit significance in bin 40 (3L, A4 category, OSSF1 BelowZ, low minimum lepton pT, 0B, low pT^miss, high H_T, 350<S_T<550 GeV) and bin 714 (4L, D3 category, OSSF1 OffZ, 0B, high pT^miss, Inclusive): 1.9 standard deviations.\n5. Largest local excess significance in bin 600 (2L1T, B10 category, OSSF1 OnZ, high tau_h pT, 2B, Inclusive): 2.5 standard deviations.\n6. Largest local excess significance in bin 78 (3L, A10 category, OSSF1 BelowZ, high minimum lepton pT, 1400<S_T<1600 GeV): 2.3 standard deviations.\n7. Global goodness-of-fit p-value in the advanced S_T table: 0.11.\n8. Global goodness-of-fit p-value in the fundamental L_T+pT^miss table: 0.67.\n9. Global goodness-of-fit p-value in the fundamental S_T table: 0.53.\n\nThese quantities are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"The largest local deficit significance in bin 143 (3L1T, E3 category, OSSF1 OnZ, 500<L_T+pT^miss<700 GeV) is 1.7 standard deviations.\"\n- \"The largest local excess significance in bin 16 (3L, A4 category, OSSF1 BelowZ, low minimum lepton pT, 300<L_T+pT^miss<500 GeV) is 2.7 standard deviations.\"\n- \"The largest local deficit significance in bin 236 (3L1T, E2 category, OSSF1 OnZ, 650<S_T<850 GeV) is 1.9 standard deviations.\"\n- \"The largest local deficit significance in bin 40 (3L, A4 category, OSSF1 BelowZ, low minimum lepton pT, 0B, low pT^miss, high H_T, 350<S_T<550 GeV) and bin 7", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2202.08676"], "predicate": "result_reports_quantity"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:14e7a54d688a065f6b974bf4", "hepkg:evidence:22a79ee5d1a6015d7b1e8ccd", "hepkg:evidence:26bc5e81d8ced1e638533ce6", "hepkg:evidence:2a6461a8d63f271570b4f4de", "hepkg:evidence:2e6c05e61b406e3fcb3f593b", "hepkg:evidence:44232f4c1224a9ee7d9b6340", "hepkg:evidence:9501118635ed2dbc964aa8ae"], "seen_values": ["0", "0.11", "0.53", "0.67", "1.7", "1.9", "14", "1400", "143", "16", "1600", "2", "2.0", "2.3", "2.5", "2.7", "2202.08676", "236", "3", "300", "35", "350", "4", "40", "5", "500", "55", "550", "6", "600", "65", "650", "7", "700", "714", "78", "85", "850", "a10", "advanced", "and", "b10", "belowz", "bin", "category", "deficit", "deviations", "excess", "fundamental", "gev", "global", "goodness-of-fit", "h_t", "high", "inclusive", "l1t", "l_t", "largest", "lepton", "local", "low", "minimum", "miss", "none", "offz", "onz", "ossf1", "p-value", "quantity_name", "result_reports_quantity", "s_t", "scheme", "significance", "standard", "table", "tau_h", "unit", "value"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_call