{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-83cca5ca", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2604.27044 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2604.27044 contains the following event regions:\n\n- Merged first-approach High-purity SR (HPSR)\n- Merged first-approach Low-purity SR (LPSR)\n- Merged first-approach Validation Region (VR)\n- Merged qqHH category VBF-HPSR\n- Merged qqHH category VBF-LPSR\n- Merged qqHH category VBF-VR\n- Merged second-approach QCD-enriched CR\n- Merged second-approach ggHH SR1 (highest purity)\n- Merged second-approach ggHH SR2\n- Merged second-approach ggHH SR3\n- Merged second-approach qqHH SR\n- Resolved first-approach CR_2b (background reweighting source)\n- Resolved first-approach CR_4b in ggHH category\n- Resolved first-approach SR_2b (background reweighting source)\n- Resolved first-approach SR_3b (validation region)\n- Resolved first-approach SR_4b in ggHH category\n- Resolved qqHH exclusive category SR_4b\n- Resolved second-approach SR_3MnT (validation region)\n- Resolved second-approach SR_3T1L\n- Resolved second-approach SR_3T1M\n- Run 2 updated resolved analysis 3b region (QCD background sample)\n- Run 2 updated resolved analysis HH SR_4b\n\nThese regions are part of the various channels defined in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.27044"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 22, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:merged1-HPSR", "hepkg:region:merged1-LPSR", "hepkg:region:merged1-VBF-HPSR", "hepkg:region:merged1-VBF-LPSR", "hepkg:region:merged1-VBF-VR", "hepkg:region:merged1-VR", "hepkg:region:merged2-QCDCR", "hepkg:region:merged2-ggHH-SR1", "hepkg:region:merged2-ggHH