{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-851b2fdc", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2103.06956 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2103.06956 defines 19 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- **\"≥ 1 jet tagged as originating from a bottom quark, alongside ≥ 3 jets total\"**\n- **\"≥ 1 lepton, ≥ 1 b-tagged jet, ≥ 1 additional jet\"**\n- **\"anti-kT R=0.4, excluding Higgs decay and leptonic vector-boson-decay particles, pT > 30 GeV\"**\n- **\"at least one of R9 > 0.8, I_ch/pT < 0.3, I_ch < 20 GeV\"**\n- **\"electron veto: reject photon candidate if supercluster matches an electron track\"**\n- **\"isolation and identification requirements imposed\"**\n- **\"leading photon pT/m > 1/3, subleading photon pT/m > 1/4; invariant mass 100 < m < 180 GeV\"**\n- **\"pT > 10 GeV, |η| < 2.4, excluding barrel-endcap transition\"**\n- **\"pT > 25 GeV, |η| < 4.7, ΔR(jet, photon) > 0.4\"**\n- **\"pT > 35 GeV (leading photon), pT > 25 GeV (subleading photon)\"**\n- **\"pT > 5 GeV, |η| < 2.4\"**\n- **\"pT^miss > 50 GeV; azimuthal angle between diphoton system and MET > 2 radians (lepton veto also applied)\"**\n- **\"photon ID BDT score > -0.2 (both photons)\"**\n- **\"photon identification BDT score ≥ -0.9\"**\n- **\"pileup jet identification criterion required in some categories\"**\n- **\"two jets, |η| < 2.4, pT > 30 GeV, pileup ID, 60 < m_jj < 120 GeV\"**\n- **\"two jets, |η| < 4.7, pT > 40(30) GeV leading (subleading), m_jj > 350 GeV\"**\n- **\"|η| < 2.5, excluding 1.44 < |η| < 1.57\"**\n\nThese selections are crucial for defining the event selection criteria and ensuring the quality of the data used in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.06956"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0b946322941a1dc8d5dbcaf0", "hepkg:evidence:0cdc3841707948ec57319cdf", "hepkg:evidence:1f373bfce686189899f13f8e", "hepkg:evidence:20777d169cea499026a6f2f4", "hepkg:evidence:23a6e26e1b906d5c21653493", "hepkg:evidence:286720551a8f5d4ec7629d66", "hepkg:evidence:3e5853846aaa98dc8e5430fb", "hepkg:evidence:42eb4176276d095b2da759fc", "hepkg:evidence:48168ce65fb9168b784de8d7", "hepkg:evidence:55f1f04cd66c0fb3722fe50f", "hepkg:evidence:9755c6affb222ec61c9a6f00", "hepkg:evidence:a335ee8fa515758d4debec6f", "hepkg:evidence:b4a163e87a7701add2d1e705", "hepkg:evidence:e7f762b379ef758c2ef172a9", "hepkg:evidence:eb3f20c57962e1b2b475068d", "hepkg:evidence:f098218f4e67b0291623c402", "hepkg:evidence:f12effa1c378d44267e51750"], "seen_values": ["0.2", "0.3", "0.4", "0.8", "0.9", "1", "1.44", "1.57", "10", "100", "12", "120", "18", "180", "2", "2.4", "2.5", "20", "2103.06956", "25", "3", "30", "35", "350", "4", "4.7", "40", "5", "50", "6", "60", "9", "additional", "alongside", "also", "and", "angle", "anti-kt", "applied", "azimuthal", "b-tagged", "barrel-endcap", "bdt", "between", "both", "bottom", "candidate", "categories", "criterion", "decay", "deltar", "diphoton", "electron", "eta", "excluding", "from", "gev", "higgs", "i_ch", "identification", "imposed", "invariant", "isolation", "jet", "jets", "leading", "least", "lepton", "leptonic", "m_jj", "mass", "matches", "met", "miss", "none", "object_has_selection", "one", "originating", "p_t", "particles", "photon", "photons", "pileup", "quark", "radians", "reject", "required", "requirements", "score", "some", "subleading", "supercluster", "system", "tagged", "total", "track", "transition", "two", "vector-boson-decay", "veto"], "verification_score": 0.9565217391304348, "unsupported_claims": ["19"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8023, "completion_tokens": 594, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 25.032772