{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-85367ade", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2405.18661 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2405.18661 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) production\n- Dijet production\n- Double-parton scattering\n- Four top quark production\n- Higgs boson pair production\n- Inclusive W boson production (pp -> W + X)\n- Inclusive Z boson production (pp -> Z + X)\n- Inclusive jet production\n- Inclusive photon production\n- Inelastic pp scattering\n- Single Higgs boson production\n- Single top quark production\n- Single top quark production in association with a vector boson (tZq, tgammaq, tWZ)\n- Top quark-antiquark pair production\n- Triboson (WWW, WWZ, WZZ, ZZZ) production\n- Vector boson fusion production of single W/Z bosons\n- Vector boson scattering\n- W/Z boson production in association with heavy-flavor jets\n- W/Z boson production in association with jets\n- ttbar production in association with a vector boson (ttZ, ttW, ttgamma)\n- ttbar production in association with jets\n\nThis list is based on the information recorded in the graph for this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2405.18661", "2408.03744"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2405.18661"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.022}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:diboson_production", "hepkg:process:dijet_production", "hepkg:process:double_parton_scattering", "hepkg:process:four_top_production", "hepkg:process:higgs_pair_production", "hepkg:process:higgs_production", "hepkg:process:inclusive_jet_production", "hepkg:process:photon_production", "hepkg:process:pp_inelastic", "hepkg:process:single_top_production", "hepkg:process:single