{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-889b6e9d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2304.08962 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2304.08962 defines 14 region selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \"4mu mass sideband within [14,24.5] GeV, without the ΔR requirement\"\n- \"4mu mass sideband within [7.5,12] GeV, without the ΔR requirement\"\n- \"Di-muon or tri-muon triggers, oppositely charged muons from each charmonium\"\n- \"Loose vertex requirements chi^2_4mu/N<40 (N=5) and chi^2_di-mu/N<100 (N=2)\"\n- \"Vertex chi^2_4mu/N<3, L_xy^4mu<0.2 mm, |L_xy^di-mu|<0.3 mm, m_4mu<11 GeV\"\n- \"Vertex chi^2_4mu/N>6, or |L_xy^di-mu|>0.4 mm (reversed vertex-quality requirements relative to SR)\"\n- \"loose muons, pT^1,2,3,4 > 4,4,3,3 GeV and |eta_1,2,3,4|<2.5 for the four muons\"\n- \"m_J/psi in [2.94,3.25] GeV, or m_psi(2S) in [3.56,3.80] GeV\"\n- \"one charmonium candidate contains a track that is not reconstructed as a muon candidate, with all other requirements kept unchanged\"\n- \"used to study the signal (ΔR<0.25 between reconstructed charmonia)\"\n- \"used to validate the shape of the 4mu mass distribution for the SPS background and constrain its normalization (ΔR>=0.25)\"\n- \"ΔR<0.25 between charmonia\"\n- \"ΔR>=0.25 between charmonia\"\n\nThese requirements are detailed in the paper and are used to define different regions for the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2304.08962 defines 14 region selection requirements. These requirements are detailed in the paper and are used to define different regions for the analysis.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"pap