{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-8a046002", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2308.02285 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2308.02285 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- Charm-tagged jet (c jet), fiducial/generator-level\n- Electron\n- Jet\n- Muon\n- Nonisolated muon inside a jet (SL channel charm tag)\n- Secondary vertex (SV)\n- b-tagged jet\n\nThese objects are used in the analysis as part of the detector-level reconstruction and identification processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2308.02285"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:b-jet", "hepkg:object:c-jet", "hepkg:object:electron", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:muon", "hepkg:object:muon-in-jet", "hepkg:object:secondary-vertex"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3d494847cb5f30473d909033", "hepkg:evidence:3dd10adcd6b0b1a265fb5f0c", "hepkg:evidence:77fd00ec3cfdbe78cdb56783", "hepkg:evidence:ef7b2b1aceec4ef16910af28", "hepkg:evidence:f703618b799d6fc9583ef4f7"]