{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-8d074ce4", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2111.08340 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2111.08340 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- Associated production with a top quark-antiquark pair (ttH)\n- Associated production with a weak vector boson (VH)\n- Gluon-gluon fusion (ggF) Higgs boson production\n- H → b b̄ decay\n- Inclusive Higgs boson production (ggF+VBF+VH+ttH) at large transverse momentum\n- Vector-boson fusion (VBF) Higgs boson production\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"The analysis targets the associated production of a Higgs boson with a top quark-antiquark pair (ttH).\"\n- \"The analysis also targets the associated production of a Higgs boson with a weak vector boson (VH).\"\n- \"The analysis includes gluon-gluon fusion (ggF) Higgs boson production.\"\n- \"The analysis considers the H → b b̄ decay mode.\"\n- \"The analysis examines inclusive Higgs boson production (ggF+VBF+VH+ttH) at large transverse momentum.\"\n- \"The analysis includes vector-boson fusion (VBF) Higgs boson production.\"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2111.08340"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2111.08340"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.017}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:H-to-bb", "hepkg:process:VBF-production", "hepkg:process:VH-production", "hepkg:process:ggF-production", "hepkg:process:higgs-boson-production-highpt", "hepkg:process:ttH-production"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:5a485a3aa45fcfdfe7eeb0bf", "hepkg:evidence:93dd10889756bd1bd2a6cfc8", "hepkg:evidence:98ab18c7319e7956ba2eaab8", "hepkg:evidence:c1cda0a4cee09bcb4e9d7417", "hepkg:evidence:c476c