{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-8f409297", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2302.05225 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2302.05225 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- Additional opposite-sign misidentified-background CR with inverted d0 significance (ltau_lprime, MC-template)\n- Diboson validation region (ltau_lprime, MC-template)\n- Misidentified-background enriched same-sign region (ltau_lprime, MC-template)\n- Multi-jet fake-factor control region (ltau_had)\n- Signal region, VBF category, ltau_had channel\n- Signal region, VBF category, ltau_lprime channel (MC-template method)\n- Signal region, VBF category, ltau_lprime channel (Symmetry method)\n- Signal region, non-VBF category, ltau_had channel\n- Signal region, non-VBF category, ltau_lprime channel (MC-template method)\n- Signal region, non-VBF category, ltau_lprime channel (Symmetry method)\n- Top-quark control region, VBF category (ltau_lprime, MC-template)\n- Top-quark control region, non-VBF category (ltau_lprime, MC-template)\n- W+jets fake-factor control region (ltau_had)\n- Z+jets fake-factor control region (Symmetry method, ltau_lprime)\n- Z->mumu control region (ltau_lprime, MC-template)\n- Z->mumu validation region (ltau_had, MC-template)\n- Z->tautau control region, VBF category (ltau_lprime, MC-template)\n- Z->tautau control region, non-VBF category (ltau_lprime, MC-template)\n\nThese regions are part of the various control, signal, and validation regions used in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2302.05225"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2302.05225"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:cr_misid_multijet_ltau_had", "hepkg:region:cr_misid_os_dinverted_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "hepkg:region:cr_misid_samesign_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "hepkg:region:cr_misid_wjets_ltau_had", "hepkg:region:cr_topquark_nonvbf_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:cr_topquark_vbf_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:cr_zjets_fakefactor_symmetry_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:cr_zmumu_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:cr_ztautau_nonvbf_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:cr_ztautau_vbf_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:sr_nonvbf_ltau_had", "hepkg:region:sr_nonvbf_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "hepkg:region:sr_nonvbf_ltau_lprime_symmetry", "hepkg:region:sr_vbf_ltau_had", "hepkg:region:sr_vbf_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "hepkg:region:sr_vbf_ltau_lprime_symmetry", "hepkg:region:vr_diboson_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:vr_zmumu_ltau_had"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:037f1e6b35c72f263e2eddea", "hepkg:evidence:55dcb165a3f98263b3c4837e", "hepkg:evidence:626b64ba3db75e7fcad278d8", "hepkg:evidence:871d1525cd6a29badea2d86b", "hepkg:evidence:933d6b604c56abe9c5bfb7c8", "hepkg:evidence:9afdcbaaecf2c444eb50a95e", "hepkg:evidence:ac2fdf4afb011c1bf5dcf9b6", "hepkg:evidence:b34f9ac901e033a87f6aab73", "hepkg:evidence:d4c692f269f0f3c8384a85cf", "hepkg:evidence:ed6c8e2b96a35b95593a304e"], "seen_values": ["0", "2302.05225", "additional", "category", "channel", "channel_has_region", "control", "diboson", "enriched", "event_region", "fake-factor", "hepkg:region:cr_misid_multijet_ltau_had", "hepkg:region:cr_misid_os_dinverted_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "hepkg:region:cr_misid_samesign_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "hepkg:region:cr_misid_wjets_ltau_had", "hepkg:region:cr_topquark_nonvbf_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:cr_topquark_vbf_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:cr_zjets_fakefactor_symmetry_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:cr_zmumu_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:cr_ztautau_nonvbf_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:cr_ztautau_vbf_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:sr_nonvbf_ltau_had", "hepkg:region:sr_nonvbf_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "hepkg:region:sr_nonvbf_ltau_lprime_symmetry", "hepkg:regio