{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-8fb297db", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2302.05225 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2302.05225 defines 24 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- **0.2 < p_T^track/p_T^cluster < 1.25 (when subleading lepton is electron)**\n- **>=2 jets, leading p_T>40 GeV, subleading p_T>30 GeV**\n- **DL1r b-tagging algorithm, fixed 85% efficiency working point**\n- **Gradient isolation and Medium identification**\n- **Loose ID, p_T>10 GeV, |eta|<2.5**\n- **Loose likelihood ID, p_T>15 GeV, |eta|<1.37 or 1.52<|eta|<2.47**\n- **Medium eBDT working point**\n- **Medium identification and Tight isolation**\n- **Tight identification criterion**\n- **Very Loose RNN identification**\n- **anti-kt R=0.4, particle-flow inputs**\n- **exactly 1 electron, opposite sign**\n- **exactly 1 muon, opposite sign**\n- **exactly 1 tau_had_vis (with exactly 1 light lepton), opposite sign**\n- **p_T > 27.3 GeV**\n- **p_T(leading lepton) > 35 GeV**\n- **p_T(leading lepton) > 45 GeV**\n- **p_T(subleading lepton) > 15 GeV**\n- **p_T>10 GeV, |eta|<2.5**\n- **p_T>20 GeV, |eta|<4.5**\n- **p_T>25 GeV, |eta|<2.4**\n- **seeded by anti-kt R=0.4 jets from calibrated topological clusters**\n- **veto events with >=1 b-tagged jet**\n- **|Delta eta_jj|>3, m_jj>400 GeV**\n- **|eta|<1.37 or 1.52<|eta|<2.47 (electron-like eta requirement)**\n\nThese selections are detailed in the paper and are used to define the object criteria for the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2302.05225"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0ba42f173a11ecbf2daf8