{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-8fb5a130", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2109.13808 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2109.13808 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $WW$ background\n- $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background\n- Non-WW diboson background (WZ/γ*, ZZ/γ*, Wγ, Zγ)\n- Other Higgs background (VH production and H→ττ decays)\n- Top-quark pair and single-top (tt̄, Wt) background\n- VBF Higgs production treated as background (ggF+2jets analysis)\n- W+jets and multijet background with misidentified leptons\n- ggF Higgs production treated as background (VBF analysis)\n\nIn total, the analysis estimates **8** backgrounds.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2109.13808", "2208.12095", "2503.19420"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2109.13808"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:ggf_production", "hepkg:background:misid_lepton", "hepkg:background:other_higgs", "hepkg:background:ttbar_wt", "hepkg:background:vbf_production", "hepkg:background:ww", "hepkg:background:z_jets"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:336d63a280c44f0503903e7e", "hepkg:evidence:50c1cdfb2b87c50370c1bc41", "hepkg:evidence:67006b49eaeb94b3b2818baf", "hepkg:evidence:90250b0c339a12dd47ce2034", "hepkg:evidence:c042b3b94700d10310baaa40", "hepkg:evidence:cb14cd5a3fbee7e4f590cf95"], "seen_values": ["2", "2109.13808", "analysis", "and", "background", "decays", "diboson", "gamma", "ggf", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:ggf_production", "hepkg:background:misid_lepton", "hepkg:background:other_higgs", "hepkg:background:ttbar_wt", "hepkg:background:vbf_production", "hepkg:background:ww", "hepkg:background:z_jets", "higgs", "jets", "leptons", "misidentified", "multijet", "non-ww", "other", "pair", "production", "result_estimates_background", "single-top", "tautau", "text", "top-quark", "treated", "ttbar", "vbf", "wgamma", "with", "zgamma"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7375, "completion_tokens": 198, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 9.036125604063272, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 9.036125604063272, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7573.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 8.0, "evidence_quotes": 6.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-8fd92f59", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2401.05299 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2401.05299 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- $b$-/$c$-/light-flavour tagging efficiency uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ ME/PS generator-choice modelling uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ PDF/$\\alpha_{s}$ uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ parton-shower modelling uncertainty (Powheg+Pythia8 vs Powheg+Herwig7)\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ renormalisation/factorisation scale uncertainty\n- Charge misidentification background uncertainty\n- Electron/photon reconstruction, identification, isolation uncertainty\n- Fakes/$VV$/$t\\bar{t}Z$ normalisation-factor uncertainty (free to vary in fit)\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale uncertainty\n- Limited MC simulation sample-size statistical uncertainty\n- Missing transverse momentum ($E_{T}^{miss}$) uncertainty\n- Muon reconstruction, identification, isolation uncertainty\n- Non-prompt-lepton BDT / lepton isolation BDT calibration uncertainty\n- Non-prompt-lepton background modelling uncertainty (HF/conversion)\n- Pileup modeling uncertainty\n- Prompt-lepton background modelling uncertainty ($t\\bar{t}H$ ISR/ME/PS, $t\\bar{t}Z$ and $VV$ scale/PS)\n- Prompt-lepton background normalisation uncertainty (dominated by $t\\bar{t}H$ and $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$)\n- Trigger efficiency uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis 2401.05299.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.0732