{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-90cc6383", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2205.05120 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2205.05120 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- Diboson production sample generated with MadGraph5_aMC@NLO at NLO\n- Simulated ttbar sample (POWHEG v2.0)\n- Single top quark (t-channel) sample generated with POWHEG 2.0\n- Single top quark tW sample generated with POWHEG 1.0\n- VBF and VH SM comparison/calibration samples generated with POWHEG 2.0 at NLO QCD\n- VBF and VH signal samples (SM and anomalous couplings) generated with JHUGen at LO QCD\n- W+jets sample generated with MadGraph5_aMC@NLO at LO\n- Z->ee/mumu+jets sample generated with MadGraph5_aMC@NLO at LO\n- Z/gamma*->tautau embedded (data-driven) sample\n- ggH signal sample generated with JHUGen at LO\n- ggH signal sample with up to two jets at NLO QCD, generated with MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6.0", "answered": true, "papers": ["2010.14293", "2205.05120", "2308.02285"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2205.05120"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:ggh-jhugen-lo", "hepkg:sample:ggh-madgraph-nlo", "hepkg:sample:singletop-tchannel-powheg", "hepkg:sample:singletop-tw-powheg", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-powheg", "hepkg:sample:vbf-vh-jhugen-signal", "hepkg:sample:vbf-vh-powheg-sm", "hepkg:sample:wjets-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:zjets-ee-mumu-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:ztautau-embedded"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1554c1f74d33f50e3d36dd7d", "hepkg:evidence:33b11cf75695bc3a828b14ff", "hepkg:evidence:3ee72113be952d9a3017b890", "hepkg:evidence:41e8bd103fbe7f62b3cf44a8", "hepkg:evidence:6712c98190ba4969ccc98fdd", "hepkg:e