{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-9181b29c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2106.01676 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2106.01676 measures the following observables:\n\n- 95% CL model-independent upper limit on visible BSM cross section in a signal region\n- 95% CL observed/expected lower limit on chargino/neutralino mass excluded by the search\n- Background-only hypothesis discovery p-value and significance Z in a signal region\n- Data-driven fake-factor value for FNP lepton estimation\n- Fractional purity of a targeted SM background process in a control/validation region\n- Inclusive chi1(pm) chi2(0) pair-production cross section at NLO+NLL, sqrt(s)=13 TeV\n- Local significance of observed-vs-expected yield deviation in a signal region\n- SM WZ background normalisation factor extracted from control regions in profile-likelihood fit\n- SM diboson background normalisation factor (RJR selection)\n- Selection acceptance times efficiency for a benchmark SUSY signal sample in a given signal region\n- ttbar background normalisation factor (anti-ID region correction, off-shell WZ Z+jets estimation)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2106.01676"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2106.01676"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:background-purity-fraction", "hepkg:observable:diboson-background-normalization-factor", "hepkg:observable:discovery-pvalue-significance", "hepkg:observable:excluded-particle-mass-lower-limit", "hepkg:observable:fake-factor-value", "hepkg:observable:local-significance-data-background", "hepkg:observable:signal-acceptance-times-efficiency", "hepkg:observable:signal-production-cross-section", "hep