{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-921c0274", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2004.01678 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2004.01678 measures the following observables:\n\n- σ(pp→H)×B(H→ZJ/ψ)\n- σ(pp→H)×B(H→Za), B(a→gg)=100%\n- σ(pp→H)×B(H→Za), B(a→s̄s̄)=100%\n- σ(pp→H)×B(H→Zη_c)\n\nThese are the cross-sections times branching ratios for various decay modes of the Higgs boson into a Z boson and another particle (J/ψ, a pseudoscalar meson decaying to gluons, a pseudoscalar meson decaying to strange quarks, and η_c). \n\nThis information is directly from the paper 2004.01678.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.01678"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-etac", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-jpsi", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-za-gg", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-za-ss"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:7e921623cac7e5353888dbf1", "hepkg:evidence:a09dfb0acc993fdcaf93da8f"], "seen_values": ["1", "100", "2004.01678", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-etac", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-jpsi", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-za-gg", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-za-ss", "observable", "result_measures_observable"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7159, "completion_tokens": 226, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 9.907977066002786, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 9.907977066002786, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7385.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims":