{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-927104c7", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2304.08962 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2304.08962 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- **Control region (CR)**: ΔR>=0.25, used to validate SPS shape.\n- **DPS control region**: 4mu mass sideband [14,24.5] GeV, no ΔR requirement.\n- **Fake-muon control region**: For Others background.\n- **Signal region**: Final signal region (Region H).\n- **Non-prompt region**: Reversed vertex-quality requirements.\n- **SPS control region**: 4mu mass sideband [7.5,12] GeV, no ΔR requirement.\n\nThese regions are used to define different parts of the analysis, such as signal and control regions for validation and background estimation.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.01581", "2304.08962"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2304.08962"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:control_region", "hepkg:region:dps_control_region", "hepkg:region:fake_muon_control_region", "hepkg:region:nonprompt_region", "hepkg:region:signal_region", "hepkg:region:sps_control_region"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:05c395151d7f1bb739c9aec8", "hepkg:evidence:504bc87daf0365b6026ed806", "hepkg:evidence:5715ac1af608c965532d3ef2", "hepkg:evidence:59e833bb196b6984502d1779", "hepkg:evidence:c66dc6664874611795b35e74", "hepkg:evidence:ea5cf961dbc22a09397a4510"], "seen_values": ["0.25", "14,24.5", "1424.5", "2304.08962", "4", "7.5,12", "7.512", "background", "channel_has_region", "control", "dps", "event_region", "fake-muon", "final", "for", "gev", "hepkg:region:control_region", "hepkg:region:dps_control_region", "hepkg:region:fake_muon_control_region"