{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-927c3e63", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2208.12095 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2208.12095 defines 12 region selection requirements. Here are the details:\n\n1. \"10 GeV mass window around the Z-boson mass applied to the invariant mass of the opposite-sign lepton pair; E_T^miss requirements removed\"\n2. \"BDT discriminant score of best jet-parton permutation > 0.3\"\n3. \"Delta_phi(large-R jet, lepton) > 2.3 and Delta_R(large-R jet, small-R jet) > 1.5; m_ttbar > 500 GeV\"\n4. \"E_T^miss and m_T^W thresholds: electron channel both >30 GeV; muon channel E_T^miss+m_T^W>60 GeV\"\n5. \"Events also passing the boosted selection are removed (overlap removal, resolved-boosted exclusivity)\"\n6. \"Leading lepton pT>28 GeV, sub-leading lepton pT>25 GeV, opposite-charge leptons, at least one lepton trigger-matched\"\n7. \"NW (Neutrino Weighting) event weight required to be greater than zero\"\n8. \"Same-sign version of the Z-mass window (SSZ), compared with OSZ region for charge-misidentification correction\"\n9. \"Standard dilepton selection requirements applied, but with two leptons required to have same-sign charges\"\n10. \"reconstructed invariant mass of the same-flavour dilepton system is required to be greater than 15 GeV to suppress backgrounds from low-mass resonances\"\n11. \"|m_ll - m_Z| > 10 GeV (Z-mass veto) and E_T^miss > 60 (30) GeV\"\n12. \"|m_ll - m_Z| > 10 GeV (Z-mass veto) and E_T^miss > 60 GeV\"\n\nThese requirements are documented in the paper with the following verbatim quotes:\n\n1. \"10 GeV mass window around the Z-boson mass applied to the invariant mass of the opposite-sign lepton pair; E_T^miss requirements removed\"\n2. \"BDT discriminant score of best jet-parton permutation > 0.3\"\n3. \"Delta_phi(large-R jet, lepton) > 2.3 and Delta_R(large-R jet, small-R jet) > 1.5; m_ttbar > 500 GeV\"\n4. \"E_T^miss and m_T^W thresholds: electron channel both >30 GeV; muon channel E_T^miss+m_T^W>60 GeV\"\n5. \"Events also passing the boosted selection are removed (overlap removal, resolved-boosted exclusivity)\"\n6. \"Leading lepton pT>28 GeV, sub-leading lepton pT>25 GeV, opposite-charge leptons, at least one lepton trigger-matched\"\n7. \"NW (Neutrino Weighting) event weight required to be greater than zero\"\n8. \"Same-sign version of the Z-mass window (SSZ), compared with OSZ region for charge-misidentification correction\"\n9. \"Standard dilepton selection requirements applied, but with two leptons required to have same-sign charges\"\n10. \"reconstructed invariant mass of the same-flavour dilepton system is required to be greater than 15 GeV to suppress backgrounds from low-mass resonances\"\n11. \"|m_ll - m_Z| > 10 GeV (Z-mass veto) and E_T^miss > 60 (30) GeV\"\n12. \"|m_ll - m_Z| > 10 GeV (Z-mass veto) and E_T", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2208.12095"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.066}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:154b9457add7dc888f7aacbe", "hepkg:evidence:383fca0b8dac736886e8d7bb", "hepkg:evidence:51c12c54a9496aa189a960b8", "hepkg:evidence:675c2cc88b3df3b5f4067dad", "hepkg:evidence:9214df7e66686ae91f6729a2", "hepkg:evidence:938eb45ee30fdc5650fec158", "hepkg:evidence:d3b9abc9e4fe8f3ce64624f8", "hepkg:evidence:e227b120de9de3ec3ae63a7f", "hepkg:evidence:ea723a59a710aec217a24ee2", "hepkg:evidence:f245da96c21d5f80dc00a674", "hepkg:evidence:fa7548e845fd4d04cfeec71a"], "seen_values": ["0.3", "1", "1.5", "10", "15", "2.3", "2208.12095", "25", "28", "3", "30", "5", "500", "6", "60", "also", "and", "applied", "are", "around", "backgrounds", "bdt", "best", "boosted", "both", "but", "channe