{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-96478984", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2103.04956 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2103.04956 defines 20 region selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \"105 < m4l < 140 GeV\"\n- \"12 < m(Z2) < 120 GeV\"\n- \"12 < m(l+l-) < 120 GeV for Z candidate lepton pairs\"\n- \"40 < m(Z1) < 120 GeV\"\n- \">=2 leptons with pT>10 GeV and >=1 lepton with pT>20 GeV\"\n- \"Additional electron(muon) pT > 7(5) GeV\"\n- \"D_1jet^VBF > 0.7\"\n- \"D_2jet^VBF > 0.5\"\n- \"D_2jet^VH > 0.5\"\n- \"DeltaR(li,lj) > 0.02 for all lepton pairs\"\n- \"DeltaR(li,lj) > 0.02 for any i != j\"\n- \"Leading lepton pT > 20 GeV\"\n- \"Next-to-leading lepton pT > 10 GeV\"\n- \"Remaining events not satisfying VBF-2jet-tagged, VH-hadronic-tagged, VH-leptonic-tagged, ttH-hadronic-tagged, ttH-leptonic-tagged, or VBF-1jet-tagged criteria\"\n- \"Sum of scalar pT of stable particles within DeltaR<0.3 of lepton < 0.35*pT(lepton)\"\n- \"at most 1 b-tagged jet if 2-3 jets, or 0 b-tagged jets if >=4 jets\"\n- \"m(Z1) > 40 GeV\"\n- \"m(l+l'-) > 4 GeV for all opposite-charge lepton pairs, irrespective of flavor\"\n- \"m(l+l'-) > 4 GeV for any opposite-sign lepton pair\"\n- \"m4l > 70 GeV\"\n- \"|eta| < 2.5 (electrons), 2.4 (muons)\"\n\nThese requirements are used to define the event regions in the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2103.04956 defines 20 region selection requirements. These include criteria such as '105 < m4l < 140 GeV', '12 < m(Z2) < 120 GeV', and '40 < m(Z1) < 120 GeV'.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.04956"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.071}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:04c34dc9c3b6f3da3b338102", "hepkg:evidence:0c4218e7d995b9cd83af7057", "hepkg:evidence:130935f53ab225c5b0632e15", "hepkg:evidence:1a443df580cf35f3e7b2f5b6", "hepkg:evidence:33bfbb707b046733bfb8b9bc", "hepkg:evidence:39d1cbefeccf5a49cacc600d", "hepkg:evidence:3f1681b438476731515fed34", "hepkg:evidence:420ac64204c90d365de7345c", "hepkg:evidence:444c7d8e643824caff0df350", "hepkg:evidence:6220612b872aecf8a3cfb966", "hepkg:evidence:77554d336bfd8f1b54cd9c21", "hepkg:evidence:a2bfd8243a8d6f2ce52c7bcb", "hepkg:evidence:ae19b3a6b9a1cf5e6b07064a", "hepkg:evidence:c31573fe9a7445c1659914e7", "hepkg:evidence:c882fbfb1b5928ccef353c60", "hepkg:evidence:ca7ecb507324b96df78161f7", "hepkg:evidence:d0feb49670a41fa7bd2a5794", "hepkg:evidence:d8c0d3fef1ee046b1ce8ce25", "hepkg:evidence:d9016df9961929807b101fd0", "hepkg:evidence:ef79ed27ce5f0aca5f1e035d", "hepkg:evidence:f3e6079ec675133642491370", "hepkg:evidence:f8ec9a69df2abe61e1fb1d40"], "seen_values": ["0", "0.02", "0.3", "0.35", "0.5", "0.7", "1", "10", "105", "12", "120", "14", "140", "2", "2.4", "2.5", "20", "2103.04956", "3", "4", "40", "5", "7", "70", "additional", "all", "and", "any", "b-tagged", "candidate", "criteria", "d_1jet", "d_2jet", "deltar", "electron", "electrons", "eta", "events", "flavor", "for", "gev", "irrespective", "jet", "jets", "leading", "lepton", "leptons", "m4l", "most", "muon", "muons", "next-to-leading", "none", "not", "opposite-charge", "opposite-sign", "pair", "pairs", "particles", "region_has_selection", "remaining", "satisfying", "scalar", "stable", "sum", "tth-hadronic-tagged", "tth-leptonic-tagged", "vbf", "vbf-1jet-tagged", "vbf-2jet-tagged", "vh-hadronic-tagged", "vh-leptonic-tagged", "with", "within"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8104, "completion_tokens": 620, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 26.27522310707718, "error": ""}, "scor