{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-986b6dd7", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2407.10549 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2407.10549 defines 16 region selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \\(2 \\frac{m_J}{p_T^J} < 0.6\\)\n- \\(E_T^{\\text{miss}} / p_T^{J} \\in [0.8, 1.3]\\)\n- \\(E_T^{\\text{miss}} / p_T^{\\text{jj}} \\in [0.8, 1.3]\\)\n- \\(E_T^{\\text{miss}} > 150 \\text{ GeV}\\)\n- \\(E_T^{\\text{miss}}\\) categorized into \\([150,200)\\), \\([200,350)\\), \\([350,500)\\) GeV bins\n- \\(E_T^{\\text{miss}}\\) categorized into \\([500,750)\\), \\(\\geq 750 \\text{ GeV}\\) bins\n- \\(E_T^{\\text{miss}}\\) significance \\(S > 12\\)\n- Central small-R jet multiplicity \\(\\leq 4\\)\n- Leading electron \\(p_T > 27 \\text{ GeV}\\), leading muon \\(p_T > 25 \\text{ GeV}\\), subleading lepton \\(p_T > 7 \\text{ GeV}\\)\n- \\(m_T^{b,\\text{min}} > 170 \\text{ GeV}\\) and \\(m_T^{b,\\text{max}} > 200 \\text{ GeV}\\)\n- \\(\\min \\Delta\\Phi(\\text{MET}, \\text{leading 3 small-R jets}) \\geq 20^\\circ\\)\n- Same kinematic selection and \\(E_T^{\\text{miss}}\\) trigger as the SR\n- Same requirements as SR; \\(S > 12\\) with secondary significance <5 using MET with two visible leptons\n- Split into two subregions by muon charge\n- \\(|m_{ll} - m_Z| < 10 \\text{ GeV}\\) and \\(p_T^{ll} > 150 \\text{ GeV}\\)\n\nThese requirements are detailed in the paper and are used to define the regions for the analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2407.10549 defines 16 region selection requirements. These include criteria such as \\(2 \\\\frac{m_J}{p_T^J} < 0.6\\), \\(E_T^{\\text{miss}} / p_T^{J} \\\\in [0.8, 1.3]\\), \\(E_T^{\\text{miss}} > 150 \\\\text{ GeV}\\), and others.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2407.10549"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.068}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:10558c989c4927291596366f", "hepkg:evidence:10c010e8a944edfd4caf44c9", "hepkg:evidence:127bb6fd0f4f4cafecc96b10", "hepkg:evidence:54dca7b4db7bde43a44b11ea", "hepkg:evidence:782cff1ac4f5195f422e9407", "hepkg:evidence:7fe04e8a052f4b6813e66ad5", "hepkg:evidence:95bdb57a88ede856809c2b8b", "hepkg:evidence:a0ba3b2313f9fd849c825072", "hepkg:evidence:a5d4edef449fdb185a490910", "hepkg:evidence:aa2b8f60276d4b5a7a55c863", "hepkg:evidence:b09ca3bb188de7a44d6470a9", "hepkg:evidence:b47eec4fa5805a35fc56aadf", "hepkg:evidence:b6b15652ff17d82d49268633", "hepkg:evidence:c5ccaf41ad3f70b8ed4879b7"], "seen_values": ["0.6", "0.8", "1", "1.3", "10", "12", "15", "150", "150,200", "1502", "150200", "17", "170", "2", "20", "200", "200,350", "20035", "200350", "2407.10549", "25", "27", "3", "350,500", "3505", "350500", "4", "5", "500,750", "50075", "500750", "7", "75", "750", "and", "binning", "bins", "categorized", "central", "charge", "divided", "e_t", "electron", "gev", "into", "jet", "jets", "kinematic", "leading", "lepton", "leptons", "m_j", "m_ll", "m_t", "m_z", "max", "met", "min", "miss", "multiplicity", "muon", "none", "p_t", "region_has_selection", "requirements", "resolved", "same", "secondary", "selection", "significance", "small-r", "split", "subleading", "subregions", "the", "trigger", "two", "using", "visible", "way", "with"], "verification_score": 0.9411764705882353, "unsupported_claims": ["16"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7821, "completion_tokens": 666, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 27.764875749126077, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 27.764875749126077, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8487.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused