{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-9ea93c35", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2004.14060 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2004.14060 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- $b$-tagged track-jet\n- Baseline electron\n- Baseline muon\n- Calorimeter jet (anti-$k_t$, R=0.4)\n- Control (tight) electron\n- Control (tight) muon\n- Hadronic $\\tau$-lepton candidate\n- ISR jet (SRD, leading non-$b$-tagged jet)\n- Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss)\n- Primary vertex (PV)\n- Reclustered R=0.8 jet\n- Reclustered R=1.2 jet (hadronic top candidate)\n- Track-based missing transverse momentum ($\\mathbf{p}_T^{miss,track}$)\n- Track-jet (anti-$k_t$, R=0.4, built from inner-detector tracks)\n- $b$-tagged jet\n\nThese objects are used in the analysis to define the selection criteria and event reconstruction.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.14060"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:bjet", "hepkg:object:btrackjet", "hepkg:object:electron_baseline", "hepkg:object:electron_control", "hepkg:object:isr_jet_srd", "hepkg:object:jet_r04", "hepkg:object:met", "hepkg:object:me