{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-9f5dee40", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2510.07527 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2510.07527 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- VBF HH signal MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6.5 LO, 7 coupling points)\n- VHH signal MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6.5 LO, 8 coupling points)\n- ggF HH signal MC sample (POWHEG v2 NLO matrix elements, 4 kappa_lambda points)\n\nThis information is supported by the following assertions from the paper:\n\n- \"VBF HH signal MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6.5 LO, 7 coupling points)\"\n- \"VHH signal MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6.5 LO, 8 coupling points)\"\n- \"ggF HH signal MC sample (POWHEG v2 NLO matrix elements, 4 kappa_lambda points)\"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2510.07527"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:ggf_hh_powheg", "hepkg:sample:vbf_hh_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:vhh_madgraph"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:06cd662fe519defe222d979a", "hepkg:evidence:379875241612f1b7f8896c7e", "hepkg:evidence:88db32226e4c8dbffdce56b1", "hepkg:evidence:ff4170661d7d26669b10f2de"], "seen_values": ["2", "2.6.5", "2510.07527", "4", "7", "8", "coupling", "elements", "ggf", "hepkg:sample:ggf_hh_powheg", "hepkg:sample:vbf_hh_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:vhh_madgraph", "kappa_lambda", "madgraph5_amc", "matrix", "nlo", "points", "powheg", "result_uses_sample", "sample", "signal", "vbf", "vhh"], "verification_score": 0.5, "unsupported_claims": ["2.6"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7098, "completion_tokens": 482, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 19.78898520488292, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 19.78898520488292, "llm_