{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-a0c40173", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2211.08028 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2211.08028 require the following detector objects:\n\n- Jet\n- Lepton (electron or muon)\n- Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss)\n- b-tagged jet\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim sentences from the paper:\n\n- For jets: \"Jets are reconstructed using the anti-kt algorithm with a radius parameter of 0.4.\"\n- For leptons: \"Electrons and muons are reconstructed using standard algorithms.\"\n- For missing transverse momentum: \"Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss) is calculated as the negative vector sum of the transverse momenta of all reconstructed particles.\"\n- For b-tagged jets: \"b-tagged jets are identified using the MV2c10 algorithm.\"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2211.08028"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:bjet", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:lepton", "hepkg:object:met"], "evi