{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-a283f170", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which generators does analysis 2604.27044 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2604.27044 uses the following generators:\n\n- MadGraph5_aMC@NLO\n- PYTHIA 8.306 with CP5 tune (parton shower/hadronization/underlying event)\n- powheg v2\n\nThis information is supported by the following assertions from the paper:\n\n- For MadGraph5_aMC@NLO: \"MadGraph5_aMC@NLO is used for the simulation of the signal samples.\"\n- For PYTHIA 8.306 with CP5 tune: \"PYTHIA 8.306 with the CP5 tune is used for parton showering, hadronization, and underlying event simulation.\"\n- For powheg v2: \"POWHEG v2 is used for the simulation of the tt̄ background.\"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2110.11231", "2206.09466", "2209.07327", "2308.02285", "2508.13900", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.27044"], "predicate": "sample_uses_generator"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:generator:madgraph5-amcatnlo", "hepkg:generator:powheg-v2", "hepkg:generator:pythia8-cp5"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:2a855f0b49964ea21a9af69f", "hepkg:evidence:7b7f8ff09989045b2d21935e", "hepkg:evidence:8b8f5221f78696673f6bd6ea", "hepkg:evidence:b9b4eb525ae5d18e3c3403e3", "hepkg:evidence:f3d7a37ef52ae9147fb04163", "hepkg:evidence:f3d7f9b246eea803e103658f"], "seen_values": ["2", "2604.27044", "8.306", "cp5", "event", "generator", "hadronization", "hepkg:generator:madgraph5-amcatnlo", "hepkg:generator:powheg-v2", "hepkg:generator:pythia8-cp5", "madgraph5_amc", "nlo", "parton", "powheg", "pythia", "sample_uses_generator", "shower", "tune", "underlying", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7060, "completion_t