{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-a5248ac9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2112.03161 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2112.03161 estimates four backgrounds:\n\n- Lost-t/W background component (nonresonant in m_bb, at least one but not all required quarks in the bb jet)\n- m_W background component (resonant W/Z-boson-mass peak in m_bb, from ttbar events with both W/Z-decay quarks in the bb jet)\n- m_t background component (resonant top-quark-mass peak in m_bb, from ttbar events with all 3 top-decay quarks in the bb jet)\n- q/g background component (nonresonant, no matched top/W/Z decay quarks; light-flavor quark/gluon jets misidentified as bb)\n\nThese details are directly from the paper. \n\nAnswered from the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2112.03161 estimates four backgrounds:\\n\\n- Lost-t/W background component (nonresonant in m_bb, at least one but not all required quarks in the bb jet)\\n- m_W background component (resonant W/Z-boson-mass peak in m_bb, from ttbar events with both W/Z-decay quarks in the bb jet)\\n- m_t background component (resonant top-quark-mass peak in m_bb, from ttbar events with all 3 top-decay quarks in the bb jet)\\n- q/g background component (nonresonant, no matched top/W/Z decay quarks; light-flavor quark/gluon jets misidentified as bb)\\n\\nThese details are directly from the paper.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2112.03161"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2112.03161"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:lost_tw_background", "hepkg:background:mt_background",