{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-a5df0387", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2205.05120 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2205.05120 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Background from jets misidentified as tau_h candidates (QCD multijet, W+jets, ttbar, diboson)\n- Drell-Yan \\( Z/\\gamma^* \\to \\tau\\tau \\) background\n- Other minor backgrounds: Drell-Yan \\( ee/\\mu\\mu \\), \\( t\\bar{t} \\), single top, and multiboson with fewer than two genuine leptons\n- QCD multijet background in the e-mu channel (jet misidentified as electron or muon)\n\nThis information is directly from the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2205.05120"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2205.05120"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:drell-yan-tautau", "hepkg:background:jet-to-tauh-misid", "hepkg:background:other-minor-backgrounds", "hepkg:background:qcd-multijet-emu"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0fee8aba657bc377be3fd7dd", "hepkg:evidence:73312ef1317dfa3d79e9284f", "hepkg:evidence:77f27e101237faef84c8e4ec", "hepkg:evidence:b3e8513ab833e39493a4582b", "hepkg:evidence:d0b847b71603a1b2941ee7dc"], "seen_values": ["2205.0512", "2205.05120", "and", "background", "backgrounds", "candidates", "channel", "diboson", "drell-yan", "e-mu", "electron", "fewer", "from", "gamma", "genuine", "hepkg:background:drell-yan-tautau", "hepkg:background:jet-to-tauh-misid", "hepkg:background:other-minor-backgrounds", "hepkg:background:qcd-multijet-emu", "jet", "jets", "leptons", "minor", "misidentified", "multiboson", "multijet", "mumu", "muon", "other", "qcd", "result_estimates_background", "single", "tau_h", "tautau", "than", "the", "top", "ttbar