{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-a6dc0dd0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which background-estimation methods does analysis 2007.02873 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2007.02873 uses the following background-estimation methods:\n\n- Asymptotic formulae for significance calculation of background-only hypothesis rejection\n- Beeston–Barlow technique for MC statistical uncertainty treatment\n- Binned maximum-likelihood global fit (product of Poisson terms over bins, POIs and nuisance parameters)\n- Bootstrap method for statistical compatibility testing between analyses\n- Maximum-likelihood fits / profiled negative-log-likelihood for one-dimensional Wilson-coefficient confidence intervals\n- Smoothing and pruning of systematic variations region-by-region\n\nThese methods are used to estimate and handle backgrounds in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2007.02873"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:asymptotic_significance_formulae", "hepkg:method:beeston_barlow", "hepkg:method:bootstrap_compatibility", "hepkg:method:global_likelihood_fit", "hepkg:method:profile_likelihood_eft", "hepkg:method:systematic_smoothing_pruning"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1221ebac96f2404df4272c70", "hepkg:evidence:41cb1b346a5344850f3ff5a4", "hepkg:evidence:51403597c0aa3b992fc87d37", "hepkg:evidence:58899763d4ef3b589ee7e01c", "hepkg:evidence:bd0627dca08aef9a728536ba", "hepkg:evidence:fb57cf64eebbee88c7830d9e"], "seen_values": ["2007.02873", "analyses", "and", "asymptotic", "background-only", "barlow", "beeston", "between", "binned", "bins", "bootstrap", "calculation", "compatibility", "confidence", "fit", "fits", "for", "formulae", "global", "hepkg:method:asymptotic_significance_formulae", "hepkg:method:beeston_barlow", "hepkg:method:bootstrap_compatibility", "hepkg:method:global_likelihood_fit", "hepkg:method:profile_likelihood_eft", "hepkg:method:systematic_smoothing_pruning", "hypothesis", "intervals", "maximum-likelihood", "method", "negative-log-likelihood", "nuisance", "one-dimensional", "over", "parameters", "pois", "poisson", "product", "profiled", "pruning", "region-by-region", "rejection", "result_uses_statistical_method", "significance", "smoothing", "statistical", "statistical_method", "systematic", "technique", "terms", "testing", "treatment", "uncertainty", "variations", "wilson-coefficient"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7296, "completion_tokens": 172, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 8.005563787184656, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 8.005563787184656, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7468.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 0.0, "retrieved_entities": 6.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 0.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 6.0, "evidence_quotes": 6.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-a719ff94", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2111.08340 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2111.08340 require the following detector objects:\n\n- Anti-tagged candidate jet\n- Double-tagged candidate jet\n- J_b jet (b-quark proxy large-R jet in CR_ttbar)\n- J_t jet (hadronic top-quark proxy large-R jet in CR_ttbar)\n- Large-radius (R=1.0) jet\n- Muon\n- Track-jet\n\nThese objects are essential for defining the event regions in this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2111.08340"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:Jb-jet", "hepkg:object:Jt-jet", "hepkg:object:anti-tagged-candidate-jet", "hepkg:object:double-tagged-candidate-jet", "hepkg:object:large-R-jet", "hepkg:object:muon", "hepkg:object:track-jet"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:08b063982958279163d2154f", "hepkg:evidence:16759212070690b1534cfb33", "hepkg:evidence:49d96798ad7cc48186c0b998", "hepkg:evidence:51eb555544cd677fa3aa2525", "hepkg:evidence:9862dc8f1892c7ad5cd9a97b", "hepkg:evidence:a6df47e7283e6e4280411162", "hepkg:evidence:c81a24c85d18608d085c8c3c"], "seen_values": ["1", "1.0", "2111.0834", "2111.08340", "anti-tagged", "b-quark", "candidate", "cr_ttbar", "detector_object", "double-tagged", "hadronic", "hepkg:object:anti-tagged-candidate-jet", "hepkg:object:double-tagged-candidate-jet", "hepkg:object:jb-jet", "hepkg:object:jt-jet", "hepkg:object:large-r-jet", "hepkg:object:muon", "hepkg:object:track-jet", "j_b", "j_t", "jet", "large-r", "large-radius", "muon", "proxy", "region_requires_object", "top-quark", "track-jet"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7288, "completion_tokens": 144, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 6.902496049646288, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 6.902496049646288, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7432.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 7.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 1.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 7.0, "evidence_quotes": 7.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-a78d3380", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2509.22535 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2509.22535 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}H(H \\to b\\bar{b})$\n- $t\\bar{t}H(H \\to c\\bar{c})$\n- $t\\bar{t}Z(Z \\to b\\bar{b})$\n- $t\\bar{t}Z(Z \\to c\\bar{c})$\n- Higgs boson production in association with a W or Z boson, decaying to $c\\bar{c}$ (VH, H→cc)\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- For $t\\bar{t}H(H \\to b\\bar{b})$: \"The analysis targets the $t\\bar{t}H$ process with the Higgs boson decaying to a pair of bottom quarks.\"\n- For $t\\bar{t}H(H \\to c\\bar{c})$: \"The analysis also considers the $t\\bar{t}H$ process with the Higgs boson decaying to a pair of charm quarks.\"\n- For $t\\bar{t}Z(Z \\to b\\bar{b})$: \"The analysis includes the $t\\bar{t}Z$ process with the Z boson decaying to a pair of bottom quarks.\"\n- For $t\\bar{t}Z(Z \\to c\\bar{c})$: \"The analysis also includes the $t\\bar{t}Z$ process with the Z boson decaying to a pair of charm quarks.\"\n- For VH, H→cc: \"The analysis further targets the production of a Higgs boson in association with a W or Z boson, with the Higgs boson decaying to a pair of charm quarks.\"\n\nThese processes are the primary targets of the analysis as recorded in the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2509.22535 targets the following physics processes:\\n\\n- $t\\\\bar{t}H(H \\\\to b\\\\bar{b})$\\n- $t\\\\bar{t}H(H \\\\to c\\\\bar{c})$\\n- $t\\\\bar{t}Z(Z \\\\to b\\\\bar{b})$\\n- $t\\\\bar{t}Z(Z \\\\to c\\\\bar{c})$\\n- Higgs boson production in association with a W or Z boson, decaying to $c\\\\bar{c}$ (VH, H→cc)\\n\\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\\n\\n- For $t\\\\bar{t}H(H \\\\to b\\\\bar{b})$: \\\"The analysis targets the $t\\\\bar{t}H$ process with the Higgs boson decaying to a pair of bottom quarks.\\\"\\n- For $t\\\\bar{t}H(H \\\\to c\\\\bar{c})$: \\\"The analysis also considers the $t\\\\bar{t}H$ process with the Higgs boson decaying to a pair of charm quarks.\\\"\\n- For $t\\\\bar{t}Z(Z \\\\to b\\\\bar{b})$: \\\"The analysis includes the $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ process with the Z boson decaying to a pair of bottom quarks.\\\"\\n- For $t\\\\bar{t}Z(Z \\\\to c\\\\bar{c})$: \\\"The analysis also includes the $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ process with the Z boson decaying to a pair of charm quarks.\\\"\\n- For VH, H→cc: \\\"The analysis", "answered": true, "papers": ["2509.22535"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2509.22535"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.02}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:VH_Hcc", "hepkg:process:ttH_Hbb", "hepkg:process:ttH_Hcc", "hepkg:process:ttZ_Zbb", "hepkg:process:ttZ_Zcc"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:16ff824ed02d48ae1f17b40f", "hepkg:evidence:1bbe74c8404a6da754a5ff99", "hepkg:evidence:8060bbb82aeb9cee01a228e1", "hepkg:evidence:c381e9d52d7e1ab06fe6595b"], "seen_values": ["2509.22535", "association", "bar", "boson", "decaying", "hepkg:process:tth_hbb", "hepkg:process:tth_hcc", "hepkg:process:ttz_zbb", "hepkg:process:ttz_zcc", "hepkg:process:vh_hcc", "higgs", "physics_process", "production", "result_targets_process", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7215, "completion_tokens": 838, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 34.08094866387546, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 34.08094866387546, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8053.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_lab