{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-aa3b9037", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2201.11585 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2201.11585 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- **QCD multijet control region**: defined by inverting min(Δφ(p_T^miss, jet))\n- **Signal region**: VBF jet pair + p_T^miss, lepton/photon/tau_h/b-jet veto, with MTR and VTR category-specific selections\n- **W(eν) control region**\n- **W(μν) control region**\n- **Z(ee) control region**\n- **Z(μμ) control region**\n- **γ+jets control region**: available only in the MTR category\n\nThese regions are used to control various backgrounds and to define the signal region.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2201.11585"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2201.11585"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:cr_gamma", "hepkg:region:cr_qcd", "hepkg:region:cr_wenu", "hepkg:region:cr_wmunu", "hepkg:region:cr_zee", "hepkg:region:cr_zmumu", "hepkg:region:sr"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3412f2a78e3e41a3b480a98b", "hepkg:evidence:4cc95a58756f27f23f623cad", "hepkg:evidence:5156f4ad7e172ee30c77a4be", "hepkg:evidence:656426c0eb538a893879d361", "hepkg:evidence:e67c317b9c9b06a68d7962cb"], "seen_values": ["2201.11585", "and", "available", "b-jet", "category", "category-specific", "channel_has_region", "control", "defined", "event_region", "hepkg:region:cr_gamma", "hepkg:region:cr_qcd", "hepkg:region:cr_wenu", "hepkg:region:cr_wmunu", "hepkg:region:cr_zee", "hepkg:region:cr_zmumu", "hepkg:region:sr", "inverting", "jet", "jets", "lepton", "min", "miss", "mtr", "multijet", "only", "p_t", "pair", "photon", "qcd", "region", "selections", "signal", "