{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-aa69e1d9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2012.01581 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2012.01581 defines 24 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \"3D impact parameter w.r.t. leading PV < 0.3 mm\"\n- \"GBDT score g > 0.988\"\n- \"IP2D w.r.t. leading PV < 1.0 mm, pT>1 GeV\"\n- \"IP2D>0.5 mm and Sig[IP2D]>5.0 (used to build SV, offline)\"\n- \"IP2D>0.5 mm and Sig[IP2D]>5.0, pT>1 GeV (trigger definition)\"\n- \"Lxy significance > 200\"\n- \"N_tracks^3D < 3 for leading jet\"\n- \"N_tracks^3D < 3 for subleading jet\"\n- \"SV position must not overlap with the NI-veto map\"\n- \"associated tracks pT>0.2 GeV, high purity, IP2D>0.5 mm, Sig[IP2D]>5.0\"\n- \"candidate vertex with largest summed physics-object pT^2 is the leading PV\"\n- \"chi2/ndof<5.0, invariant mass>4 GeV, pT>8 GeV\"\n- \"epsilon (SV track energy fraction) < 0.15\"\n- \"epsilon (SV track energy fraction) > 0.15\"\n- \"offline pT>50 GeV, |eta|<2.0 for events passing displaced trigger\"\n- \"offline pT>80 GeV, |eta|<2.0 for events passing only inclusive trigger\"\n- \"pT>1 GeV and high-purity track\"\n- \"pT>40 GeV, |eta|<2.0 (HLT displaced trigger)\"\n- \"pT>60 GeV, |eta|<2.0 (HLT inclusive trigger)\"\n- \"second-highest Sig[IP2D] of assigned tracks > 15\"\n- \"tracks associated with dijet candidates formed from jets with pT>10 GeV, |eta|<2.0\"\n- \"vertex chi2/ndof < 3.0\"\n- \"vertex track multiplicity > 3\"\n- \"zeta (energy fraction from compatible PVs) < 0.2\"\n\nThese selections are detailed in the paper and are used to define the object criteria for the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2012.01581 defines 24 object selection requirements. These include criteria such as '3D impact parameter w.r.t. leading PV < 0.3 mm', 'GBDT score g > 0.988', and 'IP2D w.r.t. leading PV < 1.0 mm, pT>1 GeV'.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.01581"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0676332d387b25da68bc16d0", "hepkg:evidence:2869a91be0b4527a82a3695e", "hepkg:evidence:2e228431c1dadbbc3ecb6923", "hepkg:evidence:31598974e978d4acfab1ecf8", "hepkg:evidence:483ae25330b9f5fc70e6e4ee", "hepkg:evidence:5181f548e668ba5ee599ab70", "hepkg:evidence:6541493e08385a24bea94390", "hepkg:evidence:76ed95bfde078da4a5b2d0bd", "hepkg:evidence:7c26290d53bb4348f99c6ae8", "hepkg:evidence:7c58b08611fcb6f6a07102f8", "hepkg:evidence:87abd0fe395419bfbb545cc5", "hepkg:evidence:94024060319e7cbdb28f80d4", "hepkg:evidence:98e49c72080f9814e28ad3a1", "hepkg:evidence:9b6a5a34efccda7c9e191359", "hepkg:evidence:9c86abb4dee0d302a98cdf39", "hepkg:evidence:c7a12e00b4c362ebf462c8fb", "hepkg:evidence:c7a621711376494441890875", "hepkg:evidence:d1f24887e6536d9a4cc42bc9", "hepkg:evidence:d28a029d9c857068dda81849", "hepkg:evidence:d437b7ed42906b5022e052fd", "hepkg:evidence:d776ec4d0e659727c58e5b1f", "hepkg:evidence:ebb501d715ed6bf52dc13a47", "hepkg:evidence:ebb5ca1dda74dfbb74f52399", "hepkg:evidence:f0a19104ff86adefd7e53560"], "seen_values": ["0.15", "0.2", "0.3", "0.5", "0.988", "1", "1.0", "10", "15", "2", "2.0", "200", "2012.01581", "3", "3.0", "4", "40", "5", "5.0", "50", "6", "60", "8", "80", "and", "assigned", "associated", "build", "candidate", "candidates", "chi2", "compatible", "definition", "dijet", "displaced", "energy", "epsilon", "eta", "events", "for", "formed", "fraction", "from", "gbdt", "gev", "high", "high-purity", "hlt", "impact", "inclusive", "invariant", "ip2d", "jet", "jets", "largest", "leading", "lxy", "map", 