{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-aaa44d75", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2404.06204 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2404.06204 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- Detector-level signal region for \\( W \\rightarrow e \\nu \\) selection\n- Detector-level signal region for \\( W \\rightarrow \\mu \\nu \\) selection\n- Detector-level signal region for \\( Z \\rightarrow ee \\) selection\n- Detector-level signal region for \\( Z \\rightarrow \\mu \\mu \\) selection\n- Particle-level fiducial phase space for \\( W \\rightarrow l \\nu \\) cross-section measurement\n- Particle-level fiducial phase space for \\( Z \\rightarrow l l \\) cross-section measurement\n- \\( W \\rightarrow l \\nu \\) multijet background 'fit region' (relaxed \\( E_T^{miss} \\) and \\( m_T \\), inverted isolation)\n- \\( Z \\rightarrow ee \\) multijet control region C (fail Medium, pass Loose ID, same-charge pairs, \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV)\n- \\( Z \\rightarrow l l \\) multijet control region B (subleading lepton fails isolation)\n- \\( Z \\rightarrow l l \\) multijet control region D (combined B and C modifications)\n- \\( Z \\rightarrow \\mu \\mu \\) multijet control region C (same-charge muon pairs, \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV)\n\nThese regions are used to define the selection criteria for different channels in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2404.06204"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2404.06204"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:w-enu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:w-lnu-fiducial", "hepkg:region:w-mj-fit-region", "hepkg:region:w-munu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:z-ee-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:z-ll-fi