{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-ab3c214d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2312.04450 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2312.04450 contains the following event regions across its channels:\n\n- **Dilepton (2$\\\\ell$OS) final state: hadronic $t\\\\bar{t}$ + $Z\\\\to\\\\ell\\\\ell$**\n  - SR-2ℓ-5j2b\n  - SR-2ℓ-6j1b\n  - SR-2ℓ-6j2b\n  - 2ℓ-eμ-5j2b (data-driven ttbar control region)\n  - 2ℓ-eμ-6j1b (data-driven ttbar control region)\n  - 2ℓ-eμ-6j2b (data-driven ttbar control region)\n\n- **Tetralepton (4$\\\\ell$) final state: dileptonic $t\\\\bar{t}$ + $Z\\\\to\\\\ell\\\\ell$**\n  - SR-4ℓ-SF\n  - SR-4ℓ-DF\n  - CR-4ℓ-ZZ\n  - 4ℓ particle-level fiducial volume\n  - 4ℓ parton-level fiducial volume\n\n- **Trilepton (3$\\\\ell$) final state: semileptonic $t\\\\bar{t}$ + $Z\\\\to\\\\ell\\\\ell$**\n  - SR-3ℓ-ttZ\n  - SR-3ℓ-tZq\n  - SR-3ℓ-WZ\n  - CR-ttbar-e (trilepton fake-lepton control region, electron)\n  - CR-ttbar-mu (trilepton fake-lepton control region, muon)\n  - CR-Z-e (trilepton fake-lepton control region, Z-like)\n  - 3ℓ particle-level fiducial volume\n  - 3ℓ parton-level fiducial volume\n\nIn total, there are 16 distinct event regions across the channels of this analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2312.04450 contains 16 distinct event regions across its channels.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2312.04450"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2312.04450"], "predicate": "result_has_channel"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 1, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": [], "entity_set": "set_1", "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 0, "error"