{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-acf739d3", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2309.14442 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2309.14442 contains 4 event regions in its channel:\n\n- 5j3b fiducial phase space (≥5 jets, ≥3 b jets), targeting \\( t\\bar{t} \\)\n- 6j4b fiducial phase space (≥6 jets, ≥4 b jets), targeting \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\)\n- 6j3b3l fiducial phase space (≥6 jets, ≥3 b jets, ≥3 light jets), targeting \\( t\\bar{t}bj \\)\n- 7j4b3l fiducial phase space (≥7 jets, ≥4 b jets, ≥3 light jets), targeting \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}j \\)\n\nEach of these regions is defined for both electron and muon subchannels. \n\nTherefore, the analysis 2309.14442 contains **4 event regions** in its channel.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2309.14442 contains 4 event regions in its channel:\\n\\n- 5j3b fiducial phase space (≥5 jets, ≥3 b jets), targeting \\( t\\\\bar{t} \\\\)\\n- 6j4b fiducial phase space (≥6 jets, ≥4 b jets), targeting \\( t\\\\bar{t}b\\\\bar{b} \\\\)\\n- 6j3b3l fiducial phase space (≥6 jets, ≥3 b jets, ≥3 light jets), targeting \\( t\\\\bar{t}bj \\\\)\\n- 7j4b3l fiducial phase space (≥7 jets, ≥4 b jets, ≥3 light jets), targeting \\( t\\\\bar{t}b\\\\bar{b}j \\\\)\\n\\nEach of these regions is defined for both electron and muon subchannels.\\n\\nTherefore, the analysis 2309.14442 contains **4 event regions** in its channel.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2309.14442"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2309.14442"], "predicate": "result_has_channel"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 1, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": [], "entity_set": "set_1"