{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-ad1b49ad", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2103.04956 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2103.04956 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- VBF POWHEG 2.0 NLO signal MC sample\n- WZ and triboson (ZZZ, WZZ, WWZ) MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.4.2 NLO background MC sample\n- Z+jets MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.4.2 NLO background MC sample\n- bbH JHUGen 7.0.2 LO signal MC sample\n- gg->ZH JHUGen 7.3.0 LO signal MC sample\n- gg->ZZ MCFM 7.0.1 LO background MC sample\n- ggH POWHEG 2.0 NLO signal MC sample\n- qqbar->VH POWHEG 2.0 NLO signal MC sample\n- qqbar->ZZ POWHEG 2.0 NLO background MC sample\n- tHW MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.2.2 LO signal MC sample\n- tHq JHUGen 7.0.2 LO signal MC sample\n- ttH POWHEG 2.0 NLO signal MC sample\n- ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.4.2 LO background MC sample\n- ttbar POWHEG 2.0 NNLO background MC sample\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various signal and background processes in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.04956", "2106.14246", "2302.05225", "2309.14442"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.04956"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:bbh_jhugen", "hepkg:sample:gg_zh_jhugen", "hepkg:sample:ggh_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ggzz_mcfm", "hepkg:sample:qqzz_powheg", "hepkg:sample:thq_jhugen", "hepkg:sample:thw_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_powheg", "hepkg:sample:tth_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ttv_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:vbf_powheg", "hepkg:sample:vh_powheg", "hepkg:sample:wz_triboson_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:zjets_madgraph"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:00362caaddff7f5fc60a7299", "hepkg:evidence:0740c5e746aa76ed49ff9243", "hepkg:evidence:0bafdbe6717231657f5d