{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-ad64b1e6", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2011.07812 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2011.07812 require the following detector objects:\n\n- Displaced electron\n- Displaced muon\n\nThese requirements are explicitly stated in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2011.07812"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2011.07812"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:displaced-electron", "hepkg:object:displaced-muon"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:12d32981beb66e02f0c2963f", "hepkg:evidence:eee80c9f1a6bff3d11090d84"], "seen_values": ["2011.07812", "detector_object", "displaced", "electron", "hepkg:object:displaced-electron", "hepkg:object:displaced-muon", "muon", "region_requires_object"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 6977, "completion_tokens": 80, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 4.107084351126105, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 4.107084351126105, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7057.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 2.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 1.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-adfde194", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2403.01556 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2403.01556 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- CR/SR kinematic-difference uncertainty in mistag rate\n- Displaced track (d_xy>4cm) reconstruction efficiency uncertainty\n- Factorization/renormalization scale (muF, muR) variation uncertainty\n- Flavor composition (jet flavor evaluation) uncertainty in misidentification rate\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale uncertainty\n- Mistag rate parameterization choice uncertainty (variable/binning)\n- PDF uncertainty\n- Pile-up reweighting uncertainty (found negligible)\n- Track impact-parameter modeling (smearing) uncertainty\n- Trigger efficiency uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2110.11231", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2403.01556"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:cr-sr-kinematic-diff", "hepkg:systematic:displaced-track-reconstruction-efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:flavor-composition-mistag", "hepkg:systematic:integrated-luminosity", "hepkg:systematic:jet-energy-resolution", "hepkg:systematic:jet-energy-scale", "hepkg:systematic:mistag-rate-parameterization", "hepkg:systematic:pdf-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:pileup-reweighting", "hepkg:systematic:scale-variation-muF-muR", "hepkg:systematic:track-modeling-simulation", "hepkg:systematic:trigger-effici