{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-ae8ba641", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2110.11231 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2110.11231 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- **Nominal WZ signal sample**: POWHEG BOX v2.0, NLO QCD\n- **Alternative WZ signal sample**: MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, FxFx merging, NLO QCD, up to 1 extra parton\n- **Electroweak WZ production sample**: MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD\n- **Gluon-gluon loop-induced WW/ZZ background sample**: MCFM v7.0, LO QCD, scaled to NLO by 1.7\n- **Other diboson background sample** (Zγ, Wγ, ZH, WH): MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, NLO QCD\n- **Triboson background sample** (WWW, WWZ, WZZ, ZZZ, WZγ): MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, NLO QCD\n- **WZ aTGC-reweighted sample**: MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD\n- **qq-initiated WW and ZZ background sample**: POWHEG, NLO QCD\n- **ttX background sample** (tttt, ttW, ttZ, ttH, ttγ, tZq): MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, NLO QCD\n- **Drell-Yan comparison sample**: MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD (not used as background estimate)\n- **ttbar comparison sample**: MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD (not used as background estimate)\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various signal and background processes in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2110.11231"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2110.11231"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:drellyan-madgraph-comparison", "hepkg:sample:gg-ww-zz-mcfm", "hepkg:sample:other-diboson-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:qq-ww-zz-powheg", "hepkg:sample:triboson-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-madgraph-comparison", "hepkg:sample:ttx-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:wz-atgc-madgraph-lo", "hepkg:sample:wz-ewk-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:wz-signal-madgraph-fxfx", "hepkg:sampl