{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-b287df06", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many distinct generators does analysis 2207.12246 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2207.12246 uses 2 distinct generators: GEANT4 and Pythia 8.303 (MBR model).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2011.07812", "2207.12246", "2401.07090", "2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.12246"], "predicate": "sample_uses_generator"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:generator:geant4", "hepkg:generator:pythia8_303_mbr"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:14fb49c63e2207a87c7c997d", "hepkg:evidence:a195be1c21f65256a6903c17"], "seen_values": ["2207.12246", "8.303", "geant4", "generator", "hepkg:generator:geant4", "hepkg:generator:pythia8_303_mbr", "mbr", "model", "pythia", "sample_uses_generator"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 6988, "completion_tokens": 143, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 6.510858804918826, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 6.510858804918826, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7131.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-b2c9a1cd", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2008.05928 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2008.05928 defines 12 object selection requirements. Here are all the selection requirements:\n\n- MV2c10 b-tagging working point at 77% efficiency\n- Exactly two c.m. subjets reconstructed per large-R jet via EEkT algorithm in jet rest frame\n- Formed from the highest-pT photon and highest-pT large-R jet in the event\n- mH - Δ_m,D < mJ < mH + Δ_m,U (mH = 125.80 GeV), with Δ_m,D and Δ_m,U parameterized as fourth-order polynomials of jet pT\n- pT > 200 GeV; |η| < 1.37 (calorimeter barrel region)\n- pT > 200 GeV; |η| < 2.0; 50 GeV < mJ < 200 GeV; ΔR > 1.0 from photon; count ≥ 1\n- pT_J > 0.8 * (pT0 + a * mJγ), with pT0 = 12.0(121.8) GeV and a = 0.35(0.22) for single-b-tagged (double-b-tagged) category\n- pT_γ > pT0 + a * mJγ, with pT0 = 12.0(121.8) GeV and a = 0.35(0.22) for single-b-tagged (double-b-tagged) category\n- Tight photon identification and isolation; count ≥ 1\n- Track associated to c.m. subjet if opening angle Δθ (in jet rest frame) satisfies 2 * (1 - cos(Δθ)) < 0.8\n- ≥1 of the two c.m. subjets in the large-R jet pass the b-tagging requirement (single-b-tagged category); both pass (double-b-tagged category)", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2008.05928"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0f71a427bff85a7428808ff8", "hepkg:evidence:14f6dd94134d1b0ab7290a87", "hepkg:evidence:185c7b72ed111a07aa378f6f", "hepkg:evidence:4528c331be216ec776ede336", "hepkg:evidence:9a731f45a5e0a6c8f7e865d1", "hepkg:evidence:aab9b930efbe7fbc1cc898f2", "hepkg:evidence:ad4b0e13a6969d2e65a6f55f", "hepkg:evidence:c433bd6c1296775b8d2c8685", "hepkg:evidence:cfa1316496ed2d79db25b806", "hepkg:evidence:de4971710790ded448ce6435", "hepkg:evidence:fe7d76120bcc134421879a58"], "seen_values": ["-cos", "0.22", "0.35", "0.8", "1", "1.0", "1.37", "12", "12.0", "121.8", "125.8", "125.80", "2", "2.0", "200", "2008.05928", "5", "50", "77", "algorithm", "and", "angle", "associated", "b-tagging", "barrel", "both", "calorimeter", "category", "count", "delta_m", "delta_theta", "deltar", "double-b-tagged", "eekt", "efficiency", "eta", "event", "exactly", "for", "formed", "fourth-order", "frame", "from", "gev", "highest-pt", "identification", "isolation", "jet", "large-r", "mjgamma", "mv2c10", "none", "object_has_selection", "opening", "parameterized", "pass", "per", "photon", "point", "polynomials", "pt0", "pt_gamma", "pt_j", "reconstructed", "region", "requirement", "rest", "satisfies", "single-b-tagged", "subjet", "subjets", "the", "tight", "track", "two", "via", "with", "working"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7692, "completion_tokens": 661, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 27.37507779011503, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 27.37507779011503, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8353.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 0.0, "evidence_quotes": 11.0}}
