{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-b3d5df9e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2007.02873 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2007.02873 measures the following observables:\n\n- One-dimensional 68%/95% CL intervals on SMEFT Warsaw-basis Wilson coefficients affecting VH production and H→bb decay\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection for VH, H→bb production\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection for WH, H→bb production\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection for ZH, H→bb production\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection, dijet-mass cross-check analysis\n- VH production signal strength μ_VH^bb (H→bb, combined 0+1+2-lepton channels, BDT_VH multivariate analysis)\n- VH signal strength μ_VH^bb from dijet-mass (m_bb) cross-check analysis\n- VH, V→leptons production cross-section times H→bb branching fraction in reduced STXS regions\n- VZ, Z→bb diboson signal strength μ_VZ^bb (BDT_VZ diboson validation analysis)\n- WH production signal strength μ_WH^bb (H→bb, joint two-POI fit)\n- ZH production signal strength μ_ZH^bb (H→bb, joint two-POI fit)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2007.02873"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:eft_coefficient_constraints", "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb", "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb_dijetmass", "hepkg:observable:mu_vz_bb", "hepkg:observable:mu_wh_bb", "hepkg:observable:mu_zh_bb", "hepkg:observable:vh_significance", "hepkg:observable:vh_significance_dijetmass", "hepkg:observable:vh_stxs_xsec_br", "hepkg:observable:wh_significance", "hepkg:observable:zh_significance"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg