{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-b5b2c8ad", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2103.06956 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2103.06956 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- Electroweak vector boson fusion Higgs boson production (VBF)\n- Gluon fusion Higgs boson production (ggH)\n- Higgs boson decay to two photons (H→γγ)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a single top quark (tH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a top quark pair (ttH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a vector boson (VH)\n\nThese processes are explicitly mentioned in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956", "2207.00348", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.06956"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.02}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:ggh", "hepkg:process:h_to_diphoton", "hepkg:process:th", "hepkg:process:tth", "hepkg:process:vbf", "hepkg:process:vh"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:196aa3fe188369af007527cf", "hepkg:evidence:36dfb8da205d7005ec594389", "hepkg:evidence:783d74194d0229287f874b68", "hepkg:evidence:b5b9cdc4461538906711b439"], "seen_values": ["2103.06956", "association", "boson", "decay", "electroweak", "fusion", "ggh", "gluon", "hepkg:process:ggh", "hepkg:process:h_to_diphoton", "hepkg:process:th", "hepkg:process:tth", "hepkg:process:vbf", "hepkg:process:vh", "higgs", "pair", "photons", "physics_process", "production", "quark", "result_targets_process", "single", "top", "tth", "two", "vbf", "vector", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7245, "completion_tokens": 167, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 7.693884878885001, "error