{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-b5d88f01", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2211.08028 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2211.08028 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- $E_{\\text{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ soft-term reconstruction uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}$ initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty\n- Heavy-flavour content uncertainty in W/Z+jets background\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n- Jet mass scale (JMS) uncertainty\n- Kinematic (m_eff) reweighting procedure uncertainty\n- Lepton reconstruction, identification, and isolation efficiency uncertainty\n- MC background sample statistical (limited-event) uncertainty\n- Normalisation uncertainty on t t̄+W/Z/H, t t̄ t t̄ and diboson backgrounds (uncorrelated across regions)\n- Parton distribution function (PDF) uncertainty\n- SUSY signal cross-section uncertainty (renormalisation/factorisation scale, PDF, alpha_s variation)\n- Single-top / t t̄ interference modelling uncertainty (Wt-ttbar)\n- Single-top production cross-section uncertainty\n- Single-top radiation modelling uncertainty (Pythia 8.230 variations)\n- Total single-top modelling uncertainty impact on total yields\n- Total theoretical uncertainty in t t̄ background estimation (sum in quadrature of PS, ISR/FSR, ME generator)\n- Uncertainty on fraction of t t̄ events with additional heavy-flavour jets (ttbar+>=1b, ttbar+>=1c)\n- W/Z+jets factorisation/renormalisation scale and ME-PS matching uncertainty\n- b tagging (and mistag) efficiency calibration uncertainty\n- t t̄ hadronisation and parton-shower modelling uncertainty (Herwig vs Pythia)\n- t t̄ matrix-element generator choice uncertainty (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO vs Powheg Box)\n\nThese 