{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-b6b28b94", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2103.06956 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2103.06956 measures the following observables:\n\n- Gluon fusion Higgs boson production (ggH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a single top quark (tH)\n- Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier (μ = σ×B(H→γγ) / (σ×B)_SM)\n- STXS stage-1.2 cross sections × B(H→γγ), maximal merging scheme (17 parameters)\n- STXS stage-1.2 cross sections × B(H→γγ), minimal merging scheme (27 parameters)\n- Signal strength modifiers of the four principal Higgs boson production modes (μ_ggH, μ_VBF, μ_VH, μ_top)\n\nAdditionally, it uses the resolved κ model (κ_V, κ_F scan) and the unresolved κ model (κ, κ_g scan) as benchmarks.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2207.00348", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.06956"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:benchmark:resolved_kappa", "hepkg:benchmark:unresolved_kappa", "hepkg:observable:mu_inclusive", "hepkg:observable:mu_per_mode", "hepkg:observable:stxs_xsec_maximal", "hepkg:observable:stxs_xsec_minimal", "hepkg:process:ggh", "hepkg:process:th"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0347dcdbf821fd8482b882a2", "hepkg:evidence:0f5dc8044ebef4b8f3ac7d50", "hepkg:evidence:3b576facd62a2472c5c330fd", "hepkg:evidence:491d291ef6c36583e5d0ecd6", "hepkg:evidence:4c6f6ae2c478b7c288eba7a6", "hepkg:evidence:5e312793234ef6dc5b3809c4", "hepkg:evidence:8322115f2ac9c50b191cd6f1", "hepkg:evidence:8d6029cf28da9e25e68bfb7c", "hepkg:evidence:b64f39da90641966f61cae00", "hepkg:evidence:c1d805d01ef0f37b89877205", "hepk