{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-b9e87a81", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2010.14293 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2010.14293 defines 18 object selection requirements. These include:\n- 'FCTight' isolation requirements\n- 'Loose' likelihood-based identification\n- 'Medium' identification criteria\n- 'Tight' selection criteria\n- pT>20 GeV, |eta|<2.8\n- pT>25 GeV, |eta|<2.37 (excluding 1.37<|eta|<1.52), shower shape, electron rejection, isolated\n- pT>50 GeV, |eta|<2.5\n- pT>6 GeV, |eta|<2.7\n- pT>7 GeV, |eta|<2.47 (including 1.37<|eta|<1.52)\n- |d0/sigma(d0)|<3, |z0*sin(theta)|<0.5 mm\n- |d0/sigma(d0)|<5, |z0*sin(theta)|<0.5 mm, isolation similar to high-purity muons\n- |eta|<2.5\n- |eta|<2.8\n- ≥2 associated tracks with pT>500 MeV; largest sum pT^2 vertex chosen if multiple\n\nThis information is directly from the paper 2010.14293.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2010.14293"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:02e48316df21b8b9d4301e22", "hepkg:evidence:0c805c5c275e1ca619722947", "hepkg:evidence:0f02090b54c515aaf6bf45ed", "hepkg:evidence:248f7a74add740f81261e5a1", "hepkg:evidence:35cc7e245bb55032616fc560", "hepkg:evidence:36ab758ab852f105494b6805", "hepkg:evidence:3aa3bfc4bd7404087cc431c9", "hepkg:evidence:3f4eb9067f485b42c1fc65fd", "hepkg:evidence:4c294154ad2904fd4f87bc54", "hepkg:evidence:7770fe6457e70ca45d1fcd9e", "hepkg:evidence:7f160ae308ac5c8e4cb7f53d", "hepkg:evidence:81b143bd17dca52d0bda924a", "hepkg:evidence:88a00aaaaf0461bb12106102", "hepkg:evidence:92c3b995e6dcc5730473f1e1", "hepkg:evidence:dc1a41ad68abca1cf5fe3c48", "hepkg:evide