{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-bb1306b0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2401.05299 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2401.05299 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Diboson ($VV$) background\n- Top-antitop-Higgs ($t\\bar{t}H$) background\n- Top-antitop-Z/gamma-star ($t\\bar{t}Z/\\gamma^{*}$) background\n- Charge-misassignment (QMisID) background\n- Internal-conversion background (Int Conv)\n- Material-conversion electron background (Mat Conv)\n- Non-prompt (heavy-flavour) lepton background\n- Rare backgrounds ($tZ$, $tW$, $tWZ$, $t\\bar{t}WW$, $VVV$, $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}t$)\n\nIn total, the analysis estimates **8** backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.05299"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:internal-conversion", "hepkg:background:material-conversion", "hepkg:background:nonprompt-hf", "hepkg:background:qmisid", "hepkg:background:rare-processes", "hepkg:background:tth", "hepkg:background:ttz-gammastar"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:2b01e432cf286fb25ce1995e", "hepkg:evidence:32dad6c7844593b07ff038c3", "hepkg:evidence:55f41b08329406c4ecc2c4df", "hepkg:evidence:df8de4e8274831e3c5a03718", "hepkg:evidence:f1e21ef8aea6b4ade36e599b"], "seen_values": ["2401.05299", "background", "backgrounds", "bar", "charge-misassignment", "conv", "diboson", "electron", "gamma", "heavy-flavour", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:internal-conversion", "hepkg:background:material-conversion", "hepkg:background:nonprompt-hf", "hepkg:background:qmisid", "hepkg:background:rare-pr