{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-bbc43a41", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many statistical methods does analysis 2107.12553 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2107.12553 uses 2 statistical methods: a binned maximum likelihood fit for SUSY signal strength, background yields and nuisance parameters, and a modified frequentist CLs method with asymptotic formulation at 95% CL.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2107.12553", "2209.07327", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2107.12553"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:binned-ml-fit", "hepkg:method:cls-asymptotic"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3e413ce6f0a1fcb678a7c849", "hepkg:evidence:6f8590952c765a4ba62fb5dc"], "seen_values": ["2107.12553", "95", "and", "asymptotic", "background", "binned", "cls", "fit", "for", "formulation", "frequentist", "hepkg:method:binned-ml-fit", "hepkg:method:cls-asymptotic", "likelihood", "maximum", "method", "modified", "nuisance", "parameters", "result_uses_statistical_method", "signal", "statistical_method", "strength", "susy", "with", "yields"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7012, "completion_tokens": 268, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 11.352273283991963, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 11.352273283991963, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7280.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-bbf55e4b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2511.11853 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2511.11853 defines 7 object selection requirements. Here are the details:\n\n1. Jets with DeepJet medium working point (1% light/gluon misid, ~90% b efficiency), $\\eta < 2.4$, anti-kT algorithm with $R=0.4$, tight jet identification, pileup-jet BDT (tight WP) for $p_T < 50$ GeV, and lepton overlap removal with $\\Delta R > 0.4$.\n2. Jets that fail the DeepJet medium working point, $\\eta < 2.4$, anti-kT algorithm with $R=0.4$, tight jet identification, pileup-jet BDT (tight WP) for $p_T < 50$ GeV, and lepton overlap removal with $\\Delta R > 0.4$.\n3. Missing transverse energy (MET) defined as the negative vector sum of transverse momenta of all PF candidates in the event, modified to account for jet energy scale corrections.\n4. Electrons with $\\eta < 2.4$, HEEP identification (misidentification rate 1%), MVA isolation (cone $\\Delta R < 0.3$, total efficiency 85-90%), and $p_T > 53$ GeV.\n5. Muons with $\\eta < 2.4$, cutoff-based high-$p_T$ identification (misidentification rate 0.1%), relative PF isolation < 0.1 (cone $\\Delta R < 0.4$), and $p_T > 53$ GeV.\n6. Electrons with $\\eta < 2.4$, loose (cutoff-based high-$p_T$) identification, and $p_T > 10$ GeV.\n7. Electrons with $\\eta < 2.4$, loose MVA identification, and $p_T > 10$ GeV.\n\nThese selections are directly quoted from the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2511.11853 defines 7 object selection requirements. Here are the details:\\n\\n1. Jets with DeepJet medium working point (1% light/gluon misid, ~90% b efficiency), η < 2.4, anti-kT algorithm with R=0.4, tight jet identification, pileup-jet BDT (tight WP) for pT < 50 GeV, and lepton overlap removal with ΔR > 0.4.\\n2. Jets that fail the DeepJet medium working point, η < 2.4, anti-kT algorithm with R=0.4, tight jet identification, pileup-jet BDT (tight WP) for pT < 50 GeV, and lepton overlap removal with ΔR > 0.4.\\n3. Missing transverse energy (MET) defined as the negative vector sum of transverse momenta of all PF candidates in the event, modified to account for jet energy scale corrections.\\n4. Electrons with η < 2.4, HEEP identification (misidentification rate 1%), MVA isolation (cone ΔR < 0.3, total efficiency 85-90%), and pT > 53 GeV.\\n5. Muons with η < 2.4, cutoff-based high-pT identification (misidentification rate 0.1%), relative PF isolation < 0.1 (cone ΔR < 0.4), and pT > 53 GeV.\\n6. Electrons with η < 2.4, loose (cutoff-based high-pT) identification, and pT > 10 GeV.\\", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2511.11853"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:150d675497235ec4a801cc37", "hepkg:evidence:1ebf58a40462b20abeef50b7", "hepkg:evidence:3f61fbd133d1b97e72899944", "hepkg:evidence:5d6e3bd7bb696263ea26fa18", "hepkg:evidence:655aa5521799dada9eb2b452", "hepkg:evidence:818ecc551a1a5b271eb39891", "hepkg:evidence:9c12e9bd041bbed828a7b11e", "hepkg:evidence:a57e94318da8006442a5b877", "hepkg:evidence:a9d26f06d2fd35901a95a452", "hepkg:evidence:abdae12550f1cfe922651a24", "hepkg:evidence:b9e2ac679e1635c9fb77d303", "hepkg:evidence:e1f090c940739d746b9d85dd", "hepkg:evidence:eae5c2a0950da98cadb55cbb", "hepkg:evidence:f8498977b93c5f4c1d9a2096", "hepkg:evidence:f9090033e4b310c3f8f2ad84"], "seen_values": ["-90", "0.1", "0.3", "0.4", "1", "10", "2", "2.4", "20", "2511.11853", "3", "30", "5", "50", "53", "85", "9", "90", "account", "all", "anti-kt", "b_tagging", "bdt", "candidates", "cone", "correction", "corrections", "cutoff-based", "deepjet", "definition", "discriminant", "eff", "efficiency", "energy", "eta_max", "event", "fails", "for", "gev", "gluon", "heep", "high-pt", "identification", "isolation", "jet", "jet_algorithm", "jet_id", "lepton_overlap_removal_dr", "light", "loose", "medium", "misid", "misidentification", "modified", "momenta", "mva", "negative", "none", "object_has_selection", "pileup-jet", "point", "pt_min_gev", "rate", "relative", "scale", "sum", "the", "tight", "total", "transverse", "vector", "working"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7514, "completion_tokens": 838, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 34.11397426808253, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 34.11397426808253, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8352.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 0.0, "evidence_quotes": 15.0}}
