{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-bc5c5a22", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2201.11585 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2201.11585 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Diboson background (WZ, ZZ, WW, Vγ)\n- HF calorimeter noise-induced background (spurious \\( p_T^{miss} \\) from HF noise jets)\n- Nonprompt (misidentified-jet) photon background in the γ+jets control region\n- QCD multijet background\n- W(ℓν)+jets background (W→eν, W→μν)\n- Z(νν)+jets background (dominant irreducible SM background in the SR)\n- Z/γ*(l+l-)+jets background (Drell-Yan leptonic decay leakage into the SR)\n- t̅t + single top quark background\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated as part of the analysis reported in the paper 2201.11585.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2201.11585"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2201.11585"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:channel:diboson_bkg", "hepkg:channel:dy_ll_bkg", "hepkg:channel:hf_noise_bkg", "hepkg:channel:nonprompt_photon_bkg", "hepkg:channel:qcd_multijet", "hepkg:channel:ttbar_singletop", "hepkg:channel:wlnu_jets", "hepkg:channel:znunu_jets"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1ddc56a1ca23e10e8510a578", "hepkg:evidence:58d00dbdf02de4ab79816743", "hepkg:evidence:9ec568a4a73721d365e26530", "hepkg:evidence:b67e8e2752fc4c6dd351ab5e", "hepkg:evidence:d68f464a701755da2ae65fe4"], "seen_values": ["2201.11585", "background", "calorimeter", "channel", "control", "decay", "diboson", "dominant", "drell-yan", "from", "hepkg:channel:diboson_bkg", "hepkg:channel:dy_ll_bkg", "hepkg:channel:hf_noise_bkg", "hepkg:channel:nonprompt_photon_bkg", "hepkg:channel:qcd_multijet", "hepkg:channel:ttbar_singletop", "hep