{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-bce6620c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2012.01581 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2012.01581 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- 3D prompt track\n- Dijet candidate\n- Displaced secondary vertex inside jet from charm hadron decay (SV channel signature)\n- Displaced track\n- Ghost-associated track\n- Jet\n- Nuclear interaction (NI) candidate vertex\n- Primary vertex (PV)\n- Prompt track\n\nThese definitions are part of the analysis as recorded in the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.01581"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:3d_prompt_track", "hepkg:object:dijet_candidate", "hepkg:object:displaced_track", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:ni_candidate_vertex", "hepkg:object:primary_vertex", "hepkg:object:prompt_track", "hepkg:object:secondary_vertex", "hepkg:object:track"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0676332d387b25da68bc16d0", "hepkg:evidence:31598974e978d4acfab1ecf8", "hepkg:evidence:5042db6fdba58f88fda428ac", "hepkg