{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-bcea8edf", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2405.18661 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2405.18661 measures the following observables:\n\n- CKM matrix element |Vtb|\n- Four top quark production\n- H -> WW\n- H -> ZZ -> 4 leptons\n- H -> gamma gamma\n- H -> tau tau\n- Higgs boson mass\n- Higgs boson pair production\n- Higgs boson total decay width\n- Oblique H-hat parameter\n- Ratio of top quark Yukawa coupling to SM value (y_t/y_t^SM)\n- Single Higgs boson production\n- Single top quark production in association with a vector boson (tZq, tgammaq, tWZ)\n- Sum of squared CKM elements |Vtd|^2 + |Vts|^2\n- ttW production charge asymmetry (sigma(ttW+)/sigma(ttW-))\n- ttbar production in association with a bbbar pair\n- ttbar production in association with a vector boson (ttZ, ttW, ttgamma)\n\nThese observables are recorded in the paper 2405.18661.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2405.18661"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2405.18661"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:channel:h_to_tautau", "hepkg:fs:h_to_gammagamma", "hepkg:fs:h_to_ww", "hepkg:fs:h_to_zz_4l", "hepkg:parameter:h_hat", "hepkg:parameter:higgs_mass", "hepkg:parameter:higgs_width", "hepkg:parameter:top_yukawa_ratio", "hepkg:parameter:ttw_charge_asymmetry", "hepkg:parameter:vtb_ckm", "hepkg:parameter:vtd_vts_squared_sum", "hepkg:process:four_top_production", "hepkg:process:higgs_pair_production", "hepkg:process:higgs_production", "hepkg:process:single_top_vector_boson_production", "hepkg:process:ttbar_bbbar_production", "hepkg:process:ttbar_vector_boson_production"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:070c13600fb17b91738d6e6c", "h