{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-bdd5cdb1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2207.12246 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2207.12246 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- ALFA detector spatial resolution uncertainty\n- Background subtraction uncertainty (accidental coincidences and DPE)\n- Beam emittance model uncertainty\n- Beam transport method uncertainty (PTC-tracking vs transport-matrix simulation)\n- Coulomb phase parameterization uncertainty\n- Detector alignment systematic uncertainty (distance, offsets, rotation)\n- Effective beam optics model uncertainty (Q1,Q3,Q5,Q6 vs Q5,Q6-only fit)\n- Event reconstruction efficiency uncertainty (incl. t-dependence)\n- LHC beam energy uncertainty\n- Luminosity calibration-transfer (vdM-to-high-beta* regime) uncertainty\n- Luminosity long-term stability uncertainty\n- Luminosity single-beam background uncertainty\n- Proton electric form-factor parameterization uncertainty\n- Residual LHC crossing-angle uncertainty\n- Spin-dependent (magnetic-moment) Coulomb amplitude uncertainty\n- Theoretical nuclear-amplitude slope-model choice uncertainty (BCD/BC/B)\n- Total integrated luminosity systematic uncertainty\n- Track reconstruction fibre-layer requirement uncertainty (3 vs 4 layers)\n- Unfolding closure-test (data-driven bias) uncertainty\n- rho-parameter input variation in simulation\n- t-dependent nuclear phase model uncertainty\n- t-spectrum slope model uncertainty (BCD vs constant-B simulation)\n- vdM absolute luminosity calibration uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis and are part of the systematic evaluation.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.12246", "2303.15340"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.12246"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 23, "error": null, "seconds": 0.05}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:alignment", "hepkg:systematic:background_subtraction", "hepkg:systematic:beam_energy", "hepkg:systematic:beam_optics", "hepkg:systematic:beam_transport_ptc", "hepkg:systematic:crossing_angle", "hepkg:systematic:detector_resolution", "hepkg:systematic:emittance_model", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity_background", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity_calibration_transfer", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity_long_term_stability", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity_total", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity_vdm_calibration", "hepkg:systematic:reconstruction_efficiency_unc", "hepkg:systematic:rho_variation", "hepkg:systematic:simulation_slope_model", "hepkg:systematic:theory_coulomb_phase", "hepkg:systematic:theory_form_factor", "hepkg:systematic:theory_nuclear_phase_model", "hepkg:systematic:theory_slope_model_choice", "hepkg:systematic:theory_spin_dependence", "hepkg:systematic:tracking_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:unfolding_closure"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:017e7f921f18f62fbf2cb0b8", "hepkg:evidence:06535ff1b88dee3ba41f3430", "hepkg:evidence:0668544f829a1f4ec37cfe91", "hepkg:evidence:1322b4b5fa5202ff28ebe138", "hepkg:evidence:43c9a6bad0fa30fea8de8b1b", "hepkg:evidence:447b226a8cb58bb4a525213f", "hepkg:evidence:489a8fde856bd3273bf424d7", "hepkg:evidence:5a4b329068cda34ed5f6bb34", "hepkg:evidence:65a2c62bb9e774cf09411262", "hepkg:evidence:6c312b83f665cb3b4259a67c", "hepkg:evidence:8f362a3b27b46a20ad07db48", "hepkg:evidence:97d5cd311db83a38ea197626", "hepkg:evidence:9f78d541af645e414507d37d", "hepkg:evidence:a0925230c40f579f27d91558", "hepkg:evidence:a5419f47fbbc1379256d29af", "hepkg:evidence:bbd874ad9c20f9837fa07d8a", "hepkg:evidence:c183b793cbc9c6f71cb08bfd", "hepkg:evidence:ce76765e191cf0872e469ec9", "hepkg:evidence:cf928676026e9f6426a88f47", "hepkg:evidence:d93e31196d965707003befb1", "hepkg:evidence:e5e25f0d0db335e8da7e2431", "hepkg:evidence:e9a55cc