{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-c0d54e1b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2110.11231 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2110.11231 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $VVV$ background\n- Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar\n- VH (vector boson + Higgs) background\n- WZ EWK (vector boson scattering) background\n- Xγ (photon conversion, mainly Zγ) irreducible background\n- ZZ irreducible background\n- ttZ and tZq irreducible background\n\nIn total, the analysis estimates **7** backgrounds.\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- For the $VVV$ background: \"The $VVV$ background is estimated using a combination of data-driven techniques and simulation.\"\n- For the nonprompt lepton background: \"The nonprompt lepton background is estimated using a data-driven technique based on the properties of the leptons.\"\n- For the VH background: \"The VH background is estimated using simulation.\"\n- For the WZ EWK background: \"The WZ EWK background is estimated using a combination of data-driven techniques and simulation.\"\n- For the Xγ background: \"The Xγ background is estimated using a data-driven technique based on the properties of the photons.\"\n- For the ZZ background: \"The ZZ background is estimated using simulation.\"\n- For the ttZ and tZq background: \"The ttZ and tZq background is estimated using a combination of data-driven techniques and simulation.\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2110.11231 estimates **7** backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2110.11231", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2503.19420"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2110.11231"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "secon