{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-c3c15328", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2201.11585 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2201.11585 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- Additional 40% uncertainty on ggH production in association with two or more jets / high-pT tail\n- Electron/photon/muon/tau_h/b-tagged jet reconstruction and identification efficiency scale-factor uncertainty\n- HF noise template shape uncertainty (20%) from closure test\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Integrated luminosity/pileup uncertainty group (impact on B(H->inv))\n- Jet calibration uncertainty group (impact on B(H->inv))\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n- Leptons/photons/b-tagged jets uncertainty group (impact on B(H->inv))\n- NLO EW correction uncertainty in the W(lnu)+jets(gamma+jets)/Z(nunu)+jets strong-production ratio\n- Other systematic uncertainties group (impact on B(H->inv))\n- PDF uncertainty in the W(lnu)+jets/Z(nunu)+jets yield ratio\n- Pileup reweighting uncertainty (inelastic pp cross section +/-5%)\n- QCD multijet mismodelling uncertainty group (impact on B(H->inv))\n- QCD multijet normalization uncertainty from photon purity/nonprompt fraction measurement (25%)\n- Renormalization/factorization scale uncertainty in the W(lnu)+jets/Z(nunu)+jets and gamma/Z yield ratios\n- Signal acceptance uncertainty from PDF set choice and renormalization/factorization scales (per production mode)\n- Simulated event count (limited MC statistics) uncertainty group (impact on B(H->inv))\n- Theory systematic uncertainty group (impact on B(H->inv))\n- Trigger efficiency scale-factor uncertainty (p_T^miss and electron triggers)\n- Triggers uncertainty group (impact on B(H->inv))\n- W(lnu)+jets/Z(nunu)+jets/HF-noise normalization constraint uncertainty (20%) in QCD CR fit\n- ggH and VBF PDF and renormalization/factorization scale uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis 2201.11585.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2201.11585", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2201.11585"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 23, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:syst:ggh_extra_40pct", "hepkg:syst:ggh_vbf_pdf_scale", "hepkg:syst:hf_noise_template_shape", "hepkg:syst:integrated_luminosity", "hepkg:syst:jer", "hepkg:syst:jes", "hepkg:syst:jet_calibration_group", "hepkg:syst:lepton_photon_tau_btag_id_eff", "hepkg:syst:leptons_photons_btag_group", "hepkg:syst:lumi_pileup_group", "hepkg:syst:nlo_ew_correction_ratio", "hepkg:syst:other_systematic_group", "hepkg:syst:pileup_reweighting", "hepkg:syst:qcd_cr_normalization_constraint", "hepkg:syst:qcd_multijet_mismodelling_group", "hepkg:syst:qcd_multijet_photon_purity_norm", "hepkg:syst:signal_acceptance_pdf_scale", "hepkg:syst:simulated_event_count_group", "hepkg:syst:theory_group", "hepkg:syst:trigger_eff", "hepkg:syst:triggers_group", "hepkg:syst:vjets_gammajets_pdf_ratio", "hepkg:syst:vjets_gammajets_ren_fac_scale_ratio"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:03d5a40730070d7b78b7fe91", "hepkg:evidence:0cb11b2fe7e2134070c2e6d0", "hepkg:evidence:1021c92c8a8f220d7daa1abf", "hepkg:evidence:1e1e7bbcf51ec2133c669fff", "hepkg:evidence:2c9755ac6116c189bf962e50", "hepkg:evidence:30f4d1704280fff271e7c716", "hepkg:evidence:34e2cc0a0448798c7cb95efe", "hepkg:evidence:3aabd9d3fe738c3b8ce5ba47", "hepkg:evidence:3cbc69719a78a269fecca6d9", "hepkg:evidence:4b0e029e45d871772c82ab96", "hepkg:evidence:4e72accbcd142869cfe1f58d", "hepkg:evidence:70f34844752d2ece1d88d4eb", "hepkg:evidence:72499949a3f8714b463a21ef", "hepkg:evidence:76c6c273a53deea232c701b2", "hepkg:evidence:8bc89d4f0f102eb2fcf783b2", "hepkg:evidence:a94b0bcd2cf739b145e2f1