{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-c459dbd1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2208.12095 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2208.12095 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $W{+}\\text{jets}$ background\n- $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background\n- $tWZ$ and $tZ$ rare SM background (dilepton channel)\n- $t\\bar{t}H$ background\n- $t\\bar{t}V$ background\n- Diboson background\n- Non-prompt and fake-lepton background\n- Single top quark background\n\nIn total, the analysis estimates **8** backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2109.13808", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2404.06204", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2208.12095"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_fake_leptons", "hepkg:background:single_top", "hepkg:background:tWZ_tZ", "hepkg:background:ttH", "hepkg:background:ttV", "hepkg:background:w_jets", "hepkg:background:z_jets"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:25358edab1363d53868b0b7d", "hepkg:evidence:419760038037faf74c1a8e29", "hepkg:evidence:93591728cc17ffec1397db22", "hepkg:evidence:a79bb4f6e71c668bfb3f3240", "hepkg:evidence:af9ea90ce8e89eeb88b46734", "hepkg:evidence:afa54d8574a79f2948ec55fc", "hepkg:evidence:ec916ad8fd16d672f6931a17"], "seen_values": ["2208.12095", "and", "background", "bar", "channel", "diboson", "dilepton", "fake-lepton", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_fake_leptons", "hepkg:background:single_top", "hepkg:background:tth", "hepkg:background:ttv", "hepkg:background:twz_tz", "hepkg:background:w_jets", "hepkg:background:z_jets", "jets", "no