{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-c4c85cc3", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2207.12246 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2207.12246 estimates 2 backgrounds: Accidental coincidence background (halo+halo, halo+SD) and Double-Pomeron exchange (DPE) background.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.12246"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.12246"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:accidental_coincidence_background", "hepkg:background:dpe_background"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:581b376902603ccf9dfeb06d"], "seen_values": ["2207.12246", "accidental", "background", "coincidence", "double-pomeron", "dpe", "exchange", "halo", "hepkg:background:accidental_coincidence_background", "hepkg:background:dpe_background", "result_estimates_background"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 6989, "completion_tokens": 244, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 10.435698182322085, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 10.435698182322085, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7233.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 1.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-c4d45220", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2506.13565 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2506.13565 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}$ background\n- DY+jets background estimate in the SR\n- Nonprompt/jets-misidentified-as-leptons (\"Jets\") background\n- Other minor SM backgrounds (WZ, ZZ, VVV, tW, WW, SM Higgs)\n\nTherefore, the analysis estimates **4** backgrounds.\n\nHere is the evidence from the paper:\n\n- For the $t\\bar{t}$ background: \"The $t\\bar{t}$ background is estimated using a combination of data-driven techniques and simulation.\"\n- For the DY+jets background: \"The DY+jets background is estimated using a data-driven method based on the shape of the dilepton mass distribution in control regions.\"\n- For the Nonprompt/jets-misidentified-as-leptons (\"Jets\") background: \"The nonprompt/jets-misidentified-as-leptons background is estimated using a data-driven method based on the lepton identification efficiency.\"\n- For the Other minor SM backgrounds: \"The contributions from other minor SM backgrounds (WZ, ZZ, VVV, tW, WW, SM Higgs) are estimated using simulation.\"\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2211.08028", "2308.02285", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2506.13565"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:dyjets", "hepkg:background:jets-nonprompt", "hepkg:background:other-sm-minor", "hepkg:background:ttbar"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3ab2e04aa88c6fc98c30efe4", "hepkg:evidence:5fa719f6426c84b2bd