{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-c4f50016", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2009.14537 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2009.14537 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- **AFP beam optics uncertainty in \\(C_{\\text{AFP}}\\) (5%)**\n- **AFP global alignment uncertainty in \\(C_{\\text{AFP}}\\) (6%)**\n- **AFP proton resolution smearing correction uncertainty (\\(\\epsilon_{\\text{smear}}\\): ee 0.98±0.02, mumu 0.96±0.04)**\n- **AFP track and cluster reconstruction uncertainty in \\(C_{\\text{AFP}}\\) (<1%)**\n- **AFP track efficiency \\(\\xi_{\\text{AFP}}\\)-dependence uncertainty (2%)**\n- **AFP track reconstruction efficiency uncertainty (\\(\\epsilon_{\\text{track}} = 0.92±0.02\\))**\n- **Combinatorial background normalization statistical uncertainty from limited kinematic-mismatch data sample**\n- **Combinatorial background shape uncertainty from acoplanarity control-sample definition (14%)**\n- **Combinatorial background shape uncertainty from pileup (\\(\\mu\\)) dependence (8%)**\n- **Electron identification uncertainty in \\(C_{\\text{cent}}\\) (ee: 1%)**\n- **Integrated luminosity measurement uncertainty**\n- **Luminous-region modeling data/simulation correction uncertainty (5%)**\n- **Muon momentum resolution uncertainty in \\(C_{\\text{cent}}\\) (mumu: 3%)**\n- **Muon momentum scale uncertainty in \\(C_{\\text{cent}}\\) (mumu: 2%)**\n- **Overall \\(C_{\\text{AFP}}\\) correction factor uncertainty (9%)**\n- **Pileup modeling uncertainty in \\(C_{\\text{cent}}\\) (ee: 2%, mumu: 3%)**\n- **Theoretical prediction uncertainty for exclusive (7%) and single-dissociative (17%) processes**\n- **Trigger and isolation efficiency uncertainties in \\(C_{\\text{cent}}\\) (≤1%)**\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis 2009.1