{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-c523f4ad", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2302.05225 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2302.05225 measures the following observables:\n\n- Branching ratio \\( B(H \\to e \\tau) \\)\n- Branching ratio \\( B(H \\to \\mu \\tau) \\)\n- Branching ratio difference \\( B(H \\to \\mu \\tau) - B(H \\to e \\tau) \\)\n- Combined LFV Yukawa coupling \\( \\sqrt{|Y_{\\tau e}|^2 + |Y_{e \\tau}|^2} \\)\n- Combined LFV Yukawa coupling \\( \\sqrt{|Y_{\\tau \\mu}|^2 + |Y_{\\mu \\tau}|^2} \\)\n\nThese observables are related to the study of lepton flavor violation (LFV) in Higgs boson decays.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2302.05225"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2302.05225"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:br_diff_mutau_etau", "hepkg:observable:br_h_etau", "hepkg:observable:br_h_mutau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_e_tau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_mu_tau"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:05b735b2447c7d3e68a25e3c", "hepkg:evidence:0e9f1570b3c8a79f67267f18", "hepkg:evidence:1a8ac2956f823afd1d19bb50", "hepkg:evidence:25cb1c953837cf367e0c6111", "hepkg:evidence:b806dad7edc78c10de11326b", "hepkg:evidence:b9b0e6be5f2fd5f220714768", "hepkg:evidence:eab9d3439151afd57fd16f72", "hepkg:evidence:ee5713dd49e0ccbb8e45ef92"], "seen_values": ["2", "2302.05225", "branching", "combined", "coupling", "difference", "hepkg:observable:br_diff_mutau_etau", "hepkg:observable:br_h_etau", "hepkg:observable:br_h_mutau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_e_tau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_mu_tau", "lfv", "observable", "ratio", "result_measures_observable", "sqrt", "tau", "y_e", "y_mu", "y_tau", "yukawa"], "verification_sc