{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-c5f59f53", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2207.00348 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2207.00348 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- Electroweak vector boson fusion Higgs boson production (VBF)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a single top quark (tH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a top quark pair (ttH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a vector boson (VH)\n- WH associated production\n- ZH associated production (qq/qg→ZH, gg→ZH)\n- bbH production (Higgs boson production in association with a bb pair)\n- Gluon-gluon fusion (ggF) Higgs boson production\n- tHW production\n- tHqb production\n\nThese processes are explicitly mentioned in the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2207.00348 targets the following physics processes:\\n\\n- Electroweak vector boson fusion Higgs boson production (VBF)\\n- Higgs boson production in association with a single top quark (tH)\\n- Higgs boson production in association with a top quark pair (ttH)\\n- Higgs boson production in association with a vector boson (VH)\\n- WH associated production\\n- ZH associated production (qq/qg→ZH, gg→ZH)\\n- bbH production (Higgs boson production in association with a bb pair)\\n- Gluon-gluon fusion (ggF) Higgs boson production\\n- tHW production\\n- tHqb production\\n\\nThese processes are explicitly mentioned in the paper.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956", "2207.00348", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.00348"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "second