{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-c791f03c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2604.21670 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2604.21670 defines 18 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- At least one b-jet contained within the selected large-R jet, particle-level (ttbar boosted analysis).\n- Exactly two b-tagged jets with \\( p_T > 45 \\) GeV (leading) and \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV (subleading), reconstruction-level (HH→bbtautau signal regions).\n- Exactly two high-\\( p_T \\) isolated photons, with \\( E_T/m_{\\gamma\\gamma} > 0.35 \\) (leading) and \\( >0.25 \\) (subleading), reconstruction-level (HH→bbγγ signal region).\n\nFor a complete list, refer to the full set of selections provided by the analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2604.21670 defines 18 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\\n\\n- At least one b-jet contained within the selected large-R jet, particle-level (ttbar boosted analysis).\\n- Exactly two b-tagged jets with \\( p_T > 45 \\\\) GeV (leading) and \\( p_T > 20 \\\\) GeV (subleading), reconstruction-level (HH→bbtautau signal regions).\\n- Exactly two high-\\( p_T \\\\) isolated photons, with \\( E_T/m_{\\\\gamma\\\\gamma} > 0.35 \\\\) (leading) and \\( >0.25 \\\\) (subleading), reconstruction-level (HH→bbγγ signal region).\\n\\nFor a complete list, refer to the full set of selections provided by the analysis.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.21670"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0cc4ff85d