{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-ca0e9d9e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2103.06956 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2103.06956 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- **tHq leptonic analysis category**\n- **ttH hadronic category, 120 < p_T^H < 200 GeV**\n- **ttH hadronic category, 200 < p_T^H < 300 GeV**\n- **ttH hadronic category, 60 < p_T^H < 120 GeV**\n- **ttH hadronic category, p_T^H < 60 GeV**\n- **ttH hadronic category, p_T^H > 300 GeV**\n- **ttH leptonic category, 120 < p_T^H < 200 GeV**\n- **ttH leptonic category, 200 < p_T^H < 300 GeV**\n- **ttH leptonic category, 60 < p_T^H < 120 GeV**\n- **ttH leptonic category, p_T^H < 60 GeV**\n- **ttH leptonic category, p_T^H > 300 GeV**\n\nThese regions are part of the event categorization used in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.06956"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:thq_leptonic", "hepkg:region:tth_had_120_200", "hepkg:region:tth_had_200_300", "hepkg:region:tth_had_60_120", "hepkg:region:tth_had_pt_gt300", "hepkg:region:tth_had_pt_lt60", "hepkg:region:tth_lep_120_200", "hepkg:region:tth_lep_200_300", "hepkg:region:tth_lep_60_120", "hepkg:region:tth_lep_pt_gt300", "hepkg:region:tth_lep_pt_lt60"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:2ffabc7e6285a51771d2519b", "hepkg:evidence:3472936e21058e6c10a8c231", "hepkg:evidence:5fea5a03d0401cf5794fb8c3", "hepkg:evidence:6d293a860e2000d828bb98d4", "hepkg:evidence:b9e9f8fa831c465d21673537", "hepkg:evidence:c9e214635296e78f3cc3ae39"], "seen_values": ["12", "120", "2", "200", "2103.06956", "3", "300", "6", "60", "analysis", "category"