{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-cbf41ba0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2509.22535 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2509.22535 contains the following event regions:\n\n- **Analysis Region (AR)**: D_ttX > 0.6 with ttbar+light suppression cut\n- **Control Region (CR) enriched in ttbar+≥2b**: 0.6 < D_ttX < 0.85\n- **Control Region (CR) enriched in ttbar+≥2c**: 0.6 < D_ttX < 0.85\n- **Control Region (CR) enriched in ttbar+b**: 0.6 < D_ttX < 0.85\n- **Control Region (CR) enriched in ttbar+c**: 0.6 < D_ttX < 0.85\n- **Control Region (CR) enriched in ttbar+light**: 0.6 < D_ttX < 0.85\n- **Signal Region (SR) enriched in ttH(H→bb)**: D_ttX > 0.85\n- **Signal Region (SR) enriched in ttH(H→cc)**: D_ttX > 0.85\n- **Signal Region (SR) enriched in ttZ(Z→bb)**: D_ttX > 0.85\n- **Signal Region (SR) enriched in ttZ(Z→cc)**: D_ttX > 0.85\n- **Validation Region (VR) sideband**: 0.4 < D_ttX < 0.6\n\nThese regions are defined based on the discriminant D_ttX and the presence of different types of jets (b, c, light) in the event.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2509.22535"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2509.22535"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:AR", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_b", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_c", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_geq2b", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_geq2c", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_light", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hcc", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zcc", "hepkg:region:VR_sideband"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:98dfb8e74d911134a15d901a", "hepkg:evidence:ca99c405691ceba9f371168e"], "seen_values": ["0.4", "0.6", "0.85", "2", "2509.22535", "analysis", "channel_has_region", "control", "cut", "d_ttx", "enriched", "event_region", "hepkg:region:ar", "hepkg:region:cr_ttbar_b", "hepkg:region:cr_ttbar_c", "hepkg:region:cr_ttbar_geq2b", "hepkg:region:cr_ttbar_geq2c", "hepkg:region:cr_ttbar_light", "hepkg:region:sr_tth_hbb", "hepkg:region:sr_tth_hcc", "hepkg:region:sr_ttz_zbb", "hepkg:region:sr_ttz_zcc", "hepkg:region:vr_sideband", "light", "region", "sideband", "signal", "signal-depleted", "suppression", "ttbar", "tth", "ttz", "validation", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7666, "completion_tokens": 388, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 16.72406893922016, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 16.72406893922016, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8054.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 11.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 0.09090909090909091, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.9090909090909091, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 11.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
