{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-d07dd648", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2404.06204 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2404.06204 measures the following observables:\n\n- Compatibility (chi2/dof) between \\( p_T^Z \\) spectra measured via \\( p_T^{ll} \\) and via \\( u_T \\)\n- Differential fiducial cross section vs W-boson transverse momentum (\\( p_T^W \\))\n- Differential fiducial cross section vs Z-boson transverse momentum via dilepton \\( p_T^{ll} \\)\n- Differential fiducial cross section vs Z-boson transverse momentum via hadronic recoil \\( u_T \\) (validation)\n- Fiducial cross section extrapolated to the CMS fiducial phase-space definition\n- Integrated fiducial cross section for W-, W+ and Z production\n- Primary vertex reconstruction efficiency in W-boson events as a function of \\( p_T^W \\) and additional track multiplicity\n- Ratio of fiducial cross sections extrapolated to the CMS fiducial phase space\n- Ratio of integrated fiducial cross sections (between processes or between centre-of-mass energies)\n- Ratio of normalised W(+/-) to Z differential cross sections vs \\( p_T \\)\n- Ratio of normalised W+ to W- differential cross sections vs \\( p_T^W \\)\n- Ratio of normalised \\( p_T^V \\) spectra at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV to \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV\n- Ratio of total production cross sections via theoretical acceptance factors\n- Total (extrapolated) production cross section via theoretical acceptance factor\n\nThese observables are recorded in the analysis 2404.06204.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2404.06204"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2404.06204"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observa