{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-d362a08a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2404.06204 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2404.06204 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- Alternative signal generator (Sherpa vs Powheg+Pythia8) modelling uncertainty, propagated through recoil calibration closure and unfolding closure tests\n- Background estimation uncertainty (simulated background normalisation and multijet yield/shape)\n- Hadronic recoil scale and resolution calibration uncertainty\n- Integrated luminosity measurement uncertainty\n- Lepton energy/momentum scale, resolution and efficiency correction uncertainty\n- Primary vertex reconstruction efficiency modelling uncertainty (soft activity modelling at low W boson p_T)\n- Unfolding prior/assumed p_T^V spectrum uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2404.06204 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\\n\\n- Alternative signal generator (Sherpa vs Powheg+Pythia8) modelling uncertainty, propagated through recoil calibration closure and unfolding closure tests\\n- Background estimation uncertainty (simulated background normalisation and multijet yield/shape)\\n- Hadronic recoil scale and resolution calibration uncertainty\\n- Integrated luminosity measurement uncertainty\\n- Lepton energy/momentum scale, resolution and efficiency correction uncertainty\\n- Primary vertex reconstruction efficiency modelling uncertainty (soft activity modelling at low W boson p_T)\\n- Unfolding prior/assumed p_T^V spectrum uncertainty\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.14537", "2404.06204"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "to