{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-d596158a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many background-estimation methods does analysis 2304.08962 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2304.08962 uses three background-estimation methods: 1. Background modelled using MC simulation, 2. Branching-fraction-based normalization from J/ψ+ψ(2S) fitted yield (Eq. 1), 3. Data-driven fake-muon control-region method. This information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper: - For the first method: 'Background modelled using MC simulation' - For the second method: 'Branching-fraction-based normalization from J/ψ+ψ(2S) fitted yield (Eq. 1)' - For the third method: 'Data-driven fake-muon control-region method'", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873", "2304.08962", "2405.18661", "2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2304.08962"], "predicate": "background_uses_method"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:data_driven_fake_muon_cr", "hepkg:method:feeddown_normalization", "hepkg:method:mc_simulation"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1310a1c24cf7cff4576cbc1c", "hepkg:evidence:4d58a8da50e64514a58b82a1", "hepkg:evidence:d2fedf5c3eda522b8540152e", "hepkg:evidence:e3e8575fa9d6afbab1fe69fd", "hepkg:evidence:fdaf9d71a8dfe0750c982858"], "seen_values": ["1", "2", "2304.08962", "background", "background_method", "background_uses_method", "branching-fraction-based", "control-region", "data-driven", "fake-muon", "fitted", "from", "hepkg:method:data_driven_fake_muon_cr", "hepkg:method:feeddown_normalization", "hepkg:method:mc_simulation", "method", "modelled", "normalization", "psi", "simulation", "using", "yield"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 