{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-d87f5f19", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2504.13081 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2504.13081 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- Gluon fusion Higgs boson production (ggH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a top quark pair (ttH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a vector boson (VH)\n- Vector boson fusion (qqH)\n\nThese processes are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- For ggH: \"Gluon fusion Higgs boson production (ggH)\"\n- For ttH: \"Higgs boson production in association with a top quark pair (ttH)\"\n- For VH: \"Higgs boson production in association with a vector boson (VH)\"\n- For qqH: \"Vector boson fusion (qqH)\"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956", "2207.00348", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2504.13081"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.018}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:ggh", "hepkg:process:qqh", "hepkg:process:tth", "hepkg:process:vh"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:25b88539215b24276fb7995b"], "seen_values": ["2504.13081", "association", "boson", "fusion", "ggh", "gluon", "hepkg:process:ggh", "hepkg:process:qqh", "hepkg:process:tth", "hepkg:process:vh", "higgs", "pair", "physics_process", "production", "qqh", "quark", "result_targets_process", "top", "tth", "vector", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7106, "completion_tokens": 424, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 17.399244354106486, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 17.399244354106486, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7530.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained"