{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-d95430f3", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2106.14246 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2106.14246 targets 2 physics processes:\n\n1. Direct electroweak production of chargino (χ1±) and neutralino (χ2⁰) pairs.\n2. Effective χ1⁰χ1⁰ pair production via near-mass-degenerate Higgsino χ1±, χ2⁰, χ1⁰ in gauge-mediated SUSY breaking.\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"Direct electroweak production of chargino (χ1±) and neutralino (χ2⁰) pairs.\"\n- \"Effective χ1⁰χ1⁰ pair production via near-mass-degenerate Higgsino χ1±, χ2⁰, χ1⁰ in gauge-mediated SUSY breaking.\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2106.14246 targets 2 physics processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2106.14246"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2106.14246"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.016}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:chargino1_neutralino2_ew_production", "hepkg:process:effective_neutralino1_pair_production"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:7f2c7870ac1c8a4681b9f673", "hepkg:evidence:94db55f4ddaaa8932564fa17"], "seen_values": ["1", "2", "2106.14246", "and", "breaking", "chargino", "direct", "effective", "electroweak", "gauge-mediated", "hepkg:process:chargino1_neutralino2_ew_production", "hepkg:process:effective_neutralino1_pair_production", "higgsino", "near-mass-degenerate", "neutralino", "pair", "pairs", "physics_process", "production", "result_targets_process", "susy", "via"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7043, "completion_tokens": 483, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 19.66583339124918, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 19.66583339124918, "ll