{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-db96db42", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2004.14060 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2004.14060 does not explicitly state any targeted physics processes in the graph.", "answered": false, "papers": ["2106.01676"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["2004.14060"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 0, "error": "unknown_entity_id", "seconds": 0.0}, {"round": 2, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "2004.14060", "kind": "result"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.246}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:deviation-wh-dfos1"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "seconds": 0.003}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:result:deviation-wh-dfos1"]}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:deviation-wh-dfos1"], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": ["data", "excess", "hepkg:result:deviation-wh-dfos1", "result", "wh_dfos-1"], "verification_score": 0.0, "unsupported_claims": ["2004.14060"], "llm_calls": 4, "prompt_tokens": 14309, "completion_tokens": 164, "rounds": 4, "seconds": 7.573485052213073, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 7.573485052213073, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 14473.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 0.0, "abstained": 1.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 0.0, "unsupported_claims": 1.0, "count_correct": 0.0, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 1.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.3333333333333333, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 1.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-dbb2b4e1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2103.04956 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2103.04956 measures the following observables:\n\n- Differential fiducial cross section as a function of Higgs boson rapidity \\( |y^H| \\)\n- Differential fiducial cross section as a function of Higgs boson transverse momentum \\( p_T^H \\)\n- Differential fiducial cross section as a function of leading jet transverse momentum \\( p_T^{\\text{jet}} \\)\n- Differential fiducial cross section as a function of the number of associated jets \\( N^{\\text{jet}} \\)\n- Fiducial cross section by final state (2e2μ, 4μ, 4e) and data-taking year\n- Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier \\( \\mu = \\frac{\\sigma \\times B(H \\to \\gamma\\gamma)}{(\\sigma \\times B)_{\\text{SM}}} \\)\n- Inclusive fiducial cross section \\( \\sigma_{\\text{fid}}(pp \\to H \\to 4\\ell) \\)\n- Merged STXS stage 1.2 production-bin cross section times branching fraction \\( \\sigma B \\) for \\( H \\to ZZ \\) decay\n- Profiled Higgs boson mass \\( m_H \\) from signal-strength fit\n- STXS stage 0 production-bin cross section times branching fraction \\( \\sigma B \\) for \\( H \\to ZZ \\) decay\n- Signal strength modifiers by Higgs production mode (ggH+bbH, VBF, WH, ZH, ttH+tH)\n- Signal strength modifiers for fermion- and vector-boson-induced production \\( \\mu_f, \\mu_V \\)\n\nThese observables are recorded in the analysis 2103.04956.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.04956", "2103.06956"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.04956"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_njet", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_jet", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "hepkg:observable:fiducial_xsec_by_finalstate_year", "hepkg:observable:fiducial_xsec_inclusive", "hepkg:observable:higgs_mass_profiled", "hepkg:observable:mu_by_production_mode", "hepkg:observable:mu_fermion_vector", "hepkg:observable:mu_inclusive", "hepkg:observable:stxs_stage0_xsec", "hepkg:observable:stxs_stage12_xsec"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:048dc53c0c219c635581115f", "hepkg:evidence:10ae95d2fcb342a9cb48cb6a", "hepkg:evidence:17ce0f6c1cd819a88f394e29", "hepkg:evidence:3d07be4fc99b644481d7dea4", "hepkg:evidence:6f79241d924bf14b472df59f", "hepkg:evidence:822fd9d7d024bb1c338916d3", "hepkg:evidence:96b48905ba267b3496d9272b", "hepkg:evidence:a77303f7b20e745f7156dd21", "hepkg:evidence:cb61d4ef309219b0e6a04b47", "hepkg:evidence:e21ef2880f222895be1ac0e7"], "seen_values": ["0", "1.2", "2", "2103.04956", "4", "_fid", "_sm", "and", "associated", "bbh", "boson", "branching", "cross", "data-taking", "decay", "differential", "fermion-", "fiducial", "final", "fit", "for", "fraction", "from", "function", "ggh", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_njet", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_jet", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "hepkg:observable:fiducial_xsec_by_finalstate_year", "hepkg:observable:fiducial_xsec_inclusive", "hepkg:observable:higgs_mass_profiled", "hepkg:observable:mu_by_production_mode", "hepkg:observable:mu_fermion_vector", "hepkg:observable:mu_inclusive", "hepkg:observable:stxs_stage0_xsec", "hepkg:observable:stxs_stage12_xsec", "higgs", "inclusive", "jet", "jets", "leading", "mass", "merged", "mode", "modifier", "modifiers", "momentum", "number", "observable", "production", "production-bin", "profiled", "rapidity", "result_measures_observable", "section", "signal", "signal-strength", "stage", "state", "strength", "stxs", "times", "transverse", "tth", "vbf", "vector-boson-induced", "year"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "ll