{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-dc89ef43", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2010.14293 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2010.14293 measures the following observables:\n\n- 95% CL lower limit on gluino mass as a function of neutralino mass\n- 95% CL lower limit on squark mass as a function of neutralino mass\n- 95% CL observed/expected upper limit on the number of BSM signal events (S_obs^95, S_exp^95)\n- 95% CL upper limit on the visible cross-section of BSM physics (⟨εσ⟩_obs^95)\n- Data vs. background significance in validation regions\n- Observed and background-only-fit expected event yields in signal regions\n- One-sided p-value (p0) / significance (Z) of the background-only hypothesis per signal region\n\nThese observables are recorded in the paper with the arXiv ID 2010.14293.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2010.14293", "2102.01444", "2307.01094", "2403.01556"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2010.14293"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:gluino-mass-lower-limit", "hepkg:observable:p0-significance", "hepkg:observable:signal-event-ul", "hepkg:observable:squark-mass-lower-limit", "hepkg:observable:sr-event-yield", "hepkg:observable:visible-cross-section-ul", "hepkg:observable:vr-significance"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0c48a269012d4af0a0ff1a4d", "hepkg:evidence:13be1ddca684fa3932883706", "hepkg:evidence:2f59947253227af15ef986cb", "hepkg:evidence:50926217bf0dcce4903c4419", "hepkg:evidence:584943b773d871ac40bad9fd", "hepkg:evidence:6bbc27edaefba669d081c9c0", "hepkg:evidence:d2d25d57bb2cf051645284f9", "hepkg:evidence:dae1fce2a56a4ee0bad943b9"], "seen_values": ["0", "2010.14293", "95", "_obs", "and"