{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-dce0809d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2511.11853 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2511.11853 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}$ background\n- Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background\n- Drell-Yan + jets background\n- Single top quark background\n\nTherefore, the analysis estimates **4** backgrounds.\n\nThis information is supported by the following entries in the graph:\n- $t\\bar{t}$ background: \"result_estimates_background -> $t\\bar{t}$ background\"\n- Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background: \"result_estimates_background -> Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background\"\n- Drell-Yan + jets background: \"result_estimates_background -> Drell-Yan + jets background\"\n- Single top quark background: \"result_estimates_background -> Single top quark background\"\n\nWould you like to see the exact sentences from the paper that support these claims?\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2511.11853 estimates the following backgrounds:\\n\\n- $t\\\\bar{t}$ background\\n- Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background\\n- Drell-Yan + jets background\\n- Single top quark background\\n\\nTherefore, the analysis estimates **4** backgrounds.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2308.02285", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2511.11853"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diboson_vv", "hepkg:background:dy_jets", "hepkg:background:single_top", "hepkg:background:ttbar"], "evid