{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-dec61c88", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2302.05225 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2302.05225 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}H$ simulated sample\n- Additional V+jets (QCD/EW) simulation sample used by the Symmetry method (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\n- Diboson ($WW$, $ZZ$, $WZ$) MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1/2.2.2)\n- Single-top simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\n- V+jets (QCD/EW) simulation sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\n- VBF Higgs boson production simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\n- VH Higgs boson production simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\n- gg F Higgs boson production simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\n- ttbar POWHEG 2.0 NNLO background MC sample\n\nThese samples are used in various parts of the analysis to simulate different processes and backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.04956", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2503.19420"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2302.05225"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson_sherpa", "hepkg:sample:ggf_higgs", "hepkg:sample:singletop_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_powheg", "hepkg:sample:tth", "hepkg:sample:vbf_higgs", "hepkg:sample:vh_higgs", "hepkg:sample:vjets_powheg_symmetry", "hepkg:sample:vjets_sherpa"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:363ad5d4cd22e96f4d08f0a5", "hepkg:evidence:587791fcefe473eba73c0a1e", "hepkg:evidence:958a5ad26e354c02fa1dd150", "hepkg:evidence:9be4adeac55ec98f978ca08f", "hepkg:evidence:a0f653506acd31ed5613c986", "hepkg:evidence:e37fe11a0fe6d286430f4ca0"], "seen_values": ["2", "2.0", "2.2.1", "2.2.2", "2302.05225", "8", "additional", "backgro