{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e08f53c8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2112.00895 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2112.00895 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- $W$ boson candidate\n- Charm quark (parton-level, fiducial phase-space definition)\n- Displaced secondary vertex inside jet from charm hadron decay (SV channel signature)\n- Electron from W boson decay\n- Jet\n- Lepton (electron or muon) from W boson decay\n- Missing transverse momentum\n- Muon from W boson decay\n- Muon inside c jet from semileptonic charm hadron decay (SL channel signature)\n- Second isolated lepton (veto object)\n\nThese objects are used in the analysis to reconstruct and identify various particles and their interactions.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2112.00895"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:c_quark_parton", "hepkg:object:electron_w", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:lepton_w", "hepkg:object:missing_transverse_momentum", "hepkg:object:muon_in_jet", "hepkg:object:muon_w", "hepkg:object:second_lepton_veto", "hepkg:object:secondary_verte