{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e099fd39", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2103.04956 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2103.04956 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- 105 < m4l < 140 GeV signal mass window\n- Baseline H->4l ZZ-candidate selection (reconstruction level)\n- H->4l fiducial phase space (particle level)\n- Untagged reconstructed event category\n- VBF-1jet-tagged reconstructed event category\n- VBF-2jet-tagged reconstructed event category\n- VH-hadronic-tagged reconstructed event category\n- VH-leptonic-tagged reconstructed event category\n- ttH-hadronic-tagged reconstructed event category\n- ttH-leptonic-tagged reconstructed event category\n\nThese regions define the different categories and selections applied in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.04956", "2112.00895"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.04956"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:baseline_4l_selection", "hepkg:region:cat_tth_hadronic_tagged", "hepkg:region:cat_tth_leptonic_tagged", "hepkg:region:cat_untagged", "hepkg:region:cat_vbf_1jet_tagged", "hepkg:region:cat_vbf_2jet_tagged", "hepkg:region:cat_vh_hadronic_tagged", "hepkg:region:cat_vh_leptonic_tagged", "hepkg:region:fiducial_phase_space", "hepkg:region:mass_window_105_140"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:03eb6149d9ea0ad6350f1e35", "hepkg:evidence:0c4218e7d995b9cd83af7057", "hepkg:evidence:3d5eb87209e8ee364260c6fd", "hepkg:evidence:6220612b872aecf8a3cfb966", "hepkg:evidence:979ec46c159472d00f161923", "hepkg:evidence:a8f9574433920aae9923bbfb", "hepkg:evidence:c29533ec91620a2b4095b866", "hepkg:evidence:c31573fe9a7445c1659914e7", "