{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e1112bd2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2110.11231 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2110.11231 defines 8 region selection requirements:\n\n- Fourth-lepton veto inverted (required) and \\( p_T^{miss} \\) requirement dropped relative to SR; remaining SR criteria applied\n- \\( M(lZ1, lZ2, lW) < 100 \\) GeV\n- \\( M(lZ1, lZ2, lW) > 100 \\) GeV\n- b-tagged jet veto inverted; all other SR requirements (lepton \\( p_T \\), Z mass window, \\( p_T^{miss} > 30 \\) GeV, \\( \\min(M(ll')) > 4 \\) GeV, \\( M(lZ1, lZ2, lW) > 100 \\) GeV) kept as in SR\n- \\( \\min(M(l, l')) > 4 \\) GeV\n- \\( p_T(lZ1) > 25 \\) GeV, \\( p_T(lZ2) > 10 \\) GeV, \\( p_T(lW) > 25 \\) GeV\n- \\( p_T^{miss} \\leq 30 \\) GeV\n- \\( |M(lZ1, lZ2) - m_Z| < 15 \\) GeV requirement removed\n\nThese requirements are detailed in the paper and are used to define the regions for the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2110.11231 defines 8 region selection requirements. These include criteria such as the fourth-lepton veto, \\( p_T^{miss} \\) requirements, and various mass and transverse momentum cuts.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2110.11231"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.056}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:24cb997b3a0150b8e40243ec", "hepkg:evidence:255d59f1513fc46e7a59ff2a", "hepkg:evidence:2bb7f7dcf009a04a0326bdec", "hepkg:evidence:448a5d3fa5c7476586fcf03a", "hepkg:evidence:59a63458d2af27c365dd2db8", "hepkg:evidence:addf98cf011880c582123576", "hepkg:evidence:c4865bbd0b6c028de67b1ab1", "hepkg:evidence:e565270700ea89a643e133d5"], "seen_values": ["-mz", "1", "10", "100", "15", "2110.11231", "25", "3", "30", "4", "all", "and", "applied", "b-tagged", "criteria", "dropped", "fourth-lepton", "gev", "inverted", "jet", "kept", "lepton", "lz1", "lz2", "mass", "min", "miss", "none", "other", "region_has_selection", "relative", "remaining", "removed", "required", "requirement", "requirements", "veto", "window"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7372, "completion_tokens": 420, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 17.53891238104552, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 17.53891238104552, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7792.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 0.0, "evidence_quotes": 8.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e15e0642", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2303.15340 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2303.15340 defines 23 object selection requirements. Here are the details:\n\n- 70% average b-tagging efficiency working point (MV2c10)\n- JVT requirement for pT < 120 GeV and |eta| < 2.4\n- Dressed with radiated photons within ΔR=0.1 after final-state radiation\n- Event contains exactly one electron\n- Event contains exactly one muon\n- Exactly one or exactly two b-tagged jets in the event\n- Isolation requirement (90% efficiency at pT=25 GeV for Z->ee)\n- Leading/sub-leading lepton pT > 27 (25) GeV in the fiducial eμ selection\n- Leading/sub-leading lepton pT > 27 (25) GeV, |eta| < 2.5 at particle level\n- pT > 25 GeV and |eta| < 2.5\n- pT > 25 GeV\n- Reject electrons in 0.2<ΔR<0.4 of any remaining jet\n- Reject if sharing a track with a muon candidate (electron-muon overlap removal)\n- Reject jets with fewer than three tracks within ΔR=0.2 of a muon candidate\n- Reject jets within ΔR=0.2 of an electron\n- Reject muons within ΔR=0.4 of any remaining jet\n- Removed if overlapping with particle jets within ΔR<0.4\n- Tight identification\n- |d0|/sigma_d0 < 3 and |z0 sin(theta)| < 0.5 mm\n- |d0|/sigma_d0 < 5\n- |eta| < 1.37 or 1.52 < |eta| < 2.47\n- |eta| < 2.5, medium identification, isolation ~85%-98% efficiency\n- |z0 sin(theta)| < 0.5 mm\n\nThese requirements are documented in the paper 2303.15340.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2303.15340 defines 23 object selection requirements.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2303.15340"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 23, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:15e6e9eab40917c5fecbc196", "hepkg:evidence:15f933efda0bfc6bf9936ef2", "hepkg:evidence:1c4aa6a4ba1aec71f4db2b25", "hepkg:evidence:2006ad304d86899796a7eeb9", "hepkg:evidence:22512ed836138111952a98eb", "hepkg:evidence:291b2a85bcffe9bd995aa83e", "hepkg:evidence:2ccb9cefa3a405a49375732b", "hepkg:evidence:4e8f536592e808ba82a9b8cb", "hepkg:evidence:52cd93f54948c7325fbf1ca4", "hepkg:evidence:52f1fdd665bd0a1ebbcfc1a3", "hepkg:evidence:53830ebf589f42f4167301b5", "hepkg:evidence:5cd76649383c753f218eb327", "hepkg:evidence:795a064f5b9841384a582126", "hepkg:evidence:9142763883a2eccc699d3f03", "hepkg:evidence:95936eec157a5f2ccc1030f9", "hepkg:evidence:afb27e52e7c4971ccad4bfee", "hepkg:evidence:c1e011017a11550cf5c17d7d", "hepkg:evidence:c57509fe097928a7caa23740", "hepkg:evidence:c639dc091159a12c8cc7d4c0", "hepkg:evidence:cd86b0ec65c00586f330a3c9", "hepkg:evidence:f499dba620ef7aae5cd55228"], "seen_values": ["-98", "0", "0.1", "0.2", "0.4", "0.5", "1.37", "1.52", "12", "120", "2.4", "2.47", "2.5", "2303.1534", "2303.15340", "25", "27", "3", "5", "7", "70", "85", "9", "90", "after", "and", "any", "average", "b-tagged", "b-tagging", "candidate", "contains", "dressed", "efficiency", "electron", "electron-muon", "electrons", "eta", "event", "exactly", "fewer", "fiducial", "final-state", "for", "gev", "identification", "isolation", "jet", "jets", "jvt", "leading", "lepton", "level", "medium", "muon", "muons", "mv2c10", "none", "object_has_selection", "one", "overlap", "overlapping", "particle", "photons", "point", "radiated", "radiation", "reject", "remaining", "removal", "removed", "requirement", "selection", "sharing", "sigma_d0", "sin", "sub-leading", "than", "the", "theta", "three", "tight", "track", "tracks", "two", "with", "within", "working"], "verification_score": 0.8888888888888888, "unsupported_claims": ["23", "98"], "llm_calls"