{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e1ba4c2b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2106.01676 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2106.01676 uses 15 simulated samples:\n\n- $Z/\\gamma^{*}$ (Z+jets) simulated sample\n- $t\\bar{t}$ simulated sample\n- Diboson (VV) background sample (WW, ZZ, WZ, WH, ZH incl. Higgs to diboson)\n- Higgs (VBF) MC sample\n- Higgs (Vh) MC sample\n- Higgs (ggF) MC sample\n- Single top quark (ST) background sample (s-channel, t-channel, tW-associated)\n- Triboson (VVV) background sample\n- Triboson (alternative, with off-shell h->VV) MC sample\n- chi1(pm) chi2(0) SUSY signal MC sample\n- tW MC sample\n- ttbar h MC sample\n- ttbar-ll (t->Wb+(gamma*/Z->ll)) MC sample\n- ttbarV, tZ, tWZ MC sample\n- ttbarVV, 3-top, 4-top MC sample\n\nThese samples are used in various parts of the analysis to simulate different processes and backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2402.08486", "2503.19420", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2106.01676"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson", "hepkg:sample:higgs-ggf", "hepkg:sample:higgs-vbf", "hepkg:sample:higgs-vh", "hepkg:sample:signal-c1c2", "hepkg:sample:single-top", "hepkg:sample:triboson", "hepkg:sample:triboson-alt", "hepkg:sample:ttbar", "hepkg:sample:ttbarh", "hepkg:sample:ttbarll", "hepkg:sample:ttbarv-tz-twz", "hepkg:sample:ttbarvv-3top-4top", "hepkg:sample:tw", "hepkg:sample:zjets"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1a95f200aba7d5e7450d29a4", "hepkg:evidence:245a2d392322cd84654019e3", "hepkg:evidence:44ea2fc35989bad24b6d6461", "hepkg:evidence:58ecc63edce454