{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e37a60f5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2511.11853 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2511.11853 uses two simulated samples:\n\n1. Simulated background samples (DY+jets, ttbar, single top, VV)\n2. Z' signal MC samples (m_Z' = 125-350 GeV, delta_bs = 0.04/0.5/1.0)\n\nThese are the samples that the analysis employs for its simulations.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2511.11853"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:background_simulation_mc", "hepkg:sample:zprime_signal_mc"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1e1bd37ed30a9bd3a41ffb46", "hepkg:evidence:b0c27d4e3adee3a2f49a2a4b"], "seen_values": ["-350", "0.04", "0.5", "1", "1.0", "125", "2511.11853", "background", "delta_bs", "gev", "hepkg:sample:background_simulation_mc", "hepkg:sample:zprime_signal_mc", "jets", "m_z", "result_uses_sample", "sample", "samples", "signal", "simulated", "single", "top", "ttbar"], "verification_score": 0.8333333333333334, "unsupported_claims": ["350"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7020, "completion_tokens": 258, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 10.97512287972495, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 10.97512287972495, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7278.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 0.8333333333333334, "unsupported_claims": 1.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e37afe2a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2106.01676 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2106.01676 targets 3 physics processes:\n\n1. **chi1(pm) chi2(0) pair production, Wh-mediated decay to two chi1(0) LSPs, 3-lepton final state**\n2. **chi1(pm) chi2(0) pair production, off-shell W*Z*-mediated decay to two chi1(0) LSPs, 3-lepton final state**\n3. **chi1(pm) chi2(0) pair production, on-shell WZ-mediated decay to two chi1(0) LSPs, 3-lepton final state**\n\nThese processes are recorded in the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2106.01676"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2106.01676"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.017}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:c1c2-Wh-3l", "hepkg:process:c1c2-offshellWZ-3l", "hepkg:process:c1c2-onshellWZ-3l"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:42444cc6d859a4a60417b03b", "hepkg:evidence:7f16a84ba10ce6c38a6dfed4", "hepkg:evidence:821e883d9439fa0d566061dd", "hepkg:evidence:946ae236e2e9f8e7eb886f0f", "hepkg:evidence:b6af06b694789ac23bd665f3", "hepkg:evidence:b9a5109df1af09c3e3c3b265", "hepkg:evidence:dd882fb384b2f33be977a81d"], "seen_values": ["-lepton", "-mediated", "0", "2106.01676", "3", "chi1", "chi2", "decay", "final", "hepkg:process:c1c2-offshellwz-3l", "hepkg:process:c1c2-onshellwz-3l", "hepkg:process:c1c2-wh-3l", "lsps", "off-shell", "on-shell", "pair", "physics_process", "production", "result_targets_process", "state", "two", "wh-mediated", "wz-mediated"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7138, "completion_tokens": 183, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 8.17291786102578, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 8.17291786102578, "llm_calls":