{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e3fa82ba", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects does analysis 2309.14442 define?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2309.14442 defines the following detector objects:\n\n- **Additional b jet, particle level (b jet not originating from top quark decay)**\n- **Jet, detector level (anti-kT R=0.4, PF)**\n- **Jet, particle level (anti-kT R=0.4, excluding neutrinos)**\n- **Light jet, particle level (not matched to b hadron)**\n- **Light-tagged jet, detector level (fails DeepJet medium WP)**\n- **Particle-level (dressed) electron**\n- **Particle-level (dressed) muon**\n- **Primary (signal) electron, detector level**\n- **Primary (signal) muon, detector level**\n- **Veto electron, detector level**\n- **Veto electron, particle level**\n- **Veto muon, detector level**\n- **Veto muon, particle level**\n- **b jet, particle level (matched to b hadron)**\n- **b-tagged jet, detector level, DeepJet medium working point**\n- **b-tagged jet, detector level, DeepJet tight working point**\n\nThese definitions are based on the content of the paper 2309.14442.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2402.08486"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2309.14442"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:additional_bjet_particle", "hepkg:object:bjet_medium_detector", "hepkg:object:bjet_particle", "hepkg:object:bjet_tight_detector", "hepkg:object:electron_particle", "hepkg:object:electron_signal_detector", "hepkg:object:electron_veto_detector", "hepkg:object:electron_veto_particle", "hepkg:object:jet_detector", "hepkg:object:jet_particle", "hepkg:object:lightjet_medium_detector", "hepkg:object:lightjet_particle", "hepkg:obje