{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e5b10f0c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2106.01676 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2106.01676 defines 22 region selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \\( E_T^{\\text{miss}} < 40 \\, \\text{GeV} \\) and \\( m_T < 30 \\, \\text{GeV} \\) to reject WZ\n- \\( E_T^{\\text{miss}} > 50 \\, \\text{GeV} \\)\n- \\( E_T^{\\text{miss}} \\) significance > 8\n- SFOS lepton-pair invariant mass \\( m_{ll} > 12 \\, \\text{GeV} \\) (low-mass resonance veto)\n- Z-boson candidate mass within 15 GeV of \\( m_Z \\)\n- \\( m_{3l} \\) lower bound to reduce WZ contamination\n- \\( m_T \\) window around Jacobian peak, [60,90] GeV\n- \\( m_{ll} \\leq 75 \\, \\text{GeV} \\) or \\( m_{ll} \\geq 105 \\, \\text{GeV} \\) (below/above Z window)\n- \\( m_{ll} \\) in [75,105] GeV Z-boson mass window\n- \\( m_{ll}^{\\text{min}} > 1 \\, \\text{GeV} \\) (collimated-lepton veto)\n- \\( n_{\\text{jets}} < 3 \\)\n- On-shell Z boson, \\( m_{ll} \\) in [81,101] GeV\n- \\( p_T(\\text{third lepton}) > 10 \\, \\text{GeV} \\) and \\( E_T^{\\text{miss}} > 50 \\, \\text{GeV} \\)\n- Targets low-mass wino/bino (+) chargino-neutralino production\n- \\( |m_{3l} - m_Z| > 15 \\, \\text{GeV} \\)\n- \\( |m_{ll} - m_Z| < 15 \\, \\text{GeV} \\)\n\nThese requirements help define the regions used in the analysis to optimize the signal-to-background ratio and target specific physics processes.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2106.01676"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.066}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0a12e41f5d351643c08eb08c", "hepkg:evidence:1cd2e6dc73c9249fa83c7f82", "hepkg:evidence