{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e68f8165", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2102.01444 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2102.01444 defines 22 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \"77% b-tagging efficiency working point (in simulated ttbar events)\"\n- \"Calorimeter isolation: sum ET in cone dR_eta=0.2 around electron, upper limit\"\n- \"Calorimeter isolation: sum ET in cone dR_eta=0.2 around muon < 30% of muon pT\"\n- \"ETmiss significance = |p_T^miss| / sqrt(sigma_L^2 (1-rho_LT^2))\"\n- \"E_T > 4.5 GeV\"\n- \"Jet vertex tagger (JVT) pile-up rejection for |eta|<=2.5 and pT<120 GeV\"\n- \"Loose likelihood-based identification, with additional B-layer hit condition\"\n- \"MV2C10 boosted decision tree b-tagging algorithm\"\n- \"Medium identification requirement\"\n- \"Medium likelihood-based identification requirement\"\n- \"Negative vector sum of transverse momenta of baseline electrons, photons, muons and jets, plus low-momentum tracks from primary vertex\"\n- \"Track isolation: scalar sum pT in cone dR_eta=0.3 around muon < 15% of muon pT\"\n- \"Track isolation: scalar sum pT of tracks in cone dR_eta=0.2 around electron\"\n- \"anti-kt clustering algorithm, R=0.4\"\n- \"pT > 20 GeV\"\n- \"pT > 4 GeV\"\n- \"|d0|/sigma(d0) < 3\"\n- \"|d0|/sigma(d0) < 5\"\n- \"|eta| < 2.4\"\n- \"|eta| < 2.47\"\n- \"|eta| < 2.7\"\n- \"|eta| < 2.8\"\n- \"|z0 sin(theta)| < 0.5 mm from the primary vertex\"\n- \"|z0 sin(theta)| < 0.5 mm\"\n\nThese selections are detailed in the paper and are used to define the objects used in the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2102.01444 defines 22 object selection requirements.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2102.01444"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:170690228dd34130cffd6111", "hepkg:evidence:1d754bda7345512a803f5e97", "hepkg:evidence:21cb7e0faddc47e1d23545db", "hepkg:evidence:21d9eb6e298dac4463068731", "hepkg:evidence:2289522db69b7c438549933f", "hepkg:evidence:281161d3fd4e097741b83f91", "hepkg:evidence:2b1929ced728d3a3a575ddab", "hepkg:evidence:336da887e33e96274f0448ac", "hepkg:evidence:3675ba64b38dfe47f6c70318", "hepkg:evidence:38196ddfb2dee97d8e2b31a3", "hepkg:evidence:41accad94ae0dde37c682beb", "hepkg:evidence:59f4fe98f01f69a5032b82cc", "hepkg:evidence:5bd0553265a9cfdd3ea727c6", "hepkg:evidence:6cbc17894568fcb0f974fd36", "hepkg:evidence:6f52cf493d0d87d4f10f2ee6", "hepkg:evidence:7c6cfdd01e6cf612aee0e152", "hepkg:evidence:7edce247d28eb691ebbcdd76", "hepkg:evidence:7f07b25b71c39882bb8b2a81", "hepkg:evidence:9b47b5404fa23d8166f6cf84", "hepkg:evidence:a478c6db10305f80956362c4", "hepkg:evidence:b0c18ad18135cfa049f3642f", "hepkg:evidence:b51301a67c72242acf2d6854", "hepkg:evidence:b8751280d3c70817a529a979", "hepkg:evidence:d22594575d60b81a3b882a6c", "hepkg:evidence:db445a3ae76faafb644b3cc9"], "seen_values": ["-rho_lt", "0", "0.2", "0.3", "0.4", "0.5", "1", "12", "120", "15", "2", "2.4", "2.47", "2.5", "2.7", "2.8", "20", "2102.01444", "3", "30", "4", "4.5", "5", "77", "additional", "algorithm", "and", "anti-kt", "around", "b-layer", "b-tagging", "baseline", "boosted", "calorimeter", "clustering", "condition", "cone", "decision", "dr_eta", "e_t", "efficiency", "electron", "electrons", "eta", "etmiss", "events", "for", "from", "gev", "hit", "identification", "isolation", "jet", "jets", "jvt", "likelihood-based", "limit", "loose", "low-momentum", "medium", "miss", "momenta", "muon", "muons", "mv2c10", "negative", "none", "object_has_selection", "p_