{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e75fe17d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which statistical methods does analysis 2010.14293 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2010.14293 uses the following statistical methods:\n\n- Asymptotic formulae for fit result evaluation\n- Background-only fit (CRs only, no signal, floating WZ normalisation)\n- CLs prescription for 95% CL exclusion limits\n- Model-dependent fit (signal yield and CR signal contamination included)\n- Model-independent fit (BSM signal-strength parameter in SR, background from CRs) for visible cross-section limits\n- Profile likelihood method for computing local significance / p0\n- Pseudo-experiment-based calculation of limits and discovery p-values\n\nThese methods are recorded in the graph as being used in this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2106.01676", "2211.08028", "2407.10549"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2010.14293"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:asymptotic-formulae", "hepkg:method:background-only-fit", "hepkg:method:cls-prescription", "hepkg:method:model-dependent-fit", "hepkg:method:model-independent-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-significance", "hepkg:method:pseudo-experiments"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:40df7ad4a45e1b5f435c1f39", "hepkg:evidence:64393c7c8866731604cec199", "hepkg:evidence:6bbc27edaefba669d081c9c0", "hepkg:evidence:6be1268f8b766126be2a36d9", "hepkg:evidence:a4da8843a1f07300d63d7028", "hepkg:evidence:ec7fbb83a4dfe8aa0762e7ab"], "seen_values": ["0", "2010.14293", "95", "and", "asymptotic", "background", "background-only", "bsm", "calculation", "cls", "computing", "contamination", "cross-se