{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e8acae78", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which statistical methods does analysis 2106.14246 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2106.14246 uses the following statistical methods:\n\n- Asymptotic approximation of the profile likelihood ratio test statistic\n- Barlow-Beeston approach for MC statistical uncertainties in the likelihood\n- CLs criterion for 95% CL upper limits\n- Log-normal nuisance parameters for normalization-only systematic uncertainties\n- Template morphing technique for shape+normalization nuisance parameters (Gaussian pdf)\n\nThese methods are documented in the graph based on the content of the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2106.14246", "2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2106.14246"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:statmethod:asymptotic_profile_likelihood", "hepkg:statmethod:barlow_beeston", "hepkg:statmethod:cls_criterion", "hepkg:statmethod:lognormal_nuisance", "hepkg:statmethod:template_morphing"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:6cb6e501c0233a7d7466aed0", "hepkg:evidence:ce5b517539566c8ea450aa29", "hepkg:evidence:ddfc2b4b0ba3ba821aaf102a"], "seen_values": ["2106.14246", "95", "approach", "approximation", "asymptotic", "barlow-beeston", "cls", "criterion", "for", "gaussian", "hepkg:statmethod:asymptotic_profile_likelihood", "hepkg:statmethod:barlow_beeston", "hepkg:statmethod:cls_criterion", "hepkg:statmethod:lognormal_nuisance", "hepkg:statmethod:template_morphing", "likelihood", "limits", "log-normal", "morphing", "normalization", "normalization-only", "nuisance", "parameters", "pdf", "profile", "ratio", "result_uses_statistical_method", "shape", "statistic", "statistical", "statistical_method", "systematic", "technique", "template", "test", "the", "uncertainties", "upper"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7214, "completion_tokens": 283, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 12.244446069933474, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 12.244446069933474, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7497.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 5.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 1.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 5.0, "evidence_quotes": 3.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-e8fa5629", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many background-estimation methods does analysis 2308.02285 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2308.02285 uses six background-estimation methods:\n\n1. Background contributions evaluated with simulations validated in data control samples.\n2. Normalization of \\(t\\bar{t}\\) and \\(Z+\\)jets backgrounds derived from dedicated data control samples.\n3. QCD multijet background estimated using dedicated QCD multijet simulation.\n4. QCD multijet background estimated via data control regions with inverted transverse-mass and isolation requirements.\n5. Single top background normalization fixed using the tail of the corrected SV mass distribution in data.\n6. \\(W+\\)jets simulation normalized so total predicted yield matches data after \\(Z+\\)jets and \\(t\\bar{t}\\) normalization.\n\nThese methods are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"Background contributions evaluated with simulations validated in data control samples.\"\n- \"Normalization of \\(t\\bar{t}\\) and \\(Z+\\)jets backgrounds derived from dedicated data control samples.\"\n- \"QCD multijet background estimated using dedicated QCD multijet simulation.\"\n- \"QCD multijet background estimated via data control regions with inverted transverse-mass and isolation requirements.\"\n- \"Single top background normalization fixed using the tail of the corrected SV mass distribution in data.\"\n- \"W+jets simulation normalized so total predicted yield matches data after \\(Z+\\)jets and \\(t\\bar{t}\\) normalization.\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2308.02285 uses **six** background-estimation methods.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2308.02285 uses six background-estimation methods. These methods are: 1. Background contributions evaluated with simulations validated in data control samples. 2. Normalization of \\(t\\\\bar{t}\\) and \\(Z+\\)jets backgrounds derived from dedicated data control samples. 3. QCD multijet background estimated using dedicated QCD multijet simulation. 4. QCD multijet background estimated via data control regions with inverted transverse-mass and isolation requirements. 5. Single top background normalization fixed using the tail of the corrected SV mass distribution in data. 6. \\(W+\\)jets simulation normalized so total predicted yield matches data after \\(Z+\\)jets and \\(t\\\\bar{t}\\) normalization.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2308.02285"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2308.02285"], "predicate": "background_uses_method"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background_method:data-control-sample-normalization", "hepkg:background_method:mc-simulation-validated-control-samples", "hepkg:background_method:qcd-multijet-control-region-method", "hepkg:background_method:qcd-multijet-simulation-method", "hepkg:background_method:singletop-svmass-tail-normalization", "hepkg:background_method:wjets-total-yield-normalization"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:27bf77505662f367e0639a6c", "hepkg:evidence:47918ae7a87948bdc1035db2", "hepkg:evidence:c57adedd63276b0a43997bb2", "hepkg:evidence:d74a951e0d725d608979014b"], "seen_values": ["2308.02285", "after", "and", "background", "background_method", "background_uses_method", "backgrounds", "contributions", "control", "corrected", "data", "dedicated", "derived", "distribution", "estimated", "evaluated", "fixed", "from", "hepkg:background_method:data-control-sample-normalization", "hepkg:background_method:mc-simulation-validated-control-samples", "hepkg:background_method:qcd-multijet-control-region-method", "hepkg:background_method:qcd-multijet-simulation-method", "hepkg:background_method:singletop-svmass-tail-normalization", "hepkg:background_method:wjets-total-yield-normalization", "inverted", "isolation", "jets", "mass", "matches", "multijet", "normalization", "normalized", "predicted", "qcd", "regions", "requirements", "samples", "simulation", "simulations", "single", "tail", "the", "top", "total", "transverse-mass", "ttbar", "using", "validated", "via", "with", "yield"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7308, "completion_tokens": 550, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 22.647290584631264, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 22.647290584631264, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7858.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 6.0, "evidence_quotes": 4.0}}
