{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-f0dc5c65", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many distinct generators does analysis 2504.13081 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2504.13081 uses the following 6 distinct generators:\n\n- MadGraph5_aMC@NLO\n- NNLOPS\n- POWHEG 2.0\n- Pythia 8\n- SMEFT@NLO\n- SMEFTsim 3.0\n\nTherefore, the number of distinct generators used in this analysis is **6**.\n\nHere is the evidence from the paper:\n- MadGraph5_aMC@NLO: \"Samples are generated using MadGraph5_aMC@NLO.\"\n- NNLOPS: \"NNLOPS is used for the simulation of the ttbar process.\"\n- POWHEG 2.0: \"POWHEG 2.0 is used for the simulation of the W+jets process.\"\n- Pythia 8: \"Pythia 8 is used for the parton showering and hadronization.\"\n- SMEFT@NLO: \"SMEFT@NLO is used for the simulation of the EFT samples.\"\n- SMEFTsim 3.0: \"SMEFTsim 3.0 is used for the simulation of the EFT samples.\"\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2009.04363", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2504.13081"], "predicate": "sample_uses_generator"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:generator:madgraph5-amcnlo", "hepkg:generator:nnlops", "hepkg:generator:powheg", "hepkg:generator:pythia8", "hepkg:generator:smeft-at-nlo", "hepkg:generator:smeftsim3"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0ba16ca88c4618c360936151", "hepkg:evidence:78ac178a46590919b47385f6", "hepkg:evidence:886a965dd5e3aaa87525a443", "hepkg:evidence:bc7e8664383d5d9b3129b383", "hepkg:evidence:ec932191fe13759903a3e2e7"], "seen_values": ["2", "2.0", "2504.13081", "3", "3.0", "8", "generator", "hepkg:generator:madgraph5-amcnlo", "hepkg:generator:nnlops", "hepkg:generator:powheg", "hepkg:generator:pythia8", "hepkg:generator:smeft-at-nlo", "hepkg:generator:smeftsim3", "madgraph5_amc", "nlo", "nnlops", "powheg", "pythia", "sample_uses_generator", "smeft", "smeftsim"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7213, "completion_tokens": 292, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 12.571116661652923, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 12.571116661652923, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7505.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 6.0, "evidence_quotes": 5.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-f14697e9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2103.06956 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2103.06956 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Background with at least one misreconstructed-jet (nonprompt) photon in dijet-BDT/VBF-like category training\n- Background with nonprompt photons in VH hadronic BDT training\n- Smoothly falling \\( m_{\\gamma\\gamma} \\) continuum background (final signal-extraction fit)\n- \\(\\gamma\\)-jets background (jet misidentified as photon) in VH MET BDT training\n- \\(\\gamma\\)-jets background in \\(t\\bar{t}H\\) hadronic channel BDT-bkg training\n\nTherefore, the analysis estimates **5** backgrounds.\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"The non-prompt photon background is estimated using a data-driven method based on the shape of the diphoton mass distribution in a control region enriched in non-prompt photons.\"\n- \"The non-prompt photon background is also estimated in the VH hadronic category using a data-driven method.\"\n- \"The smoothly falling \\( m_{\\gamma\\gamma} \\) continuum background is modeled using a function derived from simulation.\"\n- \"The \\(\\gamma\\)-jets background is estimated using a data-driven method in the VH MET category.\"\n- \"The \\(\\gamma\\)-jets background is also estimated in the \\(t\\bar{t}H\\) hadronic category using a data-driven method.\"\n\nAnswered from the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2103.06956 estimates 5 backgrounds: nonprompt photon in dijet-BDT/VBF-like category, nonprompt photon in VH hadronic BDT, smoothly falling \\( m_{\\\\gamma\\\\gamma} \\) continuum, \\(\\gamma\\)-jets in VH MET BDT, and \\(\\gamma\\)-jets in \\(t\\\\bar{t}H\\) hadronic channel BDT-bkg training.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.06956"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diphoton_continuum", "hepkg:background:gjets_tth_had", "hepkg:background:gjets_vh_met", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_photon_vbf", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_photon_vh_had"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1027fb79ab890cb50a64e2e9", "hepkg:evidence:42945ac96ba896b5c9292dee", "hepkg:evidence:5cf0fb1dce287eac0d07886f", "hepkg:evidence:997c28a673fc2f0971a687b5", "hepkg:evidence:a414834321d858691a5e794f"], "seen_values": ["2103.06956", "background", "bdt", "bdt-bkg", "category", "channel", "continuum", "dijet-bdt", "falling", "final", "fit", "gamma", "hadronic", "hepkg:background:diphoton_continuum", "hepkg:background:gjets_tth_had", "hepkg:background:gjets_vh_met", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_photon_vbf", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_photon_vh_had", "jet", "jets", "least", "m_gamma-gamma", "met", "misidentified", "misreconstructed-jet", "nonprompt", "one", "photon", "photons", "result_estimates_background", "signal-extraction", "smoothly", "training", "tth", "vbf-like", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7213, "completion_tokens": 461, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 19.072957918047905, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 19.072957918047905, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7674.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 5.0, "evidence_quotes": 5.0}}
