{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-f1f9f76d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many quantities does analysis 2102.01444 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2102.01444 reports 6 quantities:\n\n- \\( S_{\\text{obs}}^{95} \\) with values 3.2 events and 7.6 events\n- \\( \\sigma_{\\text{vis}} \\) with values 0.023 fb, 0.05 fb, 0.06 fb, and 0.08 fb\n\nThese quantities are reported in the following units:\n- \\( S_{\\text{obs}}^{95} \\) in events\n- \\( \\sigma_{\\text{vis}} \\) in femtobarns (fb)\n\nEach quantity is supported by verbatim quotes from the paper. For example, one of the \\( \\sigma_{\\text{vis}} \\) values is reported as:\n\n> \"The visible cross section is \\( \\sigma_{\\text{vis}} = 0.023 \\) fb.\"\n\nThis information is derived from the paper with arXiv ID 2102.01444.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2102.01444 reports 6 quantities: - \\( S_{\\\\text{obs}}^{95} \\\\) with values 3.2 events and 7.6 events - \\( \\\\sigma_{\\\\text{vis}} \\\\) with values 0.023 fb, 0.05 fb, 0.06 fb, and 0.08 fb. These quantities are reported in the following units: - \\( S_{\\\\text{obs}}^{95} \\\\) in events - \\( \\\\sigma_{\\\\text{vis}} \\\\) in femtobarns (fb). Each quantity is supported by verbatim quotes from the paper. For example, one of the \\( \\\\sigma_{\\\\text{vis}} \\\\) values is reported as: > \\\"The visible cross section is \\( \\\\sigma_{\\\\text{vis}} = 0.023 \\\\) fb.\\\" This information is derived from the paper with arXiv ID 2102.01444.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2102.01444"], "predicate": "result_reports_quantity"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}], "sets": {}, "entity