{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-f29fd4c6", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2401.05299 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2401.05299 defines 20 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- Calorimeter isolation < 20% of electron pT\n- Calorimeter isolation < 30% of muon pT\n- Dressed by adding four-momenta of radiated photons within cone of size dR=0.1 (excluding photons from hadron decays)\n- For pT < 60 GeV and |eta| < 2.4, jet must pass Tight JVT working point\n- Loose or Medium muon identification working point\n- Loose or Tight electron identification working point\n- Not originating from a hadron in the MC event record, directly or via tau decay\n- Tagged if jet contains a ghost-associated b-hadron with pT > 5 GeV\n- Track-based isolation I_R/pT < 0.15\n- Vector sum of pT of all neutrinos not from hadron decays\n- anti-kt R=0.4 PFlow jets with pT > 25 GeV and |eta| < 2.5\n- anti-kt R=0.4 jets with pT >= 25 GeV and |eta| < 2.5\n- b-tagging working point corresponding to 85%, 77%, 70%, or 60% average expected b-quark jet efficiency\n- pT > 10 GeV; |eta_cluster| < 2.47, excluding 1.37 < |eta_cluster| < 1.52\n- pT > 10 GeV; |eta| < 2.5\n- pT >= 10 GeV; |eta| < 2.47, excluding LAr transition region 1.37 < |eta| < 1.52\n- pT >= 10 GeV; |eta| < 2.5\n- |d0/sigma(d0)| < 3\n- |d0/sigma(d0)| < 5\n- |z0 sin(theta)| < 0.5 mm\n\nThese selections are detailed in the paper and are used to define the objects used in the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2401.05299 defines 20 object selection requirements. These include various criteria for electrons, muons, jets, and other detector objects.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.05299"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:14bd63050a0ac197b2ea9471", "hepkg:evidence:257f02697cf7c59f1fea6cd0", "hepkg:evidence:35e20c2bd48af0b3b04cdeb6", "hepkg:evidence:4180921ef4e30b81036c7d99", "hepkg:evidence:451bcb50afd94dc8477a3641", "hepkg:evidence:5a6abb34a455865b3d6655ec", "hepkg:evidence:6ed96500ae259591ccca2037", "hepkg:evidence:705d0183cd155c382801d847", "hepkg:evidence:83ed37389233b0f87848ae58", "hepkg:evidence:9b24be51e985aea4f286b3d9", "hepkg:evidence:b4f32c2bf7fbfabacb1ce46e", "hepkg:evidence:b5889ead56a665360aa98347", "hepkg:evidence:b6553b37ceba7ec13770d859", "hepkg:evidence:e21a07f36829f3e35ae73afb", "hepkg:evidence:e7283b0b0dbf77bb27e60a70", "hepkg:evidence:fedce43f7b2a4dfdbe4ff208"], "seen_values": ["0", "0.1", "0.15", "0.4", "0.5", "1", "1.37", "1.52", "10", "2", "2.4", "2.47", "2.5", "20", "2401.05299", "25", "3", "30", "5", "6", "60", "7", "70", "77", "85", "adding", "all", "and", "anti-kt", "average", "b-hadron", "b-quark", "b-tagging", "calorimeter", "cone", "contains", "corresponding", "decay", "decays", "directly", "dressed", "efficiency", "electron", "eta", "eta_cluster", "event", "excluding", "expected", "for", "four-momenta", "from", "gev", "ghost-associated", "hadron", "i_r", "identification", "isolation", "jet", "jets", "jvt", "lar", "loose", "medium", "muon", "must", "neutrinos", "none", "not", "object_has_selection", "originating", "pass", "pflow", "photons", "point", "radiated", "record", "region", "sigma", "sin", "size", "sum", "tagged", "tau", "the", "theta", "tight", "track-based", "transition", "vector", "via", "with", "within", "working"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8081, "completion_tokens": 584, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 24.876479086000472, "error": ""}, "scores": {"