{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-f2ae90e8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2007.02873 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2007.02873 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- Alternative W+HF matrix-element sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO+Pythia8)\n- Alternative Wt parton-shower sample (Powheg+Herwig++)\n- Alternative diboson sample (Powheg+Herwig++)\n- Alternative diboson sample (Powheg+Pythia8)\n- Alternative ttbar matrix-element sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO+Pythia8)\n- Alternative ttbar parton-shower sample (Powheg+Herwig7)\n- Nominal ttbar MC sample (Powheg-Box v2 + Pythia 8.230)\n- Single top quark s-channel background sample\n- Single top quark t-channel background sample\n- W+jets MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\n- Wt single-top MC sample\n- Z/γ*→ll MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\n- Z→νν MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\n- gg→VV diboson MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.2)\n- gg→ZH signal MC sample\n- qq→WH signal MC sample\n- qq→WW diboson MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\n- qq→WZ diboson MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\n- qq→ZH signal MC sample\n- qq→ZZ diboson MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\n\nThese samples cover a range of processes including diboson production, single top production, and various signal and background processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873", "2402.08486"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2007.02873"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson_alt_powheg_herwigpp", "hepkg:sample:diboson_alt_powheg_pythia8", "hepkg:sample:gg_vv_nominal", "hepkg:sample:signal_ggzh", "hepkg:sample:signal_qqwh", "hepkg:sample:signal_qqzh", "hepkg:sample:single_top_schannel", "hepkg:sample:single_top_tchannel", "hepkg:sample:single_top_wt", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_alt_