{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-f4d1f19c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which statistical methods does analysis 2312.04450 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2312.04450 uses the following statistical methods:\n\n- $\\chi^{2}$ compatibility test between unfolded distributions and predictions\n- Bayesian statistical framework (EFTfitter/BAT.jl multimodal Gaussian likelihood) for SMEFT fit\n- Beeston-Barlow \"lite\" technique for limited MC sample-size statistical uncertainties\n- Profile likelihood unfolding (PLU) for particle-level differential cross-sections\n- Profile-likelihood fit (inclusive $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross-section extraction)\n- Profiled chi-square fit combining $f_{\\mathrm{SM}}$ measurements (spin correlation)\n- Tikhonov (second-derivative) regularisation of unfolding\n- p-value test for compatibility between combined and per-channel cross-section measurements\n\nThese methods are documented in the paper with the arXiv ID 2312.04450.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2111.08340", "2312.04450", "2401.05299"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2312.04450"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:bayesian-eftfitter-batjl", "hepkg:method:beeston-barlow-lite", "hepkg:method:chi2-compatibility-test", "hepkg:method:p-value-channel-compatibility", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-inclusive", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-unfolding", "hepkg:method:profiled-chi2-fit-spin-correlation", "hepkg:method:tikhonov-regularisation"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:494209d1d7baa50c15c9aecd", "hepkg:evidence:58763da9da056e9bfe83cf5c", "hepkg:evidence:78b9847c373cec552ce973a4", "hepkg:evidence:79972dedf69b0b8d02b47a02", "hepkg:evidence:a561ec84798bd23786