{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-f4daa2e5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2605.14245 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2605.14245 defines 20 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- \"2 jets with |eta|<2.4, pT>30 GeV, pileup-jet ID veto, 60<m_jj<120 GeV\"\n- \">=2 jets, leading jet pT>40 GeV, subleading jet pT>30 GeV\"\n- \">=2 jets, m_jj>350 GeV, leading jet pT>40 GeV, subleading jet pT>30 GeV, |eta|<4.7 for both jets\"\n- \"R9>0.8 OR Iso_ch/pT<0.3 OR Iso_ch<20 GeV\"\n- \"diphoton invariant mass fit range 100 < m < 180 GeV\"\n- \"diphoton invariant mass m < 180 GeV\"\n- \"diphoton invariant mass m > 100 GeV\"\n- \"diphoton vertex classified as 'correct' if within 1 cm of the true interaction point; two vertex scenarios (correct/incorrect) used to subdivide categories\"\n- \"electron veto: photon candidate not matched to an electron track (except conversion-compatible tracks)\"\n- \"exactly one reconstructed lepton\"\n- \"exactly two same-flavor leptons with dilepton mass 60<m_ll<120 GeV, consistent with Z decay\"\n- \"leading photon pT > 35 GeV\"\n- \"leading photon pT/m > 1/3; subleading photon pT/m > 1/4\"\n- \"loose photon identification BDT (photon-vs-jet classifier)\"\n- \"p_T^miss > 50 GeV and Delta(phi) between diphoton system and p_T^miss > 2 radians\"\n- \"photon lies within ECAL fiducial region, excluding barrel-endcap transition 1.44<|eta|<1.57\"\n- \"small H/E ratio required\"\n- \"subleading photon pT > 25 GeV\"\n- \"two jets with pT>30 GeV, no m_jj requirement applied\"\n- \"zero reconstructed leptons (lepton veto)\"\n\nThese selections are detailed in the paper and are used to define the objects and events considered in the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2605.14245 defines 20 object selection requirements. These include criteria for jets, photons, leptons, and missing transverse energy, among others.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2605.14245"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:09f3f4a0d1db7cf3cc7bae7b", "hepkg:evidence:112a01e6ee312ca64a8e8515", "hepkg:evidence:1335d9730ca95dedf8092324", "hepkg:evidence:2d113c983660adf56e117acf", "hepkg:evidence:37b57e94a2e0b42c30677aff", "hepkg:evidence:6b06c6744bce0b55fb592070", "hepkg:evidence:730ab10e1e9a592f09964bf7", "hepkg:evidence:989fce51213d1b815296bc95", "hepkg:evidence:b01e7c967d2c8cccf0d39490", "hepkg:evidence:be44bbf80618273dd45a0a9d"], "seen_values": ["0.3", "0.8", "1", "1.44", "1.57", "100", "12", "120", "18", "180", "2", "2.4", "20", "25", "2605.14245", "3", "30", "35", "350", "4", "4.7", "40", "5", "50", "6", "60", "9", "and", "applied", "barrel-endcap", "bdt", "between", "both", "candidate", "categories", "classified", "classifier", "consistent", "conversion-compatible", "correct", "decay", "delta", "dilepton", "diphoton", "ecal", "electron", "eta", "exactly", "except", "excluding", "fiducial", "fit", "for", "gev", "identification", "incorrect", "interaction", "invariant", "iso_ch", "jet", "jets", "leading", "lepton", "leptons", "lies", "loose", "m_jj", "m_ll", "mass", "matched", "miss", "none", "not", "object_has_selection", "one", "p_t", "phi", "photon", "photon-vs-jet", "pileup-jet", "point", "radians", "range", "ratio", "reconstructed", "region", "required", "requirement", "same-flavor", "scenarios", "small", "subdivide", "subleading", "system", "the", "track", "tracks", "transition", "true", "two", "used", "vertex", "veto", "with", "within", "zero"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_