{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-f4de23f9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2207.00348 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2207.00348 targets 11 physics processes:\n\n- Electroweak vector boson fusion Higgs boson production (VBF)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a single top quark (tH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a top quark pair (ttH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a vector boson (VH)\n- WH associated production\n- ZH associated production (qq/qg→ZH, gg→ZH)\n- bbH production (Higgs boson production in association with a bb pair)\n- Gluon-gluon fusion (ggF) Higgs boson production\n- tHW production\n- tHqb production\n\nThis information is directly extracted from the paper 2207.00348.\n\nAnswer: 11 physics processes.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2207.00348 targets 11 physics processes, including VBF, tH, ttH, VH, WH, ZH, bbH, ggF, tHW, and tHqb production.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956", "2207.00348", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.00348"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.022}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:bbh", "hepkg:process:ggf", "hepkg:process:th", "hepkg:process:thqb", "hepkg:process:thw", "hepkg:process:tth", "hepkg:process:vbf", "hepkg:process:vh", "hepkg:process:wh", "hepkg:process:zh"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:14635c80d8f10aa2ca382e79", "hepkg:evidence:14fba303805398e44c40aac8", "hepkg:evidence:195450bd9d9c550af8dab605", "hepkg:evidence:1f9455681c699f9c07937a35", "hepkg:evidence:b068f8d0457bc61bc552c544", "hepkg:evidence:d93e496aaa7424c1696d686f", "hepkg:evidence:e862333290598aa0903d411d", "hepkg:evidence:eaca5fe2d84206a85e79b139"], "seen_values": ["2207.00348", "associated", "association", "bbh", "boson", "electroweak", "fusion", "ggf", "gluon-gluon", "hepkg:process:bbh", "hepkg:process:ggf", "hepkg:process:th", "hepkg:process:thqb", "hepkg:process:thw", "hepkg:process:tth", "hepkg:process:vbf", "hepkg:process:vh", "hepkg:process:wh", "hepkg:process:zh", "higgs", "pair", "physics_process", "production", "quark", "result_targets_process", "single", "thqb", "thw", "top", "tth", "vbf", "vector", "with"], "verification_score": 0.5, "unsupported_claims": ["11"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7472, "completion_tokens": 304, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 13.287008656188846, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 13.287008656188846, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7776.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 0.5, "unsupported_claims": 1.0, "count_correct": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 10.0, "evidence_quotes": 8.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-f50218a5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2605.14245 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2605.14245 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Nonresonant SM diphoton production background\n- Resonant VBF, VH and ttH background in the ggH analysis\n- Resonant ggH and ttH background in the HVV analysis\n- gamma+jet / jet+jet background with jets misidentified as photons\n\nTherefore, the analysis estimates **4** backgrounds.\n\nHere is the evidence for each background:\n\n- Nonresonant SM diphoton production background: \"Nonresonant SM diphoton production background\"\n- Resonant VBF, VH and ttH background in the ggH analysis: \"Resonant VBF, VH and ttH background in the ggH analysis\"\n- Resonant ggH and ttH background in the HVV analysis: \"Resonant ggH and ttH background in the HVV analysis\"\n- gamma+jet / jet+jet background with jets misidentified as photons: \"gamma+jet / jet+jet background with jets misidentified as photons\"\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2605.14245"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:gamma_jet_jetjet_misid", "hepkg:background:nonresonant_diphoton", "hepkg:background:resonant_ggh_tth_hvv_analysis", "hepkg:background:resonant_vbf_vh_tth_gganalysis"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:12a547ad51f62f84398250f5", "hepkg:evidence:3539179c8007cf1ee5ec9c2a", "hepkg:evidence:50718e7525883525d2c5a878", "hepkg:evidence:7ad88082142491edd20bc36e", "hepkg:evidence:d4d65eec14163df5d5ecf1ea"], "seen_values": ["2605.14245", "analysis", "and", "background", "diphoton", "gamma", "ggh", "hepkg:backg