{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-fc4dea5e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2207.12246 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2207.12246 measures the following observables:\n\n- ALFA-based absolute luminosity calibration factor \\( x_L \\)\n- Differential elastic pp cross section \\( \\frac{d\\sigma_{\\text{el}}}{dt} \\)\n- Extrapolated (full phase space) nuclear elastic cross section\n- Integrated luminosity of the \\( \\beta^* = 2.5 \\) km high-\\( \\beta^* \\) run\n- Nuclear slope curvature parameter \\( C \\)\n- Nuclear slope curvature parameter \\( D \\)\n- Nuclear slope parameter \\( B \\)\n- Observed (fiducial-volume) total elastic cross section\n- Ratio of elastic to total cross section \\( \\frac{\\sigma_{\\text{el}}}{\\sigma_{\\text{tot}}} \\)\n- Total Higgs boson production cross section \\( \\sigma_{\\text{tot}} \\)\n- Total inelastic cross section\n- \\( \\rho \\)-parameter (Re/Im ratio of forward elastic amplitude)\n\nThese observables are recorded in the graph based on the content of the paper 2207.12246.\n\nAnswered from the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2207.12246 measures the following observables:\\n\\n- ALFA-based absolute luminosity calibration factor \\( x_L \\)\\n- Differential elastic pp cross section \\( \\\\frac{d\\\\sigma_{\\\\text{el}}}{dt} \\)\\n- Extrapolated (full phase space) nuclear elastic cross section\\n- Integrated luminosity of the \\( \\\\beta^* = 2.5 \\\\) km high-\\( \\\\beta^* \\) run\\n- Nuclear slope curvature parameter \\( C \\)\\n- Nuclear slope curvature parameter \\( D \\)\\n- Nuclear slope parameter \\( B \\)\\n- Observed (fiducial-volume) total elastic cross section\\n- Ratio of elastic to total cross section \\( \\\\frac{\\\\sigma_{\\\\text{el}}}{\\\\sigma_{\\\\