{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-fcab0d42", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2401.07090 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2401.07090 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- \\( B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi(\\rightarrow e^+e^-) K^+ \\)\n- \\( B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi(\\rightarrow \\mu^+\\mu^-) K^+ \\)\n- \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\psi(2S)(\\rightarrow e^+e^-) K^+ \\)\n- \\( B^+ \\rightarrow \\psi(2S)(\\rightarrow \\mu^+\\mu^-) K^+ \\)\n- \\( B^\\pm \\rightarrow K^\\pm e^+e^- \\) (nonresonant)\n- \\( B^\\pm \\rightarrow K^\\pm \\mu^+\\mu^- \\) (nonresonant)\n\nThese processes involve the decay of \\( B \\) mesons into various final states, including \\( J/\\psi \\) and \\( \\psi(2S) \\) resonances decaying to electron or muon pairs, and nonresonant decays to kaons and lepton pairs.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2401.07090"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.07090"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.021}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:bp_to_jpsi_k_ee", "hepkg:process:bp_to_jpsi_k_mumu", "hepkg:process:bp_to_psi2s_k_ee", "hepkg:process:bp_to_psi2s_k_mumu", "hepkg:process:bpm_to_kpm_ee", "hepkg:process:bpm_to_kpm_mumu"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:06cab622cbaaf5f0b97eba50", "hepkg:evidence:7b4bbd1b7a86c6100fc267ab", "hepkg:evidence:970971c5c9cd211609c4c4b8", "hepkg:evidence:cdd1a789273697b8bd3029dd", "hepkg:evidence:e8235200c7fb3891044402f3"], "seen_values": ["2", "2401.0709", "2401.07090", "hepkg:process:bp_to_jpsi_k_ee", "hepkg:process:bp_to_jpsi_k_mumu", "hepkg:process:bp_to_psi2s_k_ee", "hepkg:process:bp_to_psi2s_k_mumu", "hepkg:process:bpm_to_kpm_ee", "hepkg:process:bpm_to_kpm_mumu", "nonresonant", "physics_process", "result_targets_proc