{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-fce39d87", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2508.13900 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2508.13900 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- $Z/\\gamma^{*}$ (Z+jets) simulated sample\n- Diboson (VV) background sample (WW, ZZ, WZ, WH, ZH incl. Higgs to diboson)\n- QCD multijet background sample\n- Single top quark (ST) background sample (s-channel, t-channel, tW-associated)\n- T2bW (top squark pair production, decay via intermediate chargino to W boson)\n- T2cc (top squark pair production, decay via charm quark)\n- T2tt (top squark pair production, decay via top quark)\n- TChiSlepSnu (chargino pair production via intermediate slepton/sneutrino)\n- TChiWW (chargino pair production, decay via W bosons)\n- TChiWZ (associated chargino-neutralino production, decay via W/Z bosons)\n- TSlepSlep (direct slepton pair production)\n- Triboson (VVV) background sample\n- W+jets background MC sample\n- ttbar+X+jets background sample (ttbar+jets, dilepton/single-lepton, and ttbar+boson)\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various backgrounds and signal processes in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2106.01676", "2112.03161", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2402.08486", "2503.19420", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2508.13900"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:model:t2bw", "hepkg:model:t2cc", "hepkg:model:t2tt", "hepkg:model:tchislepsnu", "hepkg:model:tchiww", "hepkg:model:tchiwz", "hepkg:model:tslepslep", "hepkg:sample:diboson", "hepkg:sample:qcd-multijet", "hepkg:sample:single-top", "hepkg:sample:triboson", "hepkg:sample:ttx-jets", "hepkg:sample:wjets", "hepkg:sampl