{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-fdda346f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2111.08340 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2111.08340 targets 6 distinct physics processes: Associated production with a top quark-antiquark pair (ttH), associated production with a weak vector boson (VH), gluon-gluon fusion (ggF) Higgs boson production, H → b b̄ decay, inclusive Higgs boson production (ggF+VBF+VH+ttH) at large transverse momentum, and vector-boson fusion (VBF) Higgs boson production.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2111.08340"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2111.08340"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.02}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:H-to-bb", "hepkg:process:VBF-production", "hepkg:process:VH-production", "hepkg:process:ggF-production", "hepkg:process:higgs-boson-production-highpt", "hepkg:process:ttH-production"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:5a485a3aa45fcfdfe7eeb0bf", "hepkg:evidence:93dd10889756bd1bd2a6cfc8", "hepkg:evidence:98ab18c7319e7956ba2eaab8", "hepkg:evidence:c1cda0a4cee09bcb4e9d7417", "hepkg:evidence:c476cb77061a35ed495a96f9", "hepkg:evidence:e5fbbd240229027fcdfcfdf4"], "seen_values": ["2111.0834", "2111.08340", "associated", "bbar", "boson", "decay", "fusion", "ggf", "gluon-gluon", "hepkg:process:ggf-production", "hepkg:process:h-to-bb", "hepkg:process:higgs-boson-production-highpt", "hepkg:process:tth-production", "hepkg:process:vbf-production", "hepkg:process:vh-production", "higgs", "inclusive", "large", "momentum", "pair", "physics_process", "production", "quark-antiquark", "result_targets_process", "top", "transverse", "tth", "vbf", "vector", "vector-boson", "weak", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7258, "completion_tokens": 484, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 19.98936245497316, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 19.98936245497316, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7742.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 6.0, "evidence_quotes": 6.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-fdf155eb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2503.19420 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2503.19420 defines 20 object selection requirements. Here are some examples:\n\n- Cut-based identification: Medium working point\n- Electron charge identification selector (ECIDS) BDT applied (same-sign 2l channel and 3l zero-SFOS subregion)\n- Isolation: FCLoose working point (4l channel)\n- Isolation: Loose_VarRad working point (4l channel)\n- Isolation: PLImprovedTight working point (2l, 3l channels)\n- Jet-vertex-tagger (JVT) pile-up rejection applied for 20 < p_T < 60 GeV and |eta| < 2.4\n- Likelihood identification: Tight (2l, 3l channels) / Medium (4l channel)\n- Negative vector sum of p_T of selected leptons and jets plus unassociated tracks from the primary vertex\n- Object-based E_T^miss significance S_miss used to reject mis-reconstructed E_T^miss\n- Unambiguous e/gamma reconstruction required (2l, 3l channels only)\n- anti-k_t algorithm, R=0.4, particle-flow objects as input\n- p_T > 10 GeV (baseline for lepton counting, common to all channels)\n- p_T > 20 GeV and |eta| < 4.5 (analysis kinematic acceptance)\n- p_T > 20 GeV, |eta| < 2.5, identified via DL1r neural-network discriminant at 85% average b-jet tagging efficiency working point\n- p_T > 30 GeV for the purpose of jet counting\n- |eta| < 2.47, excluding 1.37 < |eta| < 1.52 (barrel-endcap transition)\n- |eta| < 2.5\n- |z0 sin(theta)| < 0.5 mm and |d0|/sigma_d0 < 3\n- |z0 sin(theta)| < 0.5 mm and |d0|/sigma_d0 < 5\n\nThese selections are detailed in the paper and are used to define the objects used in the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2503.19420 defines 20 object selection requirements. These include various cuts on lepton and jet properties, isolation criteria, and other selection criteria to ensure the quality of the reconstructed objects.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2503.19420"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 19, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:00781eb89fa197d64ee80cc9", "hepkg:evidence:02ab8bbe7867e231e3e0b84e", "hepkg:evidence:04688c6b3fd2069af093ba0f", "hepkg:evidence:0ebbf5f547efc921ce3ee535", "hepkg:evidence:186c85b15d10b78c11ccd092", "hepkg:evidence:1f639855137e67a8b2f796c2", "hepkg:evidence:2769d732ee4317d9bdcaf2a3", "hepkg:evidence:2c60065fb9ac7893d73c2bc7", "hepkg:evidence:5fa39cc2a4bd1a04b270ac6e", "hepkg:evidence:83ce6ea4c00031dc7f109893", "hepkg:evidence:94bb2d72c67e7e70c2dee2d0", "hepkg:evidence:af90b614b9b896f9aafe1e47", "hepkg:evidence:c75684461da656f074b037d2", "hepkg:evidence:cf250099fc2a7750be72be52", "hepkg:evidence:d18362f337440a9af86a6b40", "hepkg:evidence:fb85e36de795bae4c9c509d3"], "seen_values": ["0", "0.4", "0.5", "1", "1.37", "1.52", "10", "2", "2.4", "2.47", "2.5", "20", "2503.1942", "2503.19420", "3", "30", "4", "4.5", "5", "6", "60", "85", "acceptance", "algorithm", "all", "analysis", "and", "anti-k_t", "applied", "average", "b-jet", "barrel-endcap", "baseline", "bdt", "channel", "channels", "charge", "common", "counting", "cut-based", "discriminant", "dl1r", "e_t", "ecids", "efficiency", "electron", "eta", "excluding", "fcloose", "for", "from", "gamma", "gev", "identification", "identified", "input", "isolation", "jet", "jet-vertex-tagger", "jets", "jvt", "kinematic", "lepton", "leptons", "likelihood", "loose_varrad", "medium", "mis-reconstructed", "miss", "negative", "neural-network", "none", "object-based", "object_has_selection", "objects", "only", "p_t", "particle-flow", "pile-up", "plimprovedtight", "plus",