{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-fe0001e1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2303.15340 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2303.15340 require the following detector objects:\n\n- $b$-tagged jet (MV2c10, 70% efficiency working point)\n- Particle-level (dressed) electron\n- Particle-level (dressed) muon\n- Reconstructed electron\n- Reconstructed muon\n\nThese objects are essential for defining the event regions in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2402.08486"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2303.15340"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:bjet_reco", "hepkg:object:electron_particle", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:muon_particle", "hepkg:object:muon_reco"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:795a064f5b9841384a582126", "hepkg:evidence:8810fe339bf2dd0fc3b5e108", "hepkg:evidence:eab5374abed9ef0dfd33ca0d", "hepkg:evidence:f10ddc851c14660dd829725f"], "seen_values": ["-tagged", "2303.1534", "2303.15340", "7", "70", "detector_object", "dressed", "efficiency", "electron", "hepkg:object:bjet_reco", "hepkg:object:electron_particle", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:muon_particle", "hepkg:object:muon_reco", "jet", "muon", "mv2c10", "particle-level", "point", "reconstructed", "region_requires_object", "working"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7162, "completion_tokens": 126, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 6.099118711892515, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 6.099118711892515, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7288.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.