{"run_id": "20260803T113606-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-fe8baac9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2206.09466 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2206.09466 measures the following observables:\n\n- Compatibility (p-value) of measured signal strengths / STXS cross sections with the SM prediction\n- Global Higgs boson signal strength modifier \\( \\mu = \\\\frac{\\sigma B(H \\\\to WW)}{\\sigma B(H \\\\to WW)_{\\text{SM}}} \\)\n- Observed (expected) significance of Higgs boson signal per production mode in \\( H \\\\to WW \\)\n- Production-mode-specific signal strength modifiers (\\( \\mu_{ggH} \\), \\( \\mu_{VBF} \\), \\( \\mu_{WH} \\), \\( \\mu_{ZH} \\)) in \\( H \\\\to WW \\)\n- STXS Stage 1.2 differential production cross section of \\( H \\\\to WW \\), \\( \\sigma(H \\\\to WW) \\) per STXS bin\n- Coupling modifier to vector bosons (\\( \\kappa_V \\))\n- Coupling modifier to fermions (\\( \\kappa_f \\))\n\nThese observables are recorded in the graph based on the content of the paper 2206.09466.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.04363", "2206.09466"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2206.09466"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:observed-significance", "hepkg:observable:signal-strength-mu", "hepkg:observable:signal-strength-per-mode", "hepkg:observable:sm-compatibility-pvalue", "hepkg:observable:stxs-xsec", "hepkg:parameter:kappa-f", "hepkg:parameter:kappa-v"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:23fa7e2c444a3f66690414b8", "hepkg:evidence:58994335af562fdbc57a5459", "hepkg:evidence:8e3cb2cdcd987e391fe62e92", "hepkg:evidence:9649f20faf70badce8ec8ab9", "hepkg:evidence:9ce72e783feeec62cee7ca30", "hepkg:evidence:ca0cea6cf8f93722df910815", "he